INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:521655652','Infisical','{"deployment": ["官方自托管文档提供Docker Compose部署方案", "本记录未验证部署运行"], "features": ["在项目与环境中组织应用密钥", "为工作负载提供集中密钥读取接口"], "github_repository_id": 521655652, "homepage": "https://infisical.com", "id": "github:521655652", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方 Machine identities 文档把 application/script/workload 定义为无用户账户的一等机器身份：每个身份有角色、一个或多个 auth method，登录后获得短期 access token；支持令牌撤销、身份锁定、凭据过期告警和删除身份即撤销全部令牌。仓库 MIT 核心的 backend/src/services 下含 identity/identity-ua 等服务目录，Docker Compose 自托管文档证明完整 Web 应用形态；仅主张机器身份子模块，不扩展到密钥管理或证书生命周期。", "slug": "machine-identity-management", "source_urls": ["https://infisical.com/docs/documentation/platform/identities/machine-identities", "https://github.com/Infisical/infisical", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Infisical/infisical/main/LICENSE", "https://api.github.com/repos/Infisical/infisical/contents/backend/src/services?ref=main", "https://infisical.com/docs/self-hosting/deployment-options/docker-compose"]}, {"reason": "README将其定位为管理secrets、证书和密钥的平台，形成客户维护自身受保护凭据及应用访问流程的控制工作台。", "slug": "secrets-management", "source_urls": ["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Infisical/infisical/main/README.md"]}], "license": "MIT", "license_evidence_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Infisical/infisical/main/LICENSE", "license_review": {"rationale": "核对LICENSE明确说明ee目录依ee/LICENSE另行许可，仓库其余内容按MIT Expat条款授权。", "reviewer": "source_research", "scope": "community_core", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Infisical/infisical/main/LICENSE", "spdx_id": "MIT"}, "name": "Infisical", "repository_url": "https://github.com/Infisical/infisical", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:04:44.245772+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "cb0d995600179ba7452f0f72a8bcfca4bedbbdb58cbb0637252238227c68ba7b", "snapshot_path": "sources/cb0d995600179ba7452f0f72a8bcfca4bedbbdb58cbb0637252238227c68ba7b.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Infisical/infisical/contents/backe