7fadb1b94d812abbe72af964939334542f3d9d31091c29334d98675780b", "snapshot_path": "sources/11f9f7fadb1b94d812abbe72af964939334542f3d9d31091c29334d98675780b.txt", "url": "https://docs.ghost.org/members"}], "summary": "作者拥有的在线出版平台：默认站点主页是按时间倒序的帖子流，每篇帖子拥有以{slug}定义的独立永久链接，并提供按标签/作者归档、会员和订阅内容能力。", "technology_stack": ["Node.js/TypeScript服务端应用", "官方README提供容器/自托管资料"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:2889328','WordPress','{"deployment": ["官方安装文档说明可自托管安装；本次未部署。"], "features": ["文章、页面、媒体等内容类型管理", "主题和插件扩展", "发布并管理网站内容"], "github_repository_id": 2889328, "homepage": "https://wordpress.org", "id": "github:2889328", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "WordPress官方功能页的Publish with Ease说明可创建Posts与Pages、插入媒体并一键发布；Publishing Tools说明草稿、定时发布、修订以及公开/私有/密码保护；Easy Theme System与Theme System说明同一内容由主题模板呈现；Custom Content Types说明可定义自定义post类型、分类与元数据，配合User Management角色构成结构化内容与编辑后台。安装文档说明登录wp-admin后台并通过Appearance切换主题。", "slug": "content-management-system-cms", "source_urls": ["https://wordpress.org/about/features/", "https://wordpress.org/documentation/article/first-steps-with-wordpress/"]}], "license": "GPL-2.0-or-later", "license_evidence_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/WordPress/wordpress/master/license.txt", "license_review": {"rationale": "仓库license API未判定SPDX；官方仓库根目录完整license.txt声明GPL第2版或更高版本，依全文条款核对。", "reviewer": "round-06-02 researcher", "scope": "repository", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/WordPress/wordpress/master/license.txt", "spdx_id": "GPL-2.0-or-later"}, "name": "WordPress", "repository_url": "https://github.com/WordPress/wordpress", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-23T19:24:32.165+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "c99fdad044816cc8a26872949283291d945746bbcdf794899e43f8eb47548788", "snapshot_path": "sources/c99fdad044816cc8a26872949283291d945746bbcdf794899e43f8eb47548788.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/WordPress/wordpress"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-23T19:24:53.398+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "177fb66c0e48baf3d21f7de2aabdfbfa8dd19aad511b713df684c2d4684edf76", "snapshot_path": "sources/177fb66c0e48baf3d21f7de2aabdfbfa8dd19aad511b713df684c2d4684edf76.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/WordPress/wordpress/license"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-23T19:27:51.704+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "49e97f629ce763abb2f8f1f13da74cb5a8a9a72a0e72a7477