INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:105977976','WAPT Community','{"deployment": ["自托管 WAPT 服务器（社区版）", "官方文档提供服务器、控制台与代理安装说明"], "features": ["通过 WAPT 包在受管终端上静默安装/更新/移除软件", "维护终端已安装软件与配置状态", "控制台按机器查看部署任务与包状态"], "github_repository_id": 105977976, "homepage": "https://wapt.fr", "id": "github:105977976", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "README 称其为软件部署工具，支持在受管终端静默安装/更新/移除软件并维护已安装软件状态；官方文档显示按机器查看 Host Tasks 与 Host Packages 的 OK/Update/Error 状态，对应软件包、部署分配和每设备执行结果核心。社区版仓库为 1.8.2 存档。", "slug": "application-deployment-management", "source_urls": ["https://api.github.com/repos/tranquilit/WAPT", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tranquilit/WAPT/branch-1.8.2/README.md", "https://www.wapt.fr/en/doc-2.7/quickstart-wapt-manage-package.html"]}], "license": "GPL-3.0", "license_evidence_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tranquilit/WAPT/branch-1.8.2/COPYING.txt", "license_review": {"rationale": "COPYING.txt 正文声明 WAPT Community 以 GPLv3 授权并附完整 GPLv3 条款；据此将范围限定为社区版核心，不延伸至商业版功能。", "reviewer": "collection-agent", "scope": "community_core", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tranquilit/WAPT/branch-1.8.2/COPYING.txt", "spdx_id": "GPL-3.0"}, "name": "WAPT Community", "repository_url": "https://github.com/tranquilit/WAPT", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-26T13:29:40.547629+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "99149b91aaba6950e172f9e8b864bb74242e9f4ba4fdce86bc303016743e0c1d", "snapshot_path": "sources/99149b91aaba6950e172f9e8b864bb74242e9f4ba4fdce86bc303016743e0c1d.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/tranquilit/WAPT"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-26T13:29:41.715191+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "509a72e0f6c4bd13187ac238370d56455af2d85c41737c3c92f7b18b75f6e5ac", "snapshot_path": "sources/509a72e0f6c4bd13187ac238370d56455af2d85c41737c3c92f7b18b75f6e5ac.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tranquilit/WAPT/branch-1.8.2/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-26T13:29:43.273486+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "ba9b