存、SDS 与危险废物模块：按容器跟踪化学品从入库到处置，并以废物概况、储存时间、累积区、桶跟踪和联单管理危险废物。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:respark','ReSpark','{"homepage": "https://respark.com/", "id": "commercial:respark", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官网正文列明 scale ticketing（称重、分级、收据）、实时商品库存、purchasing & sales orders 与出库单据、合规报告，覆盖进场分级入库到商品出库的回收运营账本。", "slug": "recycling-operations-management", "source_urls": ["https://respark.com/"]}], "name": "ReSpark", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-26T23:06:56.883852+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "de902244de22eb2244b92d9673e362eb9b6039363a97446546312aead8ac9cc8", "snapshot_path": "sources/de902244de22eb2244b92d9673e362eb9b6039363a97446546312aead8ac9cc8.txt", "url": "https://respark.com/"}], "summary": "商业废料/金属回收堆场运营平台（官网公告收购 ScrapRight）：称量票、称重分级与收据、商品库存、采购/销售与出库单据、合规报告和多堆场财务，围绕进场物料到可销售商品的双边账本。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:waste-logics','Waste Logics','{"homepage": "https://wastelogics.com/", "id": "commercial:waste-logics", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官网正文说明以报价、工单、路线、计费与报告连接废物运营，司机现场记录异常（照片、GPS、工单）并据此结算，属于客户/地点→派车服务→现场执行→计费的清运运营商系统。", "slug": "waste-hauling-management", "source_urls": ["https://wastelogics.com/"]}], "name": "Waste Logics", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-26T23:07:01.334318+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "e64771d2dcf507460c9e62c07e6a3189ab9751dace0c168a0df2afe99ec9f729", "snapshot_path": "sources/e64771d2dcf507460c9e62c07e6a3189ab9751dace0c168a0df2afe99ec9f729.txt", "url": "https://wastelogics.com/"}], "summary": "商业废物清运/收集运营商软件：把报价、工单、路线、现场异常记录、计费和报告连成一体，服务 skip hire、trade waste、中转站/MRF 等运营形态。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:re-trac-connect','Re-TRAC Connect','{"homepage": "https://www.re-trac.com/", "id": "commercial:re-trac-connect", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官网正文明确为废物/回收数据管理 SaaS，面向政府机构与企业，提供 hauler reporting、facility reporting、tonnage tracking、合规报告和 diversion performance，符合废物产生方/市政的项目台账与报告平台。", "slug": "waste-management-platform", "source_urls": ["https://www.re-trac.com/"]}], "name": "Re-TRAC Connect", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-26T23:05:53.823756+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "d4189d04a6868d45c1a39c5c557c919a36c2f4474f18732be0596409eb67cab6", "snapshot_path": "sources/d4189d04a6868d45c1a39c5c557c919a36c2f4474f18732be0596409eb67cab6.txt", "url": "https://www.re-trac.com/"}], "summary": "面向政府与企业/机构的废物与回收数据 SaaS：集中登记运输商、处理设施与项目数据，跟踪吨位和转移表现，生成合规与回收率报告。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:earthranger','EarthRanger','{"homepage": "https://www.earthranger.com/", "id": "commercial:earthranger", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官网正文说明从现场采集观察、回看巡逻/调查/事件、实时查看野生动物与团队、支持保护地管理和趋势分析，覆盖保护对象、事件/风险、巡护工作与监测证据闭环。", "slug": "conservation-management", "source_urls": ["https://www.earthranger.com/"]}], "name": "EarthRanger", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-26T23:05:59.258397+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "3eb75dc3a1587a29fb432708004e7fdb12397293b08737e15b77823452bcfa31", "snapshot_path": "sources/3eb75dc3a1587a29fb432708004e7fdb12397293b08737e15b77823452bcfa31.txt", "url": "https://www.earthranger.com/"}], "summary": "商业保护地运营平台：汇集现场观察、巡逻/调查/事件、GPS 跟踪与多源传感器数据，用于保护地管理、威胁响应、趋势分析和行动规划；官方称对保护地免费使用。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:ecaremd-ccm','eCareMD Chronic Care Management','{"homepage": "https://www.ecaremd.com/chronic-care-management-software.html", "id": "commercial:ecaremd-ccm", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "eCareMD 官方产品页明确其用于端到端运行 Medicare CCM：自动核验 2+ 慢病资格、收集并保存数字同意、提供 20+ 条件化护理计划模板、自动记录每月 CCM 服务时间并生成 CPT 计费文档，对应资格、同意注册、护理计划与循环记录服务四段核心。", "slug": "chronic-care-management", "source_urls": ["https://www.ecaremd.com/chronic-care-management-software.html"]}], "name": "eCareMD Chronic Care Management", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-26T23:16:26.780356+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "98d37870e856e8b86cc78352f1c06f0697386a9e52f6465c96e3c3b729a36c1c", "snapshot_path": "sources/98d37870e856e8b86cc78352f1c06f0697386a9e52f6465c96e3c3b729a36c1c.txt", "url": "https://www.ecaremd.com/chronic-care-management-software.html"}], "summary": "eCareMD 是面向 Medicare 慢性病管理项目的商业 CCM 软件，覆盖资格核验、数字同意与注册、条件化护理计划、月度服务时间记录及 CMS 计费文档。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:fresenius-tdms','Fresenius Medical Care Therapy Data Management System (TDMS)','{"homepage": "https://freseniusmedicalcare.com/en/healthcare-professionals/digital-solutions/therapy-data-management-system-tdms", "id": "commercial:fresenius-tdms", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "Fresenius Medical Care TDMS 官方产品页明确其服务于透析中心与医院，支持透析治疗处方与设备预设置、透析前/后体重记录、治疗过程及治疗中检验/用药记录、治疗与用药排程、临床数据管理和报告，覆盖处方—治疗会话的透析临床数据管理；页面未展示患者名册 admission→active→discharge 生命周期或持久纵向治疗史，故不据此主张完整中心运营或纵向记录核心。", "slug": "dialysis-center-management", "source_urls": ["https://freseniusmedicalcare.com/en/healthcare-professionals/digital-solutions/therapy-data-management-system-tdms"]}], "name": "Fresenius Medical Care Therapy Data Management System (TDMS)", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-26T23:14:32.784425+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "11124a4b55d641d8b3b131b0acdfcdffbff070a59e26868c0bcefbc3c4b1becc", "snapshot_path": "sources/11124a4b55d641d8b3b131b0acdfcdffbff070a59e26868c0bcefbc3c4b1becc.txt", "url": "https://freseniusmedicalcare.com/en/healthcare-professionals/digital-solutions/therapy-data-management-system-tdms"}], "summary": "Fresenius Medical Care TDMS 是面向透析中心与医院的商业临床数据管理软件，支持透析治疗处方、设备预设置、治疗过程记录、检验与用药记录及治疗文档。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:wellsoft-edis','Wellsoft EDIS','{"homepage": "https://www.medsphere.com/solutions/emergency-department-edis", "id": "commercial:wellsoft-edis", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "Wellsoft EDIS 官方产品页明确其为急诊科专用 ED EHR/EDIS，提供从 pre-arrival 到 disposition 的实时患者跟踪、triage 与 fast-track 部门视图、CPOE 医嘱及结果回传、出院计划，符合以急诊就诊和部门跟踪状态为核心的 EDIS 定义。", "slug": "emergency-department-information-system", "source_urls": ["https://www.medsphere.com/solutions/emergency-department-edis"]}], "name": "Wellsoft EDIS", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-26T23:14:32.558610+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "132f9f309e9740b3afb5fb4a3900c91909c5801f5034af7883895a592f927f41", "snapshot_path": "sources/132f9f309e9740b3afb5fb4a3900c91909c5801f5034af7883895a592f927f41.txt", "url": "https://www.medsphere.com/solutions/emergency-department-edis"}], "summary": "Wellsoft EDIS 是面向医院急诊科的商业 ED EHR/EDIS，提供实时患者跟踪、分诊与快速通道视图、CPOE 医嘱与结果回传、出院计划等急诊就诊管理能力。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:1211634422','CareSync','{"deployment": ["Node 18+ 与 Supabase（要求 EU region）", "前后端分别安装启动，可自托管为 PWA"], "features": ["住户/service user 记录与支持计划、同意及目标", "数字 MAR：append-only，记录 given/refused/pending", "药品库存随给药自动扣减与低库存提醒", "班次任务板、交接备注与审计轨迹"], "github_repository_id": 1211634422, "homepage": "https://github.com/djsmacker01/CareSync", "id": "github:1211634422", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方 README 明确其面向住宿照护机构，提供住户记录、支持计划、append-only 数字 MAR、班次任务与审计轨迹，构成长期护理场景以住户为中心的持续护理记录和给药闭环；未扩展到结构化评估/再评估引擎。", "slug": "long-term-care-ehr", "source_urls": ["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/djsmacker01/CareSync/main/README.md"]}], "license": "AGPL-3.0", "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/djsmacker01/CareSync/license", "name": "CareSync", "repository_url": "https://github.com/djsmacker01/CareSync", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-26T23:21:59.724900+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "381bbcb66d5c9a8d16d236a4cea537026b1c5b775f5da1d7e26317b082e0605c", "snapshot_path": "sources/381bbcb66d5c9a8d16d236a4cea537026b1c5b775f5da1d7e26317b082e0605c.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/djsmacker01/CareSync"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-26T23:22:01.667519+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "b02401dab4f4a1a4b97c9868a66e76785469388d4a873c69d07399a7b292d422", "snapshot_path": "sources/b02401dab4f4a1a4b97c9868a66e76785469388d4a873c69d07399a7b292d422.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/djsmacker01/CareSync/license"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-26T23:22:03.142929+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "2be0fe795678b55ba49dd65270960982746401eca57eab339b0ca11082757598", "snapshot_path": "sources/2be0fe795678b55ba49dd65270960982746401eca57eab339b0ca11082757598.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/djsmacker01/CareSync/main/README.md"}], "summary": "CareSync 是面向小型英国住宿照护机构的开源护理管理系统，以住户记录、支持计划、数字用药管理记录（MAR）和班次任务为核心，并提供审计轨迹。", "technology_stack": ["React 19", "Node.js/Express", "PostgreSQL/Supabase", "PWA"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:127197836','Open-eObs','{"deployment": ["以 Odoo 模块集合提供", "需 Odoo、PostgreSQL 9.3，并安装 nh_eobs_mobile 或 nh_eobs_mental_health 模块", "可自托管"], "features": ["移动端提交血糖、EWS、神经科、体位血压等护理观察", "病区仪表板、患者 acuity board、患者记录与报告", "患者就诊管理、护理人员分配", "逾期任务列表与病区工作量看板"], "github_repository_id": 127197836, "homepage": "https://github.com/AppertaFoundation/openeobs", "id": "github:127197836", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方 README 明确其为医院电子观察、病区管理和任务管理软件，覆盖床旁护理观察记录、病区看板、患者分配、班次任务与工作量，匹配护理信息系统的护理记录与班次操作层；未主张未证明的护理计划/出院全流程。", "slug": "nursing-information-system", "source_urls": ["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AppertaFoundation/openeobs/master/README.md"]}], "license": "AGPL-3.0", "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/AppertaFoundation/openeobs/license", "name": "Open-eObs", "repository_url": "https://github.com/AppertaFoundation/openeobs", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-26T23:22:06.322905+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "f0749ce196bed5b3d0ea4383e79736b7a6acaf6ff179f74c41a508adfa2e11f8", "snapshot_path": "sources/f0749ce196bed5b3d0ea4383e79736b7a6acaf6ff179f74c41a508adfa2e11f8.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/AppertaFoundation/openeobs"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-26T23:22:09.498054+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "faac27af4e037e6a23254c58633af5d10fe561b4544c6594d9cabf488f9058e8", "snapshot_path": "sources/faac27af4e037e6a23254c58633af5d10fe561b4544c6594d9cabf488f9058e8.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/AppertaFoundation/openeobs/license"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-26T23:22:11.137894+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "e0dc97a7d214c7ab9e1d54c378284811ecf203ea0d6c98208a95db98198ab6ee", "snapshot_path": "sources/e0dc97a7d214c7ab9e1d54c378284811ecf203ea0d6c98208a95db98198ab6ee.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AppertaFoundation/openeobs/master/README.md"}], "summary": "Open-eObs 是面向急性与精神科医院的开源电子观察、病区管理和任务管理应用，支持移动端护理观察、病区看板、患者 acuity 与护理人员分配。", "technology_stack": ["Python", "Odoo", "PostgreSQL"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:21764480','CareCode Open HMIS','{"deployment": ["Java EE 兼容应用服务器（如 Payara/GlassFish）", "MySQL 或 MariaDB 数据库", "按机构环境自托管"], "features": ["Operating Theatre：手术排程、术前文书、术中记录、麻醉与专业费用结算", "住院/门诊、ADT 与护理文书", "Appointment & Theatre Management", "EMR、药房、检验与影像等 HMIS 模块"], "github_repository_id": 21764480, "homepage": "https://carecode.lk/", "id": "github:21764480", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "住院药房模块把药房、转运在途与病区库存，住院处方/领药与药师审核发药，护士给药事件及退药放在同一审计链上；可按批次和有效期扣减，符合药品库存—患者用药方案—已核验给药事件三部分核心。产品整体为医院信息系统，属定义中的 EHR 嵌入式药房模块形态。", "slug": "medication-management-platform", "source_urls": ["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/wiki/hmislk/hmis/Inpatient-Pharmaceutical-Management.md", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/wiki/hmislk/hmis/Ward-Medication-Administration-and-Stock-Deduction.md", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hmislk/hmis/development/README.md", "https://carecode.lk"]}, {"reason": "官方站点明确 Operating Theatre 模块覆盖手术排程、术前文书、术中记录、麻醉与费用结算，README 亦列出 Appointment & Theatre Management；按完整 HMIS 中的手术室模块记录，不主张未证明的实时当日手术间看板。", "slug": "operating-room-management", "source_urls": ["https://carecode.lk/", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hmislk/hmis/development/README.md"]}], "license": "GPL-3.0", "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/hmislk/hmis/license", "license_review": {"rationale": "仓库 LICENSE 与 GitHub license API 均为 GPL-3.0 完整文本；官网历史段落仍称 MIT，属于不一致的站点文案，按仓库当前许可证记录并留档。", "reviewer": "opencode-go/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "scope": "repository", "source_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/hmislk/hmis/license", "spdx_id": "GPL-3.0"}, "name": "CareCode Open HMIS", "repository_url": "https://github.com/hmislk/hmis", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-26T23:22:00.288648+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "dd692c1a732a9a41f36c35e18978cf26b38cf27e40c5167880b8d05d0de32cd2", "snapshot_path": "sources/dd692c1a732a9a41f36c35e18978cf26b38cf27e40c5167880b8d05d0de32cd2.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/h