ense", "sha256": "c71d239df91726fc519c6eb72d318ec65820627232b2f796219e87dcf35d0ab4", "snapshot_path": "sources/c71d239df91726fc519c6eb72d318ec65820627232b2f796219e87dcf35d0ab4.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fossasia/eventyay-exhibition/dev/LICENSE"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-27T01:09:17.996589+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "9918f8ac08b2026e1d57ce93265206727fffb23b904cb3941c1bc1d2686d38cc", "snapshot_path": "sources/9918f8ac08b2026e1d57ce93265206727fffb23b904cb3941c1bc1d2686d38cc.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fossasia/eventyay-exhibition/dev/exhibition/urls.py"}], "summary": "Eventyay 的参展商与赞助商管理插件：组织方管理参展商、赞助商、展位与参展申请，参展商通过邀请或访问密钥自助维护参展资料、凭证与线索扫描设备。", "technology_stack": ["Python", "Django"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
