INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:1314049369','Studio OS','{"deployment": ["Docker Compose 单容器部署，SQLite 单文件持久化", "或使用 Node.js 22+ 直接运行；可离线，无需 CDN 或构建步骤"], "features": ["公开课程表与访客预约，签署免责声明后可自助取消", "课程包（credits）、会员（无限或每月次数）与单次入场", "原子容量控制、FIFO 候补自动递补与取消窗口策略", "管理端名单/签到、客户、手工销售、收入与出勤报表", "教练受限登录，按课查看名单并签到"], "github_repository_id": 1314049369, "homepage": "https://github.com/Booyaka101/studio-os", "id": "github:1314049369", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "以公开课程表、有限名额预约、原子容量与 FIFO 候补递补为核心循环；取消释放名额后自动再提供，符合课程预约的名额经济。", "slug": "fitness-class-booking", "source_urls": ["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Booyaka101/studio-os/main/README.md"]}], "license": "MIT", "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Booyaka101/studio-os/license", "name": "Studio OS", "repository_url": "https://github.com/Booyaka101/studio-os", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-27T02:19:47.407146+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "3ca765375279edb70165c8f7356a3df2f423f248c1e7830609bc0f3703b9cadd", "snapshot_path": "sources/3ca765375279edb70165c8f7356a3df2f423f248c1e7830609bc0f3703b9cadd.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Booyaka101/studio-os"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-27T02:19:48.654448+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "9391f6f7c5209a386d2adc0bf5f98e8789e20bad4474f064f055a3a6af9401f9", "snapshot_path": "sources/9391f6f7c5209a386d2adc0bf5f98e8789e20bad4474f064f055a3a6af9401f9.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Booyaka101/studio-os/license"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-27T02:19:59.869725+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "66dcd662620a058e75e94649b9c4f1498c465a5927dd01d61e008c4573162e65", "snapshot_path": "sources/66dcd662620a058e75e94649b9c4f1498c465a5927dd01d61e008c4573162e65.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Booyaka101/studio-os/main/README.md"}], "summary": "面向精品工作室的开源自托管预约应用，核心是公开课程表与按名额预约，并配套课程包/会员权益、候补递补、签到与收入/出勤报表。", "technology_stack": ["Node.js 22+", "EJS + HTMX + Pico.css（本地 vendored）", "SQLite（better-sqlite3