INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:1106797061','Structurizr','{"deployment": ["官方 Docker 镜像运行 local 或 server 命令并浏览器访问", "local 仅允许 localhost 访问，不含认证与协作功能", "server 为自托管发布方式；官方说明开源核心可源码免费构建，预构建二进制的企业功能需许可证"], "features": ["以 DSL 定义软件架构模型", "从单一模型生成多张架构视图", "架构模型与决策文档", "浏览器查看与调整图表布局"], "github_repository_id": 1106797061, "homepage": "https://docs.structurizr.com", "id": "github:1106797061", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方 README 与 DSL 文档说明以文本 DSL 定义单一软件架构模型并生成多张 C4 架构图；server 文档与 quickstart 补充自托管 Web 应用形态。", "slug": "software-architecture-modeling", "source_urls": ["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/structurizr/structurizr/main/README.md", "https://docs.structurizr.com/dsl", "https://docs.structurizr.com/local", "https://docs.structurizr.com/server", "https://docs.structurizr.com/server/quickstart"]}], "license": "Apache-2.0", "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/structurizr/structurizr/license", "name": "Structurizr", "repository_url": "https://github.com/structurizr/structurizr", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-24T22:33:42.257271+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "ef49da51700c0038695ef4a919675b635d369d442b9fdc251842612b1a7a18f3", "snapshot_path": "sources/ef49da51700c0038695ef4a919675b635d369d442b9fdc251842612b1a7a18f3.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/structurizr/structurizr"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-24T22:34:16.695466+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "1b2e2bf56bca3872c095cdb0b5f439cbc203258761c0f9b142fc9d173fffc227", "snapshot_path": "sources/1b2e2bf56bca3872c095cdb0b5f439cbc203258761c0f9b142fc9d173fffc227.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/structurizr/structurizr/license"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-24T22:35:14.672380+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "c645c42422a3638fc7573e11fc85cbe0d77decc085c6fb71b797fa4992a0d3cd", "snapshot_path": "sources/c645c42422a3638fc7573e11fc85cbe0d77decc085c6fb71b797fa4992a0d3cd.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/structurizr/structurizr/main/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-28T23:19:31.182499+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "cfddd6e317524322e800e325907722b0a0ea6910e9292a3c73eca3894cf28317", "snapshot_path": "sources/cfddd6e317524322e800e325907722b0a0ea6910e9292a3c73eca3894cf28317.txt", "url": "https://docs.structurizr.com/dsl"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-28T23:19:32.036586+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "50de4f5e8022a4048382336e3961fd880f108db42598fb8320208da1af4ac7fe", "snapshot_path": "sources/50de4f5e8022a4048382336e3961fd880f108db42598fb8320208da1af4ac7fe.txt", "url": "https://docs.structurizr.com/local"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-28T23:20:59.665160+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "eeb18951c4f971d46c4611641face03e533b783cb893a7bfff2bb3027b497f5d", "snapshot_path": "sources/eeb18951c4f971d46c4611641face03e533b783cb893a7bfff2bb3027b497f5d.txt", "url": "https://docs.structurizr.com/server"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-28T23:20:43.198194+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "92d4d65b086953020467eb23b6281f575938fedd3625d06cffab42923f44fd38", "snapshot_path": "sources/92d4d65b086953020467eb23b6281f575938fedd3625d06cffab42923f44fd38.txt", "url": "https://docs.structurizr.com/server/quickstart"}], "summary": "以单一软件架构模型生成多张 C4 架构图与文档的建模工具，提供本地查看与自托管发布方式。", "technology_stack": ["Java", "Web应用", "Docker"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:440752086','Coder','{"deployment": ["自托管服务端：安装脚本或发行版二进制启动 coder server，默认打开 http://localhost:3000 创建首个用户与 Docker 模板；生产环境可配 PostgreSQL 与外部访问 URL", "工作区由控制面通过 Terraform 在所选基础设施上配置；本轮未部署或运行"], "features": ["用 Terraform 模板定义工作区基础设施（EC2 虚拟机、Kubernetes Pod、Docker 容器等）", "用户从模板在自己的账号下创建工作区，团队成员获得配置与资源一致的相同环境", "空闲工作区自动关机，并可按计划自动启停以节省成本", "以模板版本为真源更新工作区：运行中的工作区先停止、重建、再启动", "编辑器从环境外部接入：官方提供 VS Code 扩展、JetBrains 插件，其余可用 SSH/终端连接", "支持 devcontainer.json：可自动发现仓库中的 Dev Containers 或用 coder_devcontainer 资源在模板内显式启动"], "github_repository_id": 440752086, "homepage": "https://coder.com", "id": "github:440752086", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方 README 与控制面文档证明 Coder 是自托管工作区平台：模板（Terraform）是环境的版本化真源，控制面据此配置、启动、停止并按模板更新或销毁工作区，空闲自动关机；工作区内部署 devcontainer.json（可自动发现或用 coder_devcontainer 启动）；编辑体验仍在外部，官方只提供 VS Code 扩展与 JetBrains 插件等接入方式。环境是产品本体、编辑器不是，符合本叶核心，且为可自托管的完整应用服务而非纯客户端。", "slug": "dev-container-workspace-platform", "source_urls": ["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/coder/coder/main/README.md", "https://coder.com/docs/user-guides/workspace-management.md", "https://coder.com/docs/user-guides/workspace-lifecycle.md", "https://coder.com/docs/admin/templates.md", "https://coder.com/docs/admin/integrations/devcontainers/integration.md"]}], "license": "AGPL-3.0", "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/coder/coder/license", "license_review": {"rationale": "GitHub license API 返回 spdx_id AGPL-3.0 并附完整许可证正文；仓库根 LICENSE 全文同为 AGPL-3.0，仅 enterprise 目录另附源可用许可，故按开源核心范围记录。", "reviewer": "source_research", "scope": "community_core", "source_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/coder/coder/license", "spdx_id": "AGPL-3.0"}, "name": "Coder", "repository_url": "https://github.com/coder/coder", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-28T23:30:08.384486+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "12efd0de505c5eef5b7fcd80a69402b92f122332fefbfcea12d1bcf025bdf77d", "snapshot_path": "sources/12efd0de505c5eef5b7fcd80a69402b92f122332fefbfcea12d1bcf025bdf77d.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/coder/coder"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-28T23:30:10.999448+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "3a5b8add747f1d78904dfbd8e0f2ee461ca29bce9950a5e58c877947c9447514", "snapshot_path": "sources/3a5b8add747f1d78904dfbd8e0f2ee461ca29bce9950a5e58c877947c9447514.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/coder/coder/main/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-28T23:34:53.070046+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "20e3a26017675a7c9b91620750b75747c5187ec237ad9a45de2a312b4ec74b6c", "snapshot_path": "sources/20e3a26017675a7c9b91620750b75747c5187ec237ad9a45de2a312b4ec74b6c.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/coder/coder/license"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-28T23:30:25.787639+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "8486a10c4393cee1c25392769ddd3b2d6c242d6ec7928e1414efff7dfb2f07ef", "snapshot_path": "sources/8486a10c4393cee1c25392769ddd3b2d6c242d6ec7928e1414efff7dfb2f07ef.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/coder/coder/main/LICENSE"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-28T23:31:26.405589+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "119e595d2ccd1fe0bc9660b575f1e486c40e2ffc7523429d3b8c7d8161791d86", "snapshot_path": "sources/119e595d2ccd1fe0bc9660b575f1e486c40e2ffc7523429d3b8c7d8161791d86.txt", "url": "https://coder.com/docs/user-guides/workspace-management.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-28T23:32:11.454855+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "b3060821ba737c40c908222d97003209f3fc4d5b1de4b75a0223c02e2985a2d9", "snapshot_path": "sources/b3060821ba737c40c908222d97003209f3fc4d5b1de4b75a0223c02e2985a2d9.txt", "url": "https://coder.com/docs/user-guides/workspace-lifecycle.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-28T23:31:25.776464+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "7671a8b10fbcdf8a66468150a0c1bbc8339306c17d06e931c98d62bf4d5f519f", "snapshot_path": "sources/7671a8b10fbcdf8a66468150a0c1bbc8339306c17d06e931c98d62bf4d5f519f.txt", "url": "https://coder.com/docs/admin/templates.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-28T23:32:39.057966+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "8c896280a0b70edaa781cb10861795d97447781b0db7b659619c0596d7a691d1", "snapshot_path": "sources/8c896280a0b70edaa781cb10861795d97447781b0db7b659619c0596d7a691d1.txt", "url": "https://coder.com/docs/admin/integrations/devcontainers/integration.md"}], "summary": "Coder 是自托管的开发工作区平台开源核心：用 Terraform 模板定义并配置可丢弃的云端开发环境，用户从 Web 控制台/CLI 创建工作区，再用自有 IDE 或 SSH 接入；仓库主线为 AGPL-3.0。", "technology_stack": ["Terraform", "Dev Containers", "Docker", "Kubernetes"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:638951438','Opik','{"deployment": ["官方 README 与 self-host 文档提供 Docker Compose 本地部署与 Kubernetes/Helm 自托管，含 server 后端与 Web 应用；本轮未部署"], "features": ["用数据集保存测试用例（输入与 expected_output），对 agent/LLM 应用运行评估任务", "逐案评分：内置启发式指标（如 ExactMatch）与 LLM-as-a-judge 指标；支持对工具调用、记忆检索、计划、中间消息等 agent 步骤级评分，预置或自定义指标均可", "一次评估作为 experiment 持久化保存，记录 evaluation task 配置（经 experiment_config 存 prompt 模板与模型参数），并可与 prompt 版本关联", "在 Web UI 中下钻单个用例，并把多个 experiment 并排比较；提供 annotation queue 做人工评分"], "github_repository_id": 638951438, "homepage": "https://www.comet.com/site/products/opik/", "id": "github:638951438", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方 Evaluate your agent 文档给出完整链路：为 agent/LLM 应用定义 evaluation task（通过 SDK track/集成钩子接入被测 agent），用 Dataset 保存含 expected 的测试用例，选择启发式或 LLM-as-a-judge 指标对每个用例评分，调用 evaluate() 生成持久化 experiment 并以 experimentId 返回；experiment_config 记录 prompt 模板与模型参数，prompt 版本可关联到 experiment，且在 Opik UI 中可下钻用例并并排比较多个 experiment。官方 Evaluate agents 文档另述对 agent 步骤（工具调用、记忆检索、计划、中间消息）逐项评分，并给出完整的工具选择质量评估 experiment 示例（数据集 + 自定义 metric + evaluation task + evaluate 记录），以及人工 feedback/annotation queue。README 与 self-host 文档说明该评估与比较界面是自托管的完整平台（server 后端 + Web 应用，Docker Compose/Helm），而非仅 CLI。", "slug": "agent-evaluation-platform", "source_urls": ["https://www.comet.com/docs/opik/evaluation/advanced/evaluate_your_llm", "https://www.comet.com/docs/opik/evaluation/evaluate_agents", "https://www.comet.com/docs/opik/evaluation/overview", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/comet-ml/opik/main/README.md", "https://www.comet.com/docs/opik/self-host/overview"]}, {"reason": "官方 README 与评估文档明确：以数据集与实验组织测试用例，运行 LLM 应用并对输出自动评分（30+ 指标、LLM-as-a-judge、自定义指标），实验记录持久保存并可在仪表盘对比不同应用版本，构成“被测应用→数据集→评分→持久可比较运行”的完整评估工作流。", "slug": "llm-evaluation-platform", "source_urls": ["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/comet-ml/opik/main/README.md", "https://www.comet.com/docs/opik/evaluation/overview/"]}], "license": "Apache-2.0", "license_evidence_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/comet-ml/opik/main/LICENSE", "license_review": {"rationale": "GitHub raw LICENSE text was fetched and read: Apache License Version 2.0 full text with END OF TERMS AND CONDITIONS and the ''limitations under the License'' appendix, copyright Comet ML, Inc.", "reviewer": "source_research", "scope": "repository", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/comet-ml/opik/main/LICENSE", "spdx_id": "Apache-2.0"}, "name": "Opik", "repository_url": "https://github.com/comet-ml/opik", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-28T23:32:08.633459+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "5e33a34fc51c2e101e969f8b6dd95f12608b1af8d04bd36c8a2f6543337f6322", "snapshot_path": "sources/5e33a34fc51c2e101e969f8b6dd95f12608b1af8d04bd36c8a2f6543337f6322.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/comet-ml/opik"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-28T23:32:10.384791+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "0236cf0195e033d15c120e610d44943e8e478ffed5d60fbba1b5a6b96e778a47", "snapshot_path": "sources/0236cf0195e033d15c120e610d44943e8e478ffed5d60fbba1b5a6b96e778a47.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/comet-ml/opik/main/LICENSE"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-28T23:32:27.567171+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "f4fffa79c792d196ae93d61ea7a3c503ff16821007543bb2ffda8b4ae3fcf716", "snapshot_path": "sources/f4fffa79c792d196ae93d61ea7a3c503ff16821007543bb2ffda8b4ae3fcf716.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/comet-ml/opik/main/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-28T23:32:29.136768+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "ac90a55296353659ee067f465e2678bd59ee1c9392cc356f75d1e5250006f412", "snapshot_path": "sources/ac90a55296353659ee067f465e2678bd59ee1c9392cc356f75d1e5250006f412.txt", "url": "https://www.comet.com/docs/opik/evaluation/overview"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-28T23:33:22.834102+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "ec51ded90926931f95b5de8e2ad662965b135729fe617cc02e88c8be8628acf2", "snapshot_path": "sources/ec51ded90926931f95b5de8e2ad662965b135729fe617cc02e88c8be8628acf2.txt", "url": "https://www.comet.com/docs/opik/evaluation/advanced/evaluate_your_llm"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-28T23:33:18.031858+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "6bf79de6435bcb602a5c2c1e1d6ccb8a5ac7c1914a8b948bd3aaac7a36846da7", "snapshot_path": "sources/6bf79de6435bcb602a5c2c1e1d6ccb8a5ac7c1914a8b948bd3aaac7a36846da7.txt", "url": "https://www.comet.com/docs/opik/evaluation/evaluate_agents"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-28T23:35:15.113526+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "245561cb940858bfe60ec521827157299fe022d3b7419b0831c9038b7c4a8093", "snapshot_path": "sources/245561cb940858bfe60ec521827157299fe022d3b7419b0831c9038b7c4a8093.txt", "url": "https://www.comet.com/docs/opik/self-host/overview"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-28T23:35:15.113076+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "1d00003a981ccfbab00e36233c05811f8826226c225d852fc0e55f705807165d", "snapshot_path": "sources/1d00003a981ccfbab00e36233c05811f8826226c225d852fc0e55f705807165d.txt", "url": "https://www.comet.com/site/products/opik/"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-28T23:32:57.017298+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "73583c0525d77493d753a0f75cb2b0dfc8889dbbb7a75e56ccb65825fcd3ec17", "snapshot_path": "sources/73583c0525d77493d753a0f75cb2b0dfc8889dbbb7a75e56ccb65825fcd3ec17.txt", "url": "https://github.com/comet-ml/opik"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-28T23:33:52.290266+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "ac90a55296353659ee067f465e2678bd59ee1c9392cc356f75d1e5250006f412", "snapshot_path": "sources/ac90a55296353659ee067f465e2678bd59ee1c9392cc356f75d1e5250006f412.txt", "url": "https://www.comet.com/docs/opik/evaluation/overview/"}], "summary": "Opik 是 Comet 开源的 LLM/agent 评估与可观测平台（Apache-2.0）：以数据集、实验与逐案评分衡量 agent 行为，可自托管完整 Web 应用（含后端），不只是客户端 SDK。", "technology_stack": ["Python", "TypeScript"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:6358188','Apache Druid','{"deployment": ["Docker 快速启动", "源码构建/集群部署", "Kubernetes（druid-operator，独立仓库）"], "features": ["多标签 SQL 查询编辑器", "Run 运行与 Preview 预览", "结果网格（Smart query limit 默认限制预览行数）", "EXPLAIN / Explain SQL query 计划", "查询历史与 Recent query tasks", "查询计时、进度条、live reports 与取消运行中查询", "浏览 Druid schema、datasource 与列"], "github_repository_id": 6358188, "homepage": "https://druid.apache.org/", "id": "github:6358188", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方 Web Console 文档正文证明 Query 视图为多标签 SQL 编辑器，可在同一界面 Run/Preview、查看结果、EXPLAIN 与查询历史，并取消或附着运行中查询；官方 Query 教程进一步证明查询“immediately runs”、结果显示为数据表、用户可在 edit pane 原地改写（WHERE/GROUP BY）后再次 Run，完整覆盖“绑定分析平台 + SQL 编辑 + 即时执行 + 结果网格 + 就地重跑”五项核心。结果默认受 Smart query limit 限制，符合“结果为预览”的规则；Query 视图属 Druid 平台自带子界面，非跨库 SQL 客户端。", "slug": "analytical-query-editor", "source_urls": ["https://druid.apache.org/docs/latest/operations/web-console/", "https://druid.apache.org/docs/latest/tutorials/tutorial-query", "https://druid.apache.org/docs/latest/querying/sql", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/apache/druid/master/README.md"]}], "license": "Apache-2.0", "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/druid/license", "name": "Apache Druid", "repository_url": "https://github.com/apache/druid", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-26T18:01:17.891301+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "c9051f4ffb3e68fb2f05b6fd94834bd8a69730255fbcf739490d25f6554dd598", "snapshot_path": "sources/c9051f4ffb3e68fb2f05b6fd94834bd8a69730255fbcf739490d25f6554dd598.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/druid"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-26T18:01:19.690082+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "7737457dc4c6273d6e39ec84d19a6cf8fa1bc89be110cec115a88650c4b6c8d5", "snapshot_path": "sources/7737457dc4c6273d6e39ec84d19a6cf8fa1bc89be110cec115a88650c4b6c8d5.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/druid/license"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-26T18:02:44.199682+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "7b785de257b98c11278ff0a86cc4e839f769d94792510bc8d626fc93a4086dc6", "snapshot_path": "sources/7b785de257b98c11278ff0a86cc4e839f769d94792510bc8d626fc93a4086dc6.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/apache/druid/master/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-26T18:01:52.144862+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "8f1622df53911828fa645ab9d5d0d8c1b720f487c56269e748e6b30692029c88", "snapshot_path": "sources/8f1622df53911828fa645ab9d5d0d8c1b720f487c56269e748e6b30692029c88.txt", "url": "https://druid.apache.org/docs/latest/operations/web-console/"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-28T23:40:44.641132+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "32ec286923f291ae5814c8b0d7cb3f8c9eb3af2f6bb61a92f61a0b607b41fa41", "snapshot_path": "sources/32ec286923f291ae5814c8b0d7cb3f8c9eb3af2f6bb61a92f61a0b607b41fa41.txt", "url": "https://druid.apache.org/docs/latest/tutorials/tutorial-query"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-28T23:40:46.580828+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "a9b32a9260f79e5bc5cdaa6c2fb7bbc2770f9f1e202b57e2dba0b0b4cd92da0e", "snapshot_path": "sources/a9b32a9260f79e5bc5cdaa6c2fb7bbc2770f9f1e202b57e2dba0b0b4cd92da0e.txt", "url": "https://druid.apache.org/docs/latest/querying/sql"}], "summary": "Apache Druid 分析数据平台自带的 Web 控制台 Query 视图：用户在同一 SQL 编辑器中编写、运行并预览针对 Druid 自身 datasource 的查询，查看结果网格、解释计划与查询历史，并可原地改写后重跑；它是平台内绑定的分析查询界面，不是跨库通用 SQL 客户端。", "technology_stack": ["Java"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:254426396','CloudBeaver Community','{"deployment": ["client-server Web 应用，需自行部署服务端；README 说明其为 web server，前端为浏览器界面", "官方 Docker 镜像（hub.docker.com/r/dbeaver/cloudbeaver），并列出 AWS Marketplace、Google Cloud、Microsoft Azure 等社区版部署方式", "官方另提供 demo.cloudbeaver.io 演示服务器"], "features": ["SQL Editor：在单一数据库连接下编写、执行多个 SQL 脚本并保存到服务端资源管理器", "Result 面板按结果集分标签展示返回行，脚本执行在 Statistics 标签给出汇总", "单条语句执行、整段脚本执行、新标签页执行与执行计划说明", "SQL Assist 关键字/对象名/代码片段补全，动态参数与脚本变量", "连接管理、数据库导航器、数据编辑器与数据导入导出"], "github_repository_id": 254426396, "homepage": "https://dbeaver.com/", "id": "github:254426396", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "README 正文说明 CloudBeaver 是 web server 形态的 Web 数据库管理器（社区版，Apache-2.0）；部署 Wiki 明确其为需要服务端部署的 client-server 应用，可直接以 Docker/云市场部署；SQL Editor 文档正文给出完整工作流：在单一数据库连接下编写并执行多条 SQL 脚本、保存脚本到服务端资源管理器、在 Result 面板检查行集、脚本执行在 Statistics 给出汇总。据此满足“连接外部数据库 → SQL 编写执行 → 可检查结果”三项核心，并以服务端部署的持续应用服务形态承载工作台，而非仅桌面客户端。", "slug": "sql-workbench", "source_urls": ["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dbeaver/cloudbeaver/devel/README.md", "https://dbeaver.com/docs/cloudbeaver/SQL-Editor/", "https://github.com/dbeaver/cloudbeaver/wiki/CloudBeaver-Deployment"]}], "license": "Apache-2.0", "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/dbeaver/cloudbeaver/license", "name": "CloudBeaver Community", "repository_url": "https://github.com/dbeaver/cloudbeaver", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-28T23:42:29.446551+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "f4f9211eecef1c8135e999f1dfcef48984ab090c28716ab0dbcf166a650e35e8", "snapshot_path": "sources/f4f9211eecef1c8135e999f1dfcef48984ab090c28716ab0dbcf166a650e35e8.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/dbeaver/cloudbeaver"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-28T23:42:38.554143+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "b91fc88aca2b6caa9f8ec0a68a0fa7f247fbb0133d799f65618946f588aa90ab", "snapshot_path": "sources/b91fc88aca2b6caa9f8ec0a68a0fa7f247fbb0133d799f65618946f588aa90ab.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/dbeaver/cloudbeaver/license"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-28T23:42:43.804902+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "420f3df98687030963878c4822e84542731d25eab07b113327f515ee61cd42e4", "snapshot_path": "sources/420f3df98687030963878c4822e84542731d25eab07b113327f515ee61cd42e4.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dbeaver/cloudbeaver/devel/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-28T23:42:46.512935+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "348b4066e46cb1fe80a8cd10d8b2139401abf1b2b39906b41e04126f5544b5ec", "snapshot_path": "sources/348b4066e46cb1fe80a8cd10d8b2139401abf1b2b39906b41e04126f5544b5ec.txt", "url": "https://dbeaver.com/docs/cloudbeaver/SQL-Editor/"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-28T23:43:37.483171+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "86999f884e0dada46314604415cb05a89c3917c0307a547797d3c1d579097890", "snapshot_path": "sources/86999f884e0dada46314604415cb05a89c3917c0307a547797d3c1d579097890.txt", "url": "https://github.com/dbeaver/cloudbeaver/wiki/CloudBeaver-Deployment"}], "summary": "CloudBeaver 社区版是开源的 Web 数据库管理与 SQL 工作台：以 client-server 形态部署（服务端 Java 应用 + 浏览器 SPA），在浏览器中连接外部运行中的数据库，用 SQL Editor 编写并执行单个语句或整段脚本，在 Result 面板检查返回行集与脚本执行统计，并把脚本保存到服务端资源管理器以便复用。", "technology_stack": ["服务端：Java 应用（README 自述 the server itself is a Java application）", "前端：TypeScript 与 React 编写的浏览器 Web 界面", "连接配置、项目与 SQL 脚本由服务端资源管理器保存"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:210579021','Apache Hop','{"deployment": ["Hop Web（Tomcat / Docker apache/hop-web）", "Hop Server", "本地引擎", "Apache Spark", "Flink/Dataflow (Apache Beam)", "hop-rest WAR"], "features": ["可视化 pipeline/workflow 设计（桌面 GUI 与浏览器版 Hop Web）", "250+ pipeline transforms 与 80+ workflow actions", "本地、Hop Server、Spark、Flink/Dataflow 多运行时", "Hop REST Web 应用提供元数据与执行 API", "Projects 与 Environments 环境切换", "数据库连接凭据不写入 pipeline"], "github_repository_id": 210579021, "homepage": "https://hop.apache.org", "id": "github:210579021", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官网正文将 Hop 定义为开源数据集成与编排平台，明确覆盖可视化 pipeline 设计、250+ 受管转换、开发到生产的环境切换，以及本地/Hop Server/Spark/Beam 多运行时执行；官方手册进一步证明服务形态：Hop Web 是浏览器版 Hop Gui（默认构建内含，Docker 镜像 apache/hop-web，Tomcat 部署，访问 /ui），Hop Server 是可启动的远程执行服务，hop-rest WAR 提供 /hop/api/v1 的元数据与执行 API。仓库元数据与许可证确认 apache/hop 身份及 Apache-2.0。因此本产品不是仅桌面/CLI/引擎，而是可持续使用的可自托管应用服务。", "slug": "etl-elt-platform", "source_urls": ["https://hop.apache.org/", "https://hop.apache.org/manual/latest/hop-gui/hop-web.html", "https://hop.apache.org/manual/latest/hop-server/index.html", "https://hop.apache.org/manual/latest/hop-rest/index.html", "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/hop", "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/hop/license", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/apache/hop/main/README.md"]}], "license": "Apache-2.0", "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/hop/license", "name": "Apache Hop", "repository_url": "https://github.com/apache/hop", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-26T18:01:42.255985+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "35b3f79dbf007a77871ce8a25994a3e742a104fecdba602b54341c01dd368d49", "snapshot_path": "sources/35b3f79dbf007a77871ce8a25994a3e742a104fecdba602b54341c01dd368d49.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/hop"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-26T18:01:42.253093+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "ce671f2fc3f4d812c1f006aa973d846ebab4545809c78f4c854a57182969cdb2", "snapshot_path": "sources/ce671f2fc3f4d812c1f006aa973d846ebab4545809c78f4c854a57182969cdb2.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/hop/license"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-26T18:02:23.664279+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "0fc26ffcb0e386182e100b199cf703cf44ee71b2493825ae1263356506c0d033", "snapshot_path": "sources/0fc26ffcb0e386182e100b199cf703cf44ee71b2493825ae1263356506c0d033.txt", "url": "https://hop.apache.org/"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-26T18:02:23.398190+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "b53d4d73c3fa39945bca51752e6caac4d504187430350b7bef4fc6684cac7fd7", "snapshot_path": "sources/b53d4d73c3fa39945bca51752e6caac4d504187430350b7bef4fc6684cac7fd7.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/apache/hop/main/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-28T23:43:54.160666+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "57b9e70d6fb8e94182f96351e745b36a25ef384e05125b5cd07cc5053e08cc5b", "snapshot_path": "sources/57b9e70d6fb8e94182f96351e745b36a25ef384e05125b5cd07cc5053e08cc5b.txt", "url": "https://hop.apache.org/manual/latest/hop-gui/hop-web.html"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-28T23:44:51.780870+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "c62b581eee77b39066ae1c06a6418fdde01db94f3e17ae241351cb793c969e63", "snapshot_path": "sources/c62b581eee77b39066ae1c06a6418fdde01db94f3e17ae241351cb793c969e63.txt", "url": "https://hop.apache.org/manual/latest/hop-server/index.html"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-28T23:43:54.673047+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "65bd6d939566b122f5186faffc8bf71233b48b368690eca27d0483416026d3a7", "snapshot_path": "sources/65bd6d939566b122f5186faffc8bf71233b48b368690eca27d0483416026d3a7.txt", "url": "https://hop.apache.org/manual/latest/hop-rest/index.html"}], "summary": "Apache Hop 是开源的数据集成与编排平台：在画布上设计 pipeline/workflow，内置 250+ pipeline transforms、80+ workflow actions 和 40+ 数据库方言；同一 pipeline 可运行在本地引擎、远程 Hop Server、Spark，或经 Apache Beam 运行于 Flink/Dataflow。除桌面 GUI 外，官方还提供浏览器版 Hop Web（Tomcat 部署，Docker 镜像 apache/hop-web，访问 /ui）与 Hop REST Web 应用（hop-rest WAR，/hop/api/v1 元数据与执行服务），构成可自托管的完整应用服务；Projects/Environments 支持从开发切换到生产，凭据不写入 pipeline。", "technology_stack": ["Java", "Apache Tomcat", "Apache Beam", "Docker"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:ibm-turbonomic','IBM Turbonomic','{"homepage": "https://www.ibm.com/products/turbonomic", "id": "commercial:ibm-turbonomic", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方产品页正文写明其对应用/容器/VM/基础设施做容量建模（capacity modeling），提供工作负载 right-sizing 数据驱动动作，并在数据中心场景回收未使用容量；对应容量状态、容量风险与容量决策核心。仅为商业基本记录。", "slug": "capacity-management", "source_urls": ["https://www.ibm.com/products/turbonomic"]}], "name": "IBM Turbonomic", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-28T23:52:40.248678+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "e0871cd10495dcc5eca69077231d506ef4ff8ac9688c6b51362684b9437dd40b", "snapshot_path": "sources/e0871cd10495dcc5eca69077231d506ef4ff8ac9688c6b51362684b9437dd40b.txt", "url": "https://www.ibm.com/products/turbonomic"}], "summary": "IBM Turbonomic 是应用资源管理（ARM）产品，持续分析应用、容器、虚拟机与基础设施的资源依赖，做工作负载 right-sizing 与容量建模，并在策略下执行扩缩容与放置动作。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:349578094','Terrakube','{"deployment": ["自托管 Web 应用服务，可用 Helm 部署到 Kubernetes，或用 Docker Compose / minikube 运行", "服务由 UI、API、Registry、Executor 组成，依赖 PostgreSQL 或 Azure SQL 数据库、Redis 与对象存储", "可直接从 Terraform / OpenTofu CLI 通过 remote backend 或 cloud block 指向该平台运行"], "features": ["以 Organization / Workspace 组织基础设施代码集合，并接入 GitHub、GitLab、Bitbucket、Azure DevOps 拉取 Terraform / OpenTofu 配置", "提供完整 Terraform 工作流：在工作区中执行 plan、apply、destroy，并展示结构化计划结果", "每个工作区持有独立状态文件，状态与运行输出保存到 S3 兼容存储、Azure Blob、GCS 或本地磁盘，可作为后续差异计算与资源查看的持久记录", "私有模块与 Provider Registry、策略即代码（OPA）、漂移检测与定时计划、PR 与 CI 触发的 plan", "通过 Dex 接入企业身份源并做组织级角色权限控制；执行器可为内置、自托管 agent 或 Kubernetes 临时 Job"], "github_repository_id": 349578094, "homepage": "https://terrakube.io/", "id": "github:349578094", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方文档说明 Terrakube 是以 Terraform/OpenTofu 运行远程 IaC 操作的自托管协作平台，配置代码保存在 VCS 并在工作区执行 plan/apply/destroy；README 说明每个工作区的状态与输出写入对象存储，官方状态文档说明状态按工作区独立保存并可在 UI 查看 JSON 与可视化资源图。声明即代码、生命周期执行、受管资源记录三项核心均由同一应用服务的正文覆盖。", "slug": "infrastructure-as-code-platform", "source_urls": ["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/terrakube-io/terrakube/main/README.md", "https://docs.terrakube.io/readme.md", "https://docs.terrakube.io/user-guide/workspaces.md", "https://docs.terrakube.io/user-guide/workspaces/terraform-state.md"]}], "license": "Apache-2.0", "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/terrakube-io/terrakube/license", "name": "Terrakube", "repository_url": "https://github.com/terrakube-io/terrakube", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-28T23:53:21.529298+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "41c6f0cbc296909db25527f258d19322efd313e87fc7691215a274195c77f85c", "snapshot_path": "sources/41c6f0cbc296909db25527f258d19322efd313e87fc7691215a274195c77f85c.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/terrakube-io/terrakube"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-28T23:53:39.037007+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "f05b4d26d1b9db2102ac33be485a9f8b929fe52f99b8411aff179d91990a26b9", "snapshot_path": "sources/f05b4d26d1b9db2102ac33be485a9f8b929fe52f99b8411aff179d91990a26b9.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/terrakube-io/terrakube/license"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-28T23:53:40.832505+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "ff62de04270c4e031c5d409cfff74b6257728d248271b257959caf9dab38c570", "snapshot_path": "sources/ff62de04270c4e031c5d409cfff74b6257728d248271b257959caf9dab38c570.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/terrakube-io/terrakube/main/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-28T23:55:50.521918+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "e5563217117bffa6a17328f5e06ab5a91731fb053edbb255cad7dd8fab1462df", "snapshot_path": "sources/e5563217117bffa6a17328f5e06ab5a91731fb053edbb255cad7dd8fab1462df.txt", "url": "https://terrakube.io/"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-28T23:55:52.324565+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "7a82c43c0aa568c3f99c546ba3341b9459afd6b5ad3dd4855b3ec5fb7a40f442", "snapshot_path": "sources/7a82c43c0aa568c3f99c546ba3341b9459afd6b5ad3dd4855b3ec5fb7a40f442.txt", "url": "https://docs.terrakube.io/readme.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-28T23:56:04.326023+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "005d0e029979e49dfcaa6bcfbc6598ca90c710d39b65aa00a279fcd1f8012b4b", "snapshot_path": "sources/005d0e029979e49dfcaa6bcfbc6598ca90c710d39b65aa00a279fcd1f8012b4b.txt", "url": "https://docs.terrakube.io/user-guide/workspaces.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-28T23:56:34.516149+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "76b4c9dfd3d9451794e3f7f01f8962b324af2bbe6366f411b94a6c777cd59381", "snapshot_path": "sources/76b4c9dfd3d9451794e3f7f01f8962b324af2bbe6366f411b94a6c777cd59381.txt", "url": "https://docs.terrakube.io/user-guide/workspaces/terraform-state.md"}], "summary": "Terrakube 是一个 Apache-2.0 开源自托管平台，用于以 Terraform 或 OpenTofu 运行远程基础设施即代码操作：在组织与工作区中托管代码、生成并执行 plan/apply/destroy，并把每个工作区的状态文件持久保存为受管资源记录。", "technology_stack": ["Java", "Spring Boot", "React"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:23267883','Semaphore UI','{"deployment": ["自托管：Docker 镜像", "Snap、二进制文件、Debian/RPM 包", "AWS/DigitalOcean/Vultr 等云市场镜像"], "features": ["可复用任务模板：Ansible、Terraform/OpenTofu/Terragrunt、Shell、PowerShell、Python", "集中任务执行、排队与并行控制，每次运行保留日志、状态、发起人与仓库修订", "主机清单（静态 INI/YAML、文件、Terraform 工作区）与目标主机管理", "Key Store 集中托管 SSH 密钥、登录密码、sudo 凭证与 Ansible Vault 密钥", "项目团队与内置角色（Owner、Manager、Task Runner、Guest）授权运行", "定时调度、Webhook 集成与通知", "REST API"], "github_repository_id": 23267883, "homepage": "https://semaphoreui.com", "id": "github:23267883", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "三根支柱均有官方正文：任务模板是平台持有、可复用的机器可读自动化定义（Ansible playbook、Terraform/OpenTofu/Terragrunt、脚本），可从 Git 仓库与任务模板文档核对；集中受管执行由清单（受管主机/工作区）与任务文档证明——任务进入队列、在平台执行器上针对清单主机运行，并保留自身日志、状态、发起人与仓库修订；治理与委托由 Key Store（集中托管 SSH 密钥、登录密码、sudo 与 Vault 凭证，运行时注入）与 Teams 文档（Owner/Manager/Task Runner/Guest 内置角色按项目授权谁能运行模板）共同证明。MIT 许可与仓库身份已由 GitHub license API 与 repository metadata 闭合，形态为可自托管 Web 应用服务。", "slug": "infrastructure-automation-platform", "source_urls": ["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/semaphoreui/semaphore/develop/README.md", "https://semaphoreui.com/docs/user-guide/task-templates", "https://semaphoreui.com/docs/user-guide/inventory", "https://semaphoreui.com/docs/user-guide/key-store", "https://semaphoreui.com/docs/user-guide/team", "https://semaphoreui.com/docs/user-guide/tasks"]}], "license": "MIT", "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/semaphoreui/semaphore/license", "name": "Semaphore UI", "repository_url": "https://github.com/semaphoreui/semaphore", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-28T23:52:40.022502+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "3724ba722161575fd31f4ac6293f60e516aa40403159b2752cbb9447d006e646", "snapshot_path": "sources/3724ba722161575fd31f4ac6293f60e516aa40403159b2752cbb9447d006e646.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/semaphoreui/semaphore"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-28T23:53:12.588751+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "8105039043a7d07f0d00680a475db1ebd5cd493d623d15a9811997a0c99e860c", "snapshot_path": "sources/8105039043a7d07f0d00680a475db1ebd5cd493d623d15a9811997a0c99e860c.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/semaphoreui/semaphore/license"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-28T23:53:12.547413+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "8459dd53516a4eeab133a212be54fe00ac04169162b28fb119415a9180fe662c", "snapshot_path": "sources/8459dd53516a4eeab133a212be54fe00ac04169162b28fb119415a9180fe662c.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/semaphoreui/semaphore/develop/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-28T23:55:07.132451+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "bb8b036e0ad6730fa497992dfb27fad2f1d8000360f49a3b0044da9444aedc81", "snapshot_path": "sources/bb8b036e0ad6730fa497992dfb27fad2f1d8000360f49a3b0044da9444aedc81.txt", "url": "https://semaphoreui.com/docs/user-guide/task-templates"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-28T23:55:09.503462+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "a35df442e8151658815f8ceb902f1a56c040ea8a05141dad4ed8495203c9f584", "snapshot_path": "sources/a35df442e8151658815f8ceb902f1a56c040ea8a05141dad4ed8495203c9f584.txt", "url": "https://semaphoreui.com/docs/user-guide/inventory"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-28T23:55:31.246626+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "38136cef47564615bc0cd06220972b7a75702ced7bc245c424a500910970a888", "snapshot_path": "sources/38136cef47564615bc0cd06220972b7a75702ced7bc245c424a500910970a888.txt", "url": "https://semaphoreui.com/docs/user-guide/key-store"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-28T23:56:05.788145+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "f73f95f51d601332acf987ba2712dd9e479d2704e0b9d1691d7f5aec30d1160a", "snapshot_path": "sources/f73f95f51d601332acf987ba2712dd9e479d2704e0b9d1691d7f5aec30d1160a.txt", "url": "https://semaphoreui.com/docs/user-guide/team"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-28T23:56:01.153588+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "cce2f8897a6b6c4bcbab531121e5e9815814ca6a42e4010bd7a3a4d2972ef823", "snapshot_path": "sources/cce2f8897a6b6c4bcbab531121e5e9815814ca6a42e4010bd7a3a4d2972ef823.txt", "url": "https://semaphoreui.com/docs/user-guide/tasks"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-28T23:55:30.932248+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "880507b188383089dd67b5fe52c9fba5a2135e8dee903f0208af6f512904dc1d", "snapshot_path": "sources/880507b188383089dd67b5fe52c9fba5a2135e8dee903f0208af6f512904dc1d.txt", "url": "https://semaphoreui.com/"}], "summary": "Semaphore UI 是 MIT 许可、可自托管的基础设施自动化平台（开源社区版即本仓库；Pro/Enterprise 另提供工作流编排、外部密钥存储与自定义角色等增强功能，核心的模板化执行、清单、凭证托管与内置项目角色在开源版中可用）。它把 Ansible playbook、Terraform/OpenTofu/Terragrunt 配置与 Shell/PowerShell/Python 脚本登记为可复用的任务模板，在平台上针对受管主机清单集中排队执行并保留每次运行的日志、状态、发起人和仓库版本；Key Store 统一托管 SSH 密钥、登录密码、sudo 凭证与 Ansible Vault 密钥，项目团队以内置角色（Owner/Manager/Task Runner/Guest）授权谁可以运行哪些模板。", "technology_stack": ["Go 后端", "Web UI", "REST API", "Ansible / Terraform / OpenTofu / Terragrunt / PowerShell 执行器"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:117503394','Roxy-WI','{"deployment": ["Self-hosted Linux packages, Docker Compose, or Kubernetes Helm chart", "Connects to existing HAProxy servers over SSH"], "features": ["Web forms and a configuration editor for HAProxy listeners and backends", "HAProxy Runtime API operations including backend server controls", "HAProxy statistics view for sessions, server states and backend health", "Configuration editing, saved-version comparison and service actions across connected HAProxy servers"], "github_repository_id": 117503394, "homepage": "https://roxy-wi.org", "id": "github:117503394", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方 README 说明 Roxy-WI 是自托管的 HAProxy Web 管理界面；官网 HAProxy 页面明确列出配置监听器与后端、通过 Runtime API 控制后端服务器、查看服务器状态与后端健康检查，符合面向操作员的负载均衡器管理应用核心。", "slug": "load-balancer-management", "source_urls": ["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/roxy-wi/roxy-wi/master/README.md", "https://roxy-wi.org/haproxy-web-interface"]}], "license": "Apache-2.0", "license_evidence_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/roxy-wi/roxy-wi/master/LICENSE", "license_review": {"rationale": "Reviewed the complete Apache License 2.0 text fetched from the official roxy-wi/roxy-wi repository; the license applies to the repository as a whole.", "reviewer": "collection-agent", "scope": "repository", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/roxy-wi/roxy-wi/master/LICENSE", "spdx_id": "Apache-2.0"}, "name": "Roxy-WI", "repository_url": "https://github.com/roxy-wi/roxy-wi", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T11:54:22.795673+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "03e5ce8388a9c86687916fd42b5edb4f8929d1f654b2c202ea5081b9dd25ab5f", "snapshot_path": "sources/03e5ce8388a9c86687916fd42b5edb4f8929d1f654b2c202ea5081b9dd25ab5f.txt", "url": "https://github.com/roxy-wi/roxy-wi"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T11:54:32.723441+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "37a23d2ae9f34de26711ee0b476ff24ceca893155a66ab41f626f8d9e263db53", "snapshot_path": "sources/37a23d2ae9f34de26711ee0b476ff24ceca893155a66ab41f626f8d9e263db53.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/roxy-wi/roxy-wi/master/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T11:54:32.594407+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "c71d239df91726fc519c6eb72d318ec65820627232b2f796219e87dcf35d0ab4", "snapshot_path": "sources/c71d239df91726fc519c6eb72d318ec65820627232b2f796219e87dcf35d0ab4.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/roxy-wi/roxy-wi/master/LICENSE"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T11:54:56.699123+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "7a84ea57b1fc401a55a9fefd50424ed345f6aa7e2467201fa703cf077f75d267", "snapshot_path": "sources/7a84ea57b1fc401a55a9fefd50424ed345f6aa7e2467201fa703cf077f75d267.txt", "url": "https://roxy-wi.org/haproxy-web-interface"}], "summary": "Roxy-WI is a self-hosted web application for managing HAProxy load balancers: operators configure listeners and backend pools, control backend servers through the HAProxy Runtime API, inspect server states and backend health, and review configuration changes.", "technology_stack": ["Python"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:129717717','Grafana Loki','{"deployment": ["单机或多租户自托管 Loki", "官方安装文档与 Helm 说明"], "features": ["HTTP 推送与 OTLP 日志接入（Alloy 等采集代理）", "压缩日志存储与标签索引", "LogQL 即时查询与时间范围查询 API", "Grafana 或 LogCLI 查询检视"], "github_repository_id": 129717717, "homepage": "https://grafana.com/oss/loki", "id": "github:129717717", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "README 说明 Loki 是日志栈中的主服务，负责存储日志和处理查询，Alloy 负责采集，Grafana/LogCLI 仅为查询客户端；官方 HTTP API 文档进一步证明 Loki 暴露推送/查询/tail 接口，含 POST /loki/api/v1/push、POST /otlp/v1/logs 摄取端点及 GET /loki/api/v1/query、/query_range 等按时间范围执行的 LogQL 查询端点。多源采集、集中持久存储、时间锚定检索三项核心均成立，且 Loki 本身是可持续自托管的服务端应用，不是纯客户端、CLI 或仅基础设施。", "slug": "log-management", "source_urls": ["https://github.com/grafana/loki", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/loki/main/README.md", "https://grafana.com/docs/loki/latest/api/"]}], "license": "AGPL-3.0-only", "license_evidence_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/loki/main/LICENSE", "license_review": {"rationale": "LICENSE 为完整 AGPL-3.0 文本；README 明确标注 AGPL-3.0-only 并注明部分组件适用 Apache-2.0 例外，故按社区核心范围记录，不把全仓库统一为单一 SPDX。", "reviewer": "collection-agent", "scope": "community_core", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/loki/main/LICENSE", "spdx_id": "AGPL-3.0-only"}, "name": "Grafana Loki", "repository_url": "https://github.com/grafana/loki", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-24T22:48:57.120653+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "a753a424071d9b84bb24cd4293313314f2929a88d25072d1687f45be590c8e54", "snapshot_path": "sources/a753a424071d9b84bb24cd4293313314f2929a88d25072d1687f45be590c8e54.txt", "url": "https://github.com/grafana/loki"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-24T22:48:58.519336+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "af9e356ba4d99300f4e145be9c0b5885587b2ba8dbba89e2a5f149cd3572c04a", "snapshot_path": "sources/af9e356ba4d99300f4e145be9c0b5885587b2ba8dbba89e2a5f149cd3572c04a.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/loki/main/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-24T22:49:00.616369+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "0d96a4ff68ad6d4b6f1f30f713b18d5184912ba8dd389f86aa7710db079abcb0", "snapshot_path": "sources/0d96a4ff68ad6d4b6f1f30f713b18d5184912ba8dd389f86aa7710db079abcb0.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/loki/main/LICENSE"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T11:54:47.450214+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "1622e195dcefda8a248896baaae82cee2de521013dcc25e457f9ee2c8c766047", "snapshot_path": "sources/1622e195dcefda8a248896baaae82cee2de521013dcc25e457f9ee2c8c766047.txt", "url": "https://grafana.com/docs/loki/latest/api/"}], "summary": "开源核心日志聚合系统，作为自托管主服务接收推送/OTLP 日志、集中持久存储，并提供按时间范围执行的 LogQL 查询 API；可经 Grafana 或 LogCLI 检视。", "technology_stack": ["Go", "标签索引", "单机或多租户模式"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:1007555070','CertMate','{"deployment": ["Docker Compose 单实例部署，Web 进程内含续订调度器", "Linux systemd 安装", "Kubernetes Helm chart（按设计限制为单副本）"], "features": ["在自托管 Web 界面与 REST API 中集中创建、查看和管理 TLS 证书", "从 Let''s Encrypt、ZeroSSL、Google Trust Services、DigiCert、Sectigo 等公共 CA 或私有 CA 签发证书", "按 renews_at 与 ARI 在到期前自动续订，续订生成新证书而非延长旧证书", "通过部署钩子、Webhook 与部署探针把续订后的证书交付到服务位置并核验", "通过探针与证书透明度日志发现未纳管证书，维护签发者、到期时间和部署位置清单", "创建、续订、吊销客户端证书，并提供 OCSP 与 CRL"], "github_repository_id": 1007555070, "homepage": "https://www.certmate.org/", "id": "github:1007555070", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "README 正文说明 CertMate 在自托管 Web 界面中签发与续订证书、发现未纳管证书、维护到期与部署位置清单，并在续订后把新证书部署到服务端点；docs/guide.md 给出 Web 界面创建、续订、吊销和监控证书的操作。证书记录由有效期与 renews_at/ARI 驱动系统化续订，符合证书生命周期管理核心。", "slug": "certificate-lifecycle-management", "source_urls": ["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fabriziosalmi/certmate/main/README.md", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fabriziosalmi/certmate/main/docs/guide.md", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fabriziosalmi/certmate/main/LICENSE"]}], "license": "MIT", "license_evidence_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fabriziosalmi/certmate/main/LICENSE", "license_review": {"rationale": "抓取的仓库 LICENSE 为完整 MIT License 文本，含授权、版权声明与免责条款，并与 GitHub 仓库页标注的 MIT 许可证一致。", "reviewer": "opencode-go/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "scope": "repository", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fabriziosalmi/certmate/main/LICENSE", "spdx_id": "MIT"}, "name": "CertMate", "repository_url": "https://github.com/fabriziosalmi/certmate", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T11:56:01.219384+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "a217424dfc296fe2d20330b19d600ab7264e8e7d8a84a95aa1adffc1f9afa86b", "snapshot_path": "sources/a217424dfc296fe2d20330b19d600ab7264e8e7d8a84a95aa1adffc1f9afa86b.txt", "url": "https://github.com/fabriziosalmi/certmate"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T11:56:00.114028+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "73dfc508f20c6819f2391ac42616438b5c7a74e614701097cf56ee6d51d0fdad", "snapshot_path": "sources/73dfc508f20c6819f2391ac42616438b5c7a74e614701097cf56ee6d51d0fdad.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fabriziosalmi/certmate/main/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T11:56:00.089302+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "7c1189f6261991600d663952c4788e45488029a295d8463f5441420ba69cc1f1", "snapshot_path": "sources/7c1189f6261991600d663952c4788e45488029a295d8463f5441420ba69cc1f1.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fabriziosalmi/certmate/main/LICENSE"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T11:56:21.087095+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "03ca5b34a66af98a238c29aaa05c7d92284410806f96bc6e139912672bab0507", "snapshot_path": "sources/03ca5b34a66af98a238c29aaa05c7d92284410806f96bc6e139912672bab0507.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fabriziosalmi/certmate/main/docs/guide.md"}], "summary": "自托管的 TLS 证书生命周期管理 Web 应用：集中签发与续订证书，发现并盘点未纳管证书，按有效期与续订规则自动续订，并通过部署钩子把新证书交付到服务端点。", "technology_stack": ["Python 3.12", "Docker", "Kubernetes/Helm", "REST API"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:21491087','OpenUDS','{"deployment": ["自托管连接代理（Web 门户 + REST API）", "Python 3.11 运行环境", "多仓库/子模块部署（master 分支）"], "features": ["服务与服务池发布：ServiceItem/ServicePoolItem 提供服务命名、可见性与服务池配置，ServicePoolGroupItem 组织目录，PublicationItem 记录发布状态", "按用户/组授权：组和用户均可关联可访问的 service pool，服务池带 permission 权限位", "远程应用与桌面会话：RemoteAppService 定义 application_path，RemoteSessionService 面向 RDS 服务器，TransportItem 提供 RDP/HTML5/SPICE 等传输", "受管主机群：/servers/groups 与 /servers/groups/{uuid}/servers 管理服务器组及成员，服务池配置 initial_srvs/max_srvs", "多虚拟化平台服务类型：OpenStack、oVirt、Proxmox、VMware、Xen、Hyper-V、Azure、AWS 等"], "github_repository_id": 21491087, "homepage": "https://github.com/VirtualCable/openuds", "id": "github:21491087", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方 API 规范给出四层核心的直接正文：ServiceItem/ServicePoolItem/PublicationItem 描述命名且持久的服务发布；组/用户 servicesPools 端点说明按组/用户授权；RemoteAppService/RemoteSessionService 与 RDP/HTML5/SPICE 传输描述远程交互会话；/servers/groups 与 initial_srvs/max_srvs 描述受管主机群。doc/api/README.md 说明该规范由实际 REST handler 与模型生成；quickstart 说明自托管启动后通过 Web 界面管理 broker、tunnel、providers 与 services。", "slug": "desktop-application-delivery", "source_urls": ["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/VirtualCable/broker/master/doc/api/rest.yaml", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/VirtualCable/broker/master/doc/api/README.md", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/VirtualCable/broker/master/doc/source/quickstart/quickstart.rst", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/VirtualCable/openuds/master/README.md"]}], "license": "BSD-3-Clause", "license_evidence_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/VirtualCable/openuds/master/LICENSE", "license_review": {"rationale": "抓取的仓库 LICENSE 为完整 BSD 3-Clause 文本，含再分发条款、名称使用限制与免责声明，并与仓库页面标注一致。", "reviewer": "opencode-go/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "scope": "repository", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/VirtualCable/openuds/master/LICENSE", "spdx_id": "BSD-3-Clause"}, "name": "OpenUDS", "repository_url": "https://github.com/VirtualCable/openuds", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-26T18:44:38.653290+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "a7e5cc309271cd19c578c0e93032af2bd012edc7b4eec33415a9539899ab1ec3", "snapshot_path": "sources/a7e5cc309271cd19c578c0e93032af2bd012edc7b4eec33415a9539899ab1ec3.txt", "url": "https://github.com/VirtualCable/openuds"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-26T18:44:27.819912+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "7fea53744125301421052c0c4c8772e9359948602d06fd77d5444c1f8974be1f", "snapshot_path": "sources/7fea53744125301421052c0c4c8772e9359948602d06fd77d5444c1f8974be1f.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/VirtualCable/openuds/master/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-26T18:46:15.912346+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "2fc0a0cae386425ce8af4c1bb3c02c2b13b8ba8f788882a540966d62e9533908", "snapshot_path": "sources/2fc0a0cae386425ce8af4c1bb3c02c2b13b8ba8f788882a540966d62e9533908.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/VirtualCable/openuds/master/LICENSE"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:00:54.779942+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "37f72a2810ad9a1b22a7a1b7eeabe0801d64a0bcaa6058e82ec1005fa4552497", "snapshot_path": "sources/37f72a2810ad9a1b22a7a1b7eeabe0801d64a0bcaa6058e82ec1005fa4552497.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/VirtualCable/broker/master/doc/api/rest.yaml"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:00:58.530488+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "d41e483290303ec94fd3614d0d95c176a319952d7e36858166a53ca3c841f1ab", "snapshot_path": "sources/d41e483290303ec94fd3614d0d95c176a319952d7e36858166a53ca3c841f1ab.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/VirtualCable/broker/master/doc/api/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:03:18.458636+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "4c0e509f0e979ea9f290b0e1ad5bdb41ed82552a2d22c963140165674a91821e", "snapshot_path": "sources/4c0e509f0e979ea9f290b0e1ad5bdb41ed82552a2d22c963140165674a91821e.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/VirtualCable/broker/master/doc/source/quickstart/quickstart.rst"}], "summary": "开源多平台连接代理，提供自托管 Web 管理门户与 REST API，将 Windows/Linux 桌面和 RemoteApp 应用作为命名服务/服务池发布，按用户和组授予服务池访问，并通过 RDP/HTML5/SPICE 等传输建立远程交互会话；后端管理多种虚拟化与 RDS 主机群。", "technology_stack": ["Python 3.11", "REST/OpenAPI", "RDS / RemoteApp", "多虚拟化平台（OpenStack/oVirt/Proxmox/VMware/Xen 等）"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:microsoft-entra-id-governance','Microsoft Entra ID Governance','{"homepage": "https://www.microsoft.com/", "id": "commercial:microsoft-entra-id-governance", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方页面说明其通过 entitlement management、访问请求工作流与审批、定期/按需访问审查、生命周期工作流和 PIM，授予、复核并撤销对应用和资源的访问。", "slug": "identity-governance-iga", "source_urls": ["https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/security/business/identity-access/microsoft-entra-id-governance"]}], "name": "Microsoft Entra ID Governance", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:05:12.140456+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "f9fba565ca9795bc3eba048c5429669723f6f84a86b605d587ee086c5eeb04d0", "snapshot_path": "sources/f9fba565ca9795bc3eba048c5429669723f6f84a86b605d587ee086c5eeb04d0.txt", "url": "https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/security/business/identity-access/microsoft-entra-id-governance"}], "summary": "Microsoft Entra 的身份治理服务：通过权利管理、访问请求与审批、访问审查、生命周期工作流和特权身份管理，治理员工及合作伙伴对应用与资源的访问。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:omada-identity','Omada Identity','{"homepage": "https://omadaidentity.com/", "id": "commercial:omada-identity", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方首页说明其提供身份生命周期管理、自动访问供应与取消供应、自助访问请求与审批、跨系统认证活动和职责分离控制，并有合规审计报告。", "slug": "identity-governance-iga", "source_urls": ["https://omadaidentity.com/"]}], "name": "Omada Identity", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:05:09.006003+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "74de8e98d1859f88e23dd5e137936d11a848149edf452dceea731dde9a93db4c", "snapshot_path": "sources/74de8e98d1859f88e23dd5e137936d11a848149edf452dceea731dde9a93db4c.txt", "url": "https://omadaidentity.com/"}], "summary": "企业 IGA 平台：集中管理身份与访问，提供自动供应/取消供应、自助访问请求、访问认证活动、职责分离和审计报告。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:sailpoint-identityiq','SailPoint IdentityIQ','{"homepage": "https://www.sailpoint.com/", "id": "commercial:sailpoint-identityiq", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方 IdentityIQ 页面说明其提供自助访问请求、认证活动（certification/access review）、职责分离控制、权限与生命周期管理，并自动执行授予或撤销，覆盖 IGA 的访问模型、人工决策和修复闭环。", "slug": "identity-governance-iga", "source_urls": ["https://www.sailpoint.com/products/identity-security-software/identity-iq"]}], "name": "SailPoint IdentityIQ", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:05:09.209979+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "bee029efad2be2e65f3c920cee974006015b12dd3a88e70b467e2b4b19315209", "snapshot_path": "sources/bee029efad2be2e65f3c920cee974006015b12dd3a88e70b467e2b4b19315209.txt", "url": "https://www.sailpoint.com/products/identity-security-software/identity-iq"}], "summary": "企业级身份治理平台：集中管理身份与权限，提供自助访问请求与审批、访问认证/审查、职责分离控制、访问生命周期自动化及可审计记录。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:1344090273','IAG — Identity & Access Governance','{"deployment": ["self-hosted Docker Compose stack: nginx load balancer, three stateless FastAPI replicas, PostgreSQL 16, and a one-shot Alembic migration container"], "features": ["identity and entitlement ingestion from CSV, LDAP/AD, Microsoft Entra ID and SQL sources", "entitlement catalog with privilege classification", "scoped certification campaigns with approve/revoke reviewer decisions", "segregation-of-duties checks", "decision-triggered remediation with email, webhook and directory write-back", "SCIM provisioning", "risk scoring and campaign reports", "append-only hash-chained audit trail"], "github_repository_id": 1344090273, "homepage": "https://github.com/ponofinlayson-web/iag", "id": "github:1344090273", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "README 说明该自托管应用汇入身份与账号并建立权限目录，按来源/部门/特权等范围运行认证活动、由审查人批准或撤销，并以邮件、Webhook、LDAP/Entra/SQL 写回和 SCIM 执行修复；CHANGELOG 记录这些连接器、修复执行、SoD 与审计链已发布，ARCHITECTURE 说明其 nginx + FastAPI + PostgreSQL 的 Web 服务形态。", "slug": "identity-governance-iga", "source_urls": ["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ponofinlayson-web/iag/main/README.md", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ponofinlayson-web/iag/main/ARCHITECTURE.md", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ponofinlayson-web/iag/main/CHANGELOG.md"]}], "license": "MIT", "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ponofinlayson-web/iag/license", "name": "IAG — Identity & Access Governance", "repository_url": "https://github.com/ponofinlayson-web/iag", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:04:13.854949+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "5af058038c3fe49f1d1015a990d75f505cbabfda4c06cdf9385a1435e231ea2e", "snapshot_path": "sources/5af058038c3fe49f1d1015a990d75f505cbabfda4c06cdf9385a1435e231ea2e.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ponofinlayson-web/iag"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:04:19.851425+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "7f13aaf7ebe1fdde0c0330d4edc6ce497f6edef9329aabd2451e89062aa5ed06", "snapshot_path": "sources/7f13aaf7ebe1fdde0c0330d4edc6ce497f6edef9329aabd2451e89062aa5ed06.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ponofinlayson-web/iag/main/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:04:19.851419+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "8fcf2a094165a1088cb29e0c97f5f714981c5f8426da586bcd0eb3a4d0c68acb", "snapshot_path": "sources/8fcf2a094165a1088cb29e0c97f5f714981c5f8426da586bcd0eb3a4d0c68acb.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ponofinlayson-web/iag/license"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:05:30.971568+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "3518423c6093b52507e5ba713e30d4b50ccbabeadadfd674a6ee764bdf575d2d", "snapshot_path": "sources/3518423c6093b52507e5ba713e30d4b50ccbabeadadfd674a6ee764bdf575d2d.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ponofinlayson-web/iag/main/ARCHITECTURE.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:05:30.993972+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "7c11d2e855cd5b76a350b2c9679ed79b54654516985abcd41b58f0fc8bf5e26f", "snapshot_path": "sources/7c11d2e855cd5b76a350b2c9679ed79b54654516985abcd41b58f0fc8bf5e26f.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ponofinlayson-web/iag/main/CHANGELOG.md"}], "summary": "自托管的身份与访问治理（IGA）Web 应用：从 CSV/LDAP/Entra ID/SQL 等来源汇入身份与账号，建立权限目录并分级；运行访问认证活动记录批准或撤销决定，再以邮件、Webhook、目录写回和 SCIM 供应执行修复，配套哈希链审计。", "technology_stack": ["Python 3.12 / FastAPI", "SQLAlchemy 2.x / Alembic", "PostgreSQL 16", "React 18 / TypeScript / Vite", "nginx", "Docker"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:31558937','Teleport','{"deployment": ["自托管 Teleport 集群（Linux 或 Kubernetes）", "Auth Service 与 Proxy Service", "tbot 代理运行在机器/工作负载侧"], "features": ["机器与工作负载作为一等非人类身份（NHI）", "bot 角色与 join token/proof 验证", "tbot 自动签发与续期短期 X.509/JWT 证书", "SPIFFE 兼容工作负载身份", "审计日志与 RBAC"], "github_repository_id": 31558937, "homepage": "https://goteleport.com", "id": "github:31558937", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方 Machine & Workload Identity 文档将机器/工作负载定义为非人类身份（NHI）：bot 有角色，join token 指定 join method/proof（如 AWS IAM），tbot 自动签发并续期短期 X.509/JWT 证书，Auth Service 记录审计日志；Teleport 以 Auth Service、Proxy、Web UI 和 tbot 构成自托管完整应用服务。仅主张 MWI 子模块，不扩展到通用基础设施访问/PAM。", "slug": "machine-identity-management", "source_urls": ["https://goteleport.com/docs/machine-workload-identity/", "https://goteleport.com/docs/machine-workload-identity/introduction/", "https://api.github.com/repos/gravitational/teleport", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/gravitational/teleport/master/README.md", "https://api.github.com/repos/gravitational/teleport/license"]}], "license": "AGPL-3.0", "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/gravitational/teleport/license", "name": "Teleport", "repository_url": "https://github.com/gravitational/teleport", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:03:06.779853+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "21f7d227c057a3d061acc33f572cdc11ef72c0416d4c51bba3af4a460edb7977", "snapshot_path": "sources/21f7d227c057a3d061acc33f572cdc11ef72c0416d4c51bba3af4a460edb7977.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/gravitational/teleport"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:03:06.790389+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "9099095bba8afde8d01e363770bfd4534ad2698e3e644c668465fc5af13308fb", "snapshot_path": "sources/9099095bba8afde8d01e363770bfd4534ad2698e3e644c668465fc5af13308fb.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/gravitational/teleport/master/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:03:07.077863+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "78647edcca94f529a0013bc91ddca80cdd5c0732de53bd28f1fc320237a9435e", "snapshot_path": "sources/78647edcca94f529a0013bc91ddca80cdd5c0732de53bd28f1fc320237a9435e.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/gravitational/teleport/license"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:03:54.903719+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "0fd3b0bade35516f5b8cb5b32e7c5132902df06ff24717f26e66c3587bd19bd0", "snapshot_path": "sources/0fd3b0bade35516f5b8cb5b32e7c5132902df06ff24717f26e66c3587bd19bd0.txt", "url": "https://goteleport.com/docs/machine-workload-identity/"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:04:35.712179+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "1318a0f16ebc7a5f7d9c15d3f55d00bc8d4981300b9ff50ade5af487ceed9316", "snapshot_path": "sources/1318a0f16ebc7a5f7d9c15d3f55d00bc8d4981300b9ff50ade5af487ceed9316.txt", "url": "https://goteleport.com/docs/machine-workload-identity/introduction/"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:03:54.909671+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "8fa618dc71f27fd5167923c22c45d8cdde5a21184e8c41f5ac47475106900d78", "snapshot_path": "sources/8fa618dc71f27fd5167923c22c45d8cdde5a21184e8c41f5ac47475106900d78.txt", "url": "https://goteleport.com/"}], "summary": "自托管的身份感知访问平台，Machine & Workload Identity 模块将机器与工作负载作为非人类身份（NHI），通过 bot、join token/proof、tbot 自动签发和续期短期 X.509/JWT 证书，并以角色与审计日志治理；仓库源码 AGPL-3.0，/api 为 Apache-2.0，社区版构建另有 modified Apache 2.0 许可。", "technology_stack": ["Go"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:223431735','OpenZiti','{"deployment": ["官方 all-in-one Docker Compose 快速启动 controller、edge router 与 ZAC", "ziti edge quickstart 启动本地 controller/router", "本记录未实际部署运行"], "features": ["为每个用户、服务与设备签发密码学身份", "按身份策略逐服务授权，实时撤销并关闭连接", "服务默认无监听端口（dark services），未授权方不可见", "自托管 controller、edge router 与 ZAC 浏览器管理控制台", "官方 all-in-one Docker Compose 启动完整控制面并开放 /zac/ 控制台"], "github_repository_id": 223431735, "homepage": "https://openziti.io", "id": "github:223431735", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "README 明确以单个服务为授权单位、按密码学身份逐服务允许访问、服务无监听端口且授权可实时撤销，并把该模型定位为 VPN 替代；官方 all-in-one quickstart 文档进一步显示 docker compose 后可在浏览器打开 /zac/ 管理控制台并查看身份与 router，说明它是可持续运行的自托管应用服务，而非仅 SDK/CLI。其 Host/Application Access 模式分别以服务主机或应用为边界，符合 ZTNA 的资源级访问、身份默认拒绝与产品自有连接路径核心；Network Access 网关模式更接近网络边界接入，未作为本条依据。", "slug": "zero-trust-network-access-ztna", "source_urls": ["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/openziti/ziti/main/README.md", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/openziti/ziti/main/quickstart/docker/all-in-one/README.md"]}], "license": "Apache-2.0", "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/openziti/ziti/license", "name": "OpenZiti", "repository_url": "https://github.com/openziti/ziti", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-26T18:47:38.671776+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "80d3e3a0d4045640b290963d54749d37a9e2257bb7618d190fda4232d90ebeb2", "snapshot_path": "sources/80d3e3a0d4045640b290963d54749d37a9e2257bb7618d190fda4232d90ebeb2.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/openziti/ziti"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-26T18:47:49.100642+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "eb59b0e0cd212b7be42d1f098ea027f84f4130ee1d845eed58ef98679f10f3f4", "snapshot_path": "sources/eb59b0e0cd212b7be42d1f098ea027f84f4130ee1d845eed58ef98679f10f3f4.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/openziti/ziti/main/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-26T18:47:49.281365+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "1c33ec1251f830c7b2cd211c5ff060365f46ee0c48845f3321f5f8bb5c0a71a9", "snapshot_path": "sources/1c33ec1251f830c7b2cd211c5ff060365f46ee0c48845f3321f5f8bb5c0a71a9.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/openziti/ziti/license"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:07:31.322817+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "4b2d10ca23628f27efbadf59c87d2bca8a10e653aac5d78b8b9f744088c09f5b", "snapshot_path": "sources/4b2d10ca23628f27efbadf59c87d2bca8a10e653aac5d78b8b9f744088c09f5b.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/openziti/ziti/main/quickstart/docker/all-in-one/README.md"}], "summary": "开源零信任网络平台，为服务、用户与设备签发密码学身份，按身份策略逐服务授权，使私有服务不暴露监听端口，连接经自托管 controller/edge router 建立的 overlay 到达；官方 all-in-one 部署同时提供 ZAC 浏览器管理控制台，可作为完整自托管 ZTNA 应用服务运行。本关系只依据其服务级 Host/Application Access 模型，不采其 Network Access 网关模式。", "technology_stack": ["Go 实现的 controller 与 edge router", "SDK/tunneler 端点与 Docker Compose 部署", "ZAC Web 管理控制台"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:27965134','OPNsense','{"deployment": ["作为自托管防火墙平台安装于硬件或虚拟机，部署在网络区域边界或分段点并内联流量", "通过 Web GUI 或 API 管理防火墙规则与系统配置", "可用 OPNsense tools 从源码构建/升级软件包"], "features": ["状态化包过滤与会话状态跟踪（默认启用）", "有序规则与 quick 首次匹配；未匹配时由默认拒绝规则丢弃流量", "Pass/Block/Reject 规则动作", "按入方向过滤，支持接口与浮动规则", "NAT 规则在过滤规则之前处理", "通过 Web GUI 与 API 管理策略和系统配置"], "github_repository_id": 27965134, "homepage": "https://opnsense.org/", "id": "github:27965134", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方 firewall 文档正文证明其为内联状态化包过滤器：规则按接口/浮动分区有序处理，quick 首次匹配生效，动作含 Pass/Block/Reject，未匹配流量由默认拒绝规则丢弃，NAT 先于过滤；首页与 GUI 文档进一步证明这是可自托管、经 Web GUI/API 管理的完整防火墙与路由平台，而非仅客户端、CLI 或设备控制器。定义明确允许具有有序规则集的状态化防火墙设备，威胁防护引擎不属于匹配前提。", "slug": "network-security-platform", "source_urls": ["https://docs.opnsense.org/manual/firewall.html", "https://opnsense.org/", "https://docs.opnsense.org/intro.html", "https://docs.opnsense.org/manual/gui.html"]}], "license": "BSD-2-Clause", "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/opnsense/core/license", "name": "OPNsense", "repository_url": "https://github.com/opnsense/core", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-26T18:57:57.596843+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "39238a4bcc0074756f4f6799e17d8002fbe10608bdf4036ad777e3a972965a51", "snapshot_path": "sources/39238a4bcc0074756f4f6799e17d8002fbe10608bdf4036ad777e3a972965a51.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/opnsense/core"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-26T18:57:58.997042+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "34a472e51410546ea4ae96e8129847063a95dff6b90311a6edf0784a4c7881b8", "snapshot_path": "sources/34a472e51410546ea4ae96e8129847063a95dff6b90311a6edf0784a4c7881b8.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/opnsense/core/license"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-26T18:58:00.156301+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "0df745e2136f60b0f489ea5f402a29acc6f14c510e0dfa9608960a6952466ada", "snapshot_path": "sources/0df745e2136f60b0f489ea5f402a29acc6f14c510e0dfa9608960a6952466ada.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/opnsense/core/master/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-26T18:58:02.254538+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "7b57a3badcac5714e726f55bf9bd90c1e83d1a4b2e97aa5ee147dc59714e4fe5", "snapshot_path": "sources/7b57a3badcac5714e726f55bf9bd90c1e83d1a4b2e97aa5ee147dc59714e4fe5.txt", "url": "https://docs.opnsense.org/manual/firewall.html"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:08:31.452884+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "f1117b8aaf51e2911a2c22105296f162beb17d48458fad46996ee9dc0af2e0a7", "snapshot_path": "sources/f1117b8aaf51e2911a2c22105296f162beb17d48458fad46996ee9dc0af2e0a7.txt", "url": "https://opnsense.org/"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:08:31.109381+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "58d5a38628c65aa4814a2f3c77e19504ff1ba5e6af955acd7b72670ce68b046b", "snapshot_path": "sources/58d5a38628c65aa4814a2f3c77e19504ff1ba5e6af955acd7b72670ce68b046b.txt", "url": "https://docs.opnsense.org/intro.html"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:08:41.944710+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "a8d7c9e728bb5089ed2612133e0d100f3fc8fd24861df8cfdccb53670d25de6e", "snapshot_path": "sources/a8d7c9e728bb5089ed2612133e0d100f3fc8fd24861df8cfdccb53670d25de6e.txt", "url": "https://docs.opnsense.org/manual/gui.html"}], "summary": "开源、可自托管的完整防火墙与路由平台：以状态化包过滤对经过本机的流量按有序规则逐会话放行、阻断或拒绝，默认拒绝未匹配流量，并支持 NAT、接口/浮动规则与 Web GUI/API 策略管理。威胁防护引擎为可选附加能力，不是本条目的匹配依据。", "technology_stack": ["FreeBSD", "pf（状态化包过滤器）", "PHP"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:contrast-assess','Contrast Assess','{"homepage": "https://www.contrastsecurity.com", "id": "commercial:contrast-assess", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方 Contrast Assess 页面明确标注 IAST，并在正文说明其使用 agent 对运行中的应用插桩，持续观测代码执行、数据流与配置，从而定位实际可利用的漏洞代码；另有“Continuous runtime vulnerability detection”说明可在运行应用中即时识别风险。这符合从应用内部观测被练习流量并产出运行时证据的 IAST 边界。仅作商业基本记录。", "slug": "dast-iast", "source_urls": ["https://www.contrastsecurity.com/contrast-assess"]}], "name": "Contrast Assess", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:15:03.190118+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "6268b7b6439b844abc190b6cff5b8fd354b5479f04a1fb103fc370421598a505", "snapshot_path": "sources/6268b7b6439b844abc190b6cff5b8fd354b5479f04a1fb103fc370421598a505.txt", "url": "https://www.contrastsecurity.com/contrast-assess"}], "summary": "商业化 IAST 平台：在运行中的应用内以 agent 插桩观测代码执行与数据流，实时识别可利用漏洞并定位到代码。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:invicti','Invicti','{"homepage": "https://www.invicti.com", "id": "commercial:invicti", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方 DAST 产品页正文说明其扫描运行中的 Web 应用与 API、处理已认证流程，并以“proof-based scanning”安全利用常见漏洞、展示利用证据后形成可修复的发现；页面同时说明可按发布节奏调度扫描并提供 SaaS、本地与混合部署，符合以运行中目标、主动测试和运行时证据为核心的 DAST 边界。仅作商业基本记录，未核价格或部署细节。", "slug": "dast-iast", "source_urls": ["https://www.invicti.com/product/dast"]}], "name": "Invicti", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:15:03.416929+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "735fc9e781c9d5b06b6ee23fe96ba202c5bb4dd3b350f6e116a116f46e2d46bd", "snapshot_path": "sources/735fc9e781c9d5b06b6ee23fe96ba202c5bb4dd3b350f6e116a116f46e2d46bd.txt", "url": "https://www.invicti.com/product/dast"}], "summary": "商业化 DAST 平台：扫描运行中的 Web 应用与 API，通过安全利用验证漏洞并输出带证据的发现，提供 SaaS、本地和混合部署。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:simscale','SimScale','{"homepage": "https://www.simscale.com/", "id": "commercial:simscale", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "SimScale 产品页说明可在浏览器中运行 CFD、FEA、热与电磁仿真，提供自动网格、求解编排和结果解读；主页说明其从 CAD 导入到结果解释的云原生工作流。属于完整的商业云 CAE 应用服务。", "slug": "cae-engineering-simulation", "source_urls": ["https://www.simscale.com/", "https://www.simscale.com/product/"]}], "name": "SimScale", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:17:30.889997+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "2bd0b805a4c52fc3f37cd0cc6718b3fecacf50550bf91c35e944c5c809c39a3c", "snapshot_path": "sources/2bd0b805a4c52fc3f37cd0cc6718b3fecacf50550bf91c35e944c5c809c39a3c.txt", "url": "https://www.simscale.com/"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:17:32.798513+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "4282ccbc5c19077df9430c3d08ba623d14909b1764effb5180990277a603a1de", "snapshot_path": "sources/4282ccbc5c19077df9430c3d08ba623d14909b1764effb5180990277a603a1de.txt", "url": "https://www.simscale.com/product/"}], "summary": "云端多物理场 CAE 平台，在浏览器中运行 CFD、FEA、热分析与电磁仿真，覆盖建模、网格、求解和结果查看的完整工作流。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:885889934','SunCAE','{"deployment": ["自行托管（GNU/Linux + PHP）"], "features": ["浏览器端 CAD 导入与案例配置", "物理与问题设置", "Gmsh 网格划分", "FeenoX/CalculiX 求解器选择", "后端生成求解输入并执行求解", "三维结果查看"], "github_repository_id": 885889934, "homepage": "https://www.seamplex.com/suncae", "id": "github:885889934", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "SunCAE 是完整的开源 Web CAE 应用：README 说明前端在浏览器运行，后端生成求解输入、执行求解器并回传三维结果；设计文档列出 CAD 导入→物理/问题→网格/求解器→网格/问题/结果的工作流；产品页列出 FeenoX/CalculiX 求解器与 Gmsh 网格器。其形态是可自行托管的完整应用，而非仅客户端或求解器。", "slug": "cae-engineering-simulation", "source_urls": ["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/seamplex/suncae/main/README.md", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/seamplex/suncae/main/doc/design.md", "https://www.seamplex.com/suncae"]}], "license": "AGPL-3.0-or-later", "license_evidence_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/seamplex/suncae/main/COPYING", "license_review": {"rationale": "COPYING 为完整 GNU AGPL v3 文本；README 明确写明 version 3 or any later version，GitHub API 分类为 AGPL-3.0，故按 AGPL-3.0-or-later 记录。", "reviewer": "unit-130-collector", "scope": "repository", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/seamplex/suncae/main/COPYING", "spdx_id": "AGPL-3.0-or-later"}, "name": "SunCAE", "repository_url": "https://github.com/seamplex/suncae", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:15:35.117610+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "0e3a3adbbaf1b46c048cb9eee034e6203630f2b59be8cd88e24c1dfd1b0cdca5", "snapshot_path": "sources/0e3a3adbbaf1b46c048cb9eee034e6203630f2b59be8cd88e24c1dfd1b0cdca5.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/seamplex/suncae"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:15:34.972854+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "fed5598bbc32eff9ad4a482100c670c758828dcd8d6544695a2c41a045aa86d0", "snapshot_path": "sources/fed5598bbc32eff9ad4a482100c670c758828dcd8d6544695a2c41a045aa86d0.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/seamplex/suncae/main/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:15:35.267032+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "0d96a4ff68ad6d4b6f1f30f713b18d5184912ba8dd389f86aa7710db079abcb0", "snapshot_path": "sources/0d96a4ff68ad6d4b6f1f30f713b18d5184912ba8dd389f86aa7710db079abcb0.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/seamplex/suncae/main/COPYING"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:15:34.999974+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "081aabc6096e4dba02c93963469372745a1d1988018cc91f03ae84b77c5c35ac", "snapshot_path": "sources/081aabc6096e4dba02c93963469372745a1d1988018cc91f03ae84b77c5c35ac.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/seamplex/suncae/main/doc/design.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:15:46.480291+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "d967e1b1c67d7c75842f83c12834124c4674323ea89030720bce67c38c2bc738", "snapshot_path": "sources/d967e1b1c67d7c75842f83c12834124c4674323ea89030720bce67c38c2bc738.txt", "url": "https://www.seamplex.com/suncae"}], "summary": "开源、可自行托管的 Web 化 CAE 平台：浏览器端完成 CAD 导入、物理与问题设置、网格/求解器选择，后端生成求解输入、调用 FeenoX 或 CalculiX 求解并回传三维结果。", "technology_stack": ["PHP", "JavaScript", "Bash", "Python"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:88670779','Kiri:Moto','{"deployment": ["Web 浏览器", "Docker 自托管", "Node.js 自托管", "Electron 桌面包"], "features": ["浏览器端 CAM 模式与完整工作流", "导入 3D 模型并布置零件", "按加工操作计算刀具路径", "机床与刀具库设置", "刀具路径预览、动画与碰撞检查", "导出 machine-ready G-code", "Docker/Node.js 自托管", "3D 打印与激光切割模式"], "github_repository_id": 88670779, "homepage": "https://grid.space/kiri/", "id": "github:88670779", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方 CAM Mode 文档说明该浏览器端应用从 3D 模型生成刀具路径并按机床/刀具/加工操作设置导出 machine-ready G-code，覆盖零件几何输入、软件计算刀具运动、面向具体机床的输出三项核心；README 同时给出 grid.space 托管版与 Docker/Node 自托管方式。", "slug": "cnc-programming-application", "source_urls": ["https://docs.grid.space/kiri-moto/CAM/", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GridSpace/grid-apps/master/readme.md"]}], "license": "MIT", "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/GridSpace/grid-apps/license", "name": "Kiri:Moto", "repository_url": "https://github.com/GridSpace/grid-apps", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:16:54.824507+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "e08feb9e773faabe7364a466a12c3b76f13a81f371a092dd134e3dbe9efc7e59", "snapshot_path": "sources/e08feb9e773faabe7364a466a12c3b76f13a81f371a092dd134e3dbe9efc7e59.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/GridSpace/grid-apps"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:17:02.460883+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "a3b39d6e592e7792624160b96a5cf0fcab8a88146031962919bee424a3df9489", "snapshot_path": "sources/a3b39d6e592e7792624160b96a5cf0fcab8a88146031962919bee424a3df9489.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GridSpace/grid-apps/master/readme.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:16:54.824508+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "c72f0e77d37a95db710e68c439ad1d5069530ffe9af0cb2f7450e3efcdce51c4", "snapshot_path": "sources/c72f0e77d37a95db710e68c439ad1d5069530ffe9af0cb2f7450e3efcdce51c4.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/GridSpace/grid-apps/license"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:17:32.713513+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "44c08628a6f155f865ba9cea5e83051d6fa2aca746a6ca56397057bfa6b09ec2", "snapshot_path": "sources/44c08628a6f155f865ba9cea5e83051d6fa2aca746a6ca56397057bfa6b09ec2.txt", "url": "https://docs.grid.space/kiri-moto/CAM/"}], "summary": "浏览器端开源 CAM 应用（GridSpace/grid-apps）：导入 3D 模型后按机床、刀具与加工操作计算刀具路径，预览/仿真加工运动并导出针对具体机床的 G-code；CNC 铣削是其 CAM 模式之一，可在 grid.space 在线使用或按 README 通过 Docker/Node 自托管。", "technology_stack": ["JavaScript", "HTML5", "Web Workers", "Node.js"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:1280911053','ZiroEDA Designer','{"deployment": ["浏览器（Web 应用）", "自托管（Supabase 云侧；账户/云同步可关闭）"], "features": ["KiCad 兼容原理图捕获（符号、导线、总线、标签、层次图、标注、ERC）", "符号库与封装库编辑", "PCB 编辑、交互式布线与 DRC", "3D 查看", "Gerber/PDF 制造与文档输出", "网表与 BOM 导出", "直接读写 KiCad 工程", "浏览器运行，可选自托管 Supabase 云同步"], "github_repository_id": 1280911053, "homepage": "https://designer.ziroeda.com/", "id": "github:1280911053", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "README 与 CHANGELOG 正文表明 ZiroEDA 是浏览器运行的 KiCad 10 移植：原理图编辑器支持符号、导线、总线、标签、层次图、标注与 ERC；提供符号/封装库编辑；PCB 编辑器含交互式布线、DRC、3D 与 Gerber/PDF 输出；CHANGELOG 记录网表导出与 Update PCB from Schematic，BOM 导出源码进一步证明从原理图元件生成分组物料清单。符合元件库→原理图→连通性→派生交付物的 ECAD/EDA 核心，且为可自托管的完整 Web 应用服务。", "slug": "ecad-eda", "source_urls": ["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ZiroEDA/ziro-designer/main/README.md", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ZiroEDA/ziro-designer/main/CHANGELOG.md", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ZiroEDA/ziro-designer/main/eeschema/exporters/bom.ts"]}], "license": "GPL-3.0", "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ZiroEDA/ziro-designer/license", "name": "ZiroEDA Designer", "repository_url": "https://github.com/ZiroEDA/ziro-designer", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:21:43.746114+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "b90bc9e2afd569f75af274f963063b46a8ff1d4e843152d41bd4d5c32e68b7aa", "snapshot_path": "sources/b90bc9e2afd569f75af274f963063b46a8ff1d4e843152d41bd4d5c32e68b7aa.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ZiroEDA/ziro-designer"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:21:45.357838+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "5514871cf994aaac0aab2bdb5fa34a77305ae36724589c944a4b3552d7889107", "snapshot_path": "sources/5514871cf994aaac0aab2bdb5fa34a77305ae36724589c944a4b3552d7889107.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ZiroEDA/ziro-designer/main/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:21:47.415787+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "8f0448b2515502a03f5f0ddd47346b596682269780d19aac631829647f930590", "snapshot_path": "sources/8f0448b2515502a03f5f0ddd47346b596682269780d19aac631829647f930590.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ZiroEDA/ziro-designer/license"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:21:49.378816+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "010833d7a7657739e83d340ddeea6efb138ec112c90881311533965e9001e101", "snapshot_path": "sources/010833d7a7657739e83d340ddeea6efb138ec112c90881311533965e9001e101.txt", "url": "https://designer.ziroeda.com/"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:23:41.315715+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "8ab0d775d21d4dfd97dcd7b291b51f1fea7a4c73a9a3d12af8786e65b5b0915f", "snapshot_path": "sources/8ab0d775d21d4dfd97dcd7b291b51f1fea7a4c73a9a3d12af8786e65b5b0915f.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ZiroEDA/ziro-designer/main/CHANGELOG.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:23:53.260562+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "5731c034e4bccab2edc18f2d551f96a85dbb92123c24dbe10872602145bc3574", "snapshot_path": "sources/5731c034e4bccab2edc18f2d551f96a85dbb92123c24dbe10872602145bc3574.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ZiroEDA/ziro-designer/main/eeschema/exporters/bom.ts"}], "summary": "开源浏览器端 ECAD/EDA 环境，KiCad 10 的浏览器原生移植。支持 KiCad 兼容的原理图编辑（符号、导线、总线、标签、层次图、标注、ERC）、符号/封装库编辑、PCB 编辑与 DRC/3D 查看，并生成 Gerber/PDF、网表与 BOM 等制造/交付文件；可直接读写 KiCad 工程，云同步可选自托管。", "technology_stack": ["TypeScript", "React", "WebGL", "three.js", "Supabase"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:1358123591','Tracelet','{"deployment": ["浏览器（静态 Web 应用）", "自托管（可选团队存储服务，文件或 PostgreSQL）"], "features": ["多页原理图捕获（元件、导线、网络标签、总线、ERC）", "内置/可导入元件库与引脚映射", "PCB 布局、布线与 DRC", "BOM 与 Gerber/钻孔/贴装文件导出", "3D 预览", "浏览器本地存储", "可选自托管团队存储服务", "KiCad/EasyEDA/Altium 导入"], "github_repository_id": 1358123591, "homepage": "https://tracelet.org/", "id": "github:1358123591", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "README 正文明确描述 Tracelet 为浏览器端完整 EDA 工作区：元件库含引脚映射，多层原理图支持导线/网络标签/总线/ERC，PCB 支持布局布线/DRC，并从连通设计导出网表、BOM、Gerber/钻孔/贴装与装配文件；默认本地运行且团队存储服务可自托管。符合元件库→原理图→连通性→派生交付物的 ECAD/EDA 核心和 Web 应用服务形态。", "slug": "ecad-eda", "source_urls": ["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/gongbin/tracelet/main/README.md"]}], "license": "GPL-3.0", "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/gongbin/tracelet/license", "name": "Tracelet", "repository_url": "https://github.com/gongbin/tracelet", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:21:53.862783+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "0ffe7a8184e1005831a1b0c6a86cccf7077e9f8767e1660e843826af89db860e", "snapshot_path": "sources/0ffe7a8184e1005831a1b0c6a86cccf7077e9f8767e1660e843826af89db860e.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/gongbin/tracelet"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:21:55.747703+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "dcd9b2e8043c77dd7ff2aca0fdac7a965d5e04e289e65856da79306ef7b84f15", "snapshot_path": "sources/dcd9b2e8043c77dd7ff2aca0fdac7a965d5e04e289e65856da79306ef7b84f15.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/gongbin/tracelet/main/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:21:57.883256+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "c10ffd1e2333abcbfdfbb9770fae8486b85c2ecae22bbf2e835b192dca32c131", "snapshot_path": "sources/c10ffd1e2333abcbfdfbb9770fae8486b85c2ecae22bbf2e835b192dca32c131.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/gongbin/tracelet/license"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:21:59.754556+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "af8a220f739b38830f81ae77878f3d4888f827a34df576c684b7436d66226cfe", "snapshot_path": "sources/af8a220f739b38830f81ae77878f3d4888f827a34df576c684b7436d66226cfe.txt", "url": "https://tracelet.org/"}], "summary": "开源浏览器端 ECAD/EDA 工作区。内置元件库与引脚映射，支持多层原理图、PCB 布局/布线、ERC/DRC、BOM、Gerber/钻孔/贴装等制造文件导出；默认本地存储，团队可自托管远程存储服务。", "technology_stack": ["TypeScript", "React", "Vite", "Hono", "PostgreSQL"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:capital-x-panel-designer','Capital X Panel Designer','{"homepage": "https://radicasoftware.com", "id": "commercial:capital-x-panel-designer", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方首页说明其为浏览器端云端电气 CAD，面向电气原理图设计，含符号库、自动布线、符号/导线标注与实时交叉引用，并可从设计一键生成端子清单、面板布局、PLC 模块及物料清单等报表；以符号库、接线原理图、连接语义和派生交付物匹配本类型核心。", "slug": "electrical-design-application", "source_urls": ["https://radicasoftware.com"]}], "name": "Capital X Panel Designer", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:25:39.128966+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "31ad518ad20fa3f5134cb5b1b2d09b87310f5684a270f205be173c51d2ba044a", "snapshot_path": "sources/31ad518ad20fa3f5134cb5b1b2d09b87310f5684a270f205be173c51d2ba044a.txt", "url": "https://radicasoftware.com"}], "summary": "云端电气原理图 CAD 软件，提供电气符号库、自动布线/符号与导线标注、实时交叉引用，并可一键生成端子清单、面板布局、PLC 模块和物料清单等报表。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:718047143','Eclipse SysON','{"deployment": ["Web 应用服务：单个可执行 JAR 配合 PostgreSQL，浏览器访问", "支持本地、多用户本地测试与生产级多用户部署", "开源社区核心；Obeo Cloud 托管 SaaS 与 Obeo Enterprise 为独立商业产品，未计入本条目"], "features": ["Web 端 SysML v2 建模环境，面向系统工程师创建、编辑和可视化系统模型，覆盖需求、架构与行为", "图形、表单、表格三类结构化编辑器；General View 将模型成员显示为节点与边，Interconnection View 显示部件与端口连接", "SysML v2 文本记法是模型的附加视图，支持文本导入/导出（部分）；模型库为 SysML v2 标准的一部分", "按 OMG SysML v2 标准建模，提供项目/模型管理、并发编辑与标准 API（部分）；EPL-2.0 开源核心可与 Capella、Papyrus 互操作"], "github_repository_id": 718047143, "homepage": "https://mbse-syson.org", "id": "github:718047143", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方 Overview 说明 SysON 是 Web 端开源图形建模环境，用于编写 SysML v2 模型，支持创建、编辑、可视化系统模型，并捕获需求、设计架构、分析行为；结构化编辑器含图形、表单、表格，且符合 OMG SysML v2 标准、面向 MBSE。官网说明 General View 将 SysML v2 模型成员显示为节点与边，文本记法是模型的附加视图，模型库为 SysML v2 标准的一部分，并明确浏览器使用、无需桌面安装。Key features 页列出项目/模型创建、SysML v2 各视图、并发编写与文本导入导出。生产部署文档说明 SysON 以单个可执行 JAR 连同数据库部署，提供完整多用户访问，浏览器打开即用，证明其完整持续 Web 应用服务形态。仓库元数据与许可证 API 证明 eclipse-syson/syson（ID 718047143）身份及 EPL-2.0；NOTICE 进一步说明程序本体采用 EPL-2.0，仓库内 SysML v2 标准库采用 LGPL-3.0-only。据此匹配系统模型为记录单元、图表/文本为模型视图、OMG SysML v2 语言约束编辑及工程系统主题。Obeo Cloud/Enterprise 为独立商业产品，未计入开源核心。", "slug": "mbse-platform", "source_urls": ["https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-syson/syson", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/eclipse-syson/syson/main/README.md", "https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-syson/syson/license", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/eclipse-syson/syson/main/LICENSE-LGPL", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/eclipse-syson/syson/main/NOTICE", "https://mbse-syson.org/", "https://doc.mbse-syson.org/syson/main/user-manual/what-is.html", "https://doc.mbse-syson.org/syson/main/user-manual/key-features.html", "https://doc.mbse-syson.org/syson/main/installation-guide/how-tos/install.html", "https://doc.mbse-syson.org/syson/main/installation-guide/how-tos/install/production_deploy.html"]}], "license": "EPL-2.0", "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-syson/syson/license", "name": "Eclipse SysON", "repository_url": "https://github.com/eclipse-syson/syson", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:27:21.706198+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "b30cc001a093c076154676a2859914dea56a16a5303dedf433e5578f52df63ab", "snapshot_path": "sources/b30cc001a093c076154676a2859914dea56a16a5303dedf433e5578f52df63ab.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-syson/syson"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:27:20.113811+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "4409715b1bec5cb460241e692d95c8ec1d22f519ff61be1e7e66dbcef5532d98", "snapshot_path": "sources/4409715b1bec5cb460241e692d95c8ec1d22f519ff61be1e7e66dbcef5532d98.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/eclipse-syson/syson/main/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:27:21.573899+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "eb9a73b90687b5ee72348d069010a3d0e2276687b7ecbeed9cc20c48c0e5791e", "snapshot_path": "sources/eb9a73b90687b5ee72348d069010a3d0e2276687b7ecbeed9cc20c48c0e5791e.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-syson/syson/license"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:29:43.106919+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "27d5c8c5d244c6559866ec6184ab64e286082ef533f3e24cd32fe57914022941", "snapshot_path": "sources/27d5c8c5d244c6559866ec6184ab64e286082ef533f3e24cd32fe57914022941.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/eclipse-syson/syson/main/LICENSE-LGPL"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:29:43.085068+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "74577fbd5a256a6b745293afe19b272fb215853aef67d5b4fdc8bdcd6de3d04b", "snapshot_path": "sources/74577fbd5a256a6b745293afe19b272fb215853aef67d5b4fdc8bdcd6de3d04b.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/eclipse-syson/syson/main/NOTICE"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:27:28.972576+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "d61b94e416cc3ac2e3bab8c8497cd475d5e8e465c0a262b53b1fc0a4288644da", "snapshot_path": "sources/d61b94e416cc3ac2e3bab8c8497cd475d5e8e465c0a262b53b1fc0a4288644da.txt", "url": "https://mbse-syson.org/"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:27:28.776906+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "3ff92d36886b518e82d21ca34d1f31d75f793933c9b369101e1bfe4fbeb4ec0b", "snapshot_path": "sources/3ff92d36886b518e82d21ca34d1f31d75f793933c9b369101e1bfe4fbeb4ec0b.txt", "url": "https://doc.mbse-syson.org/syson/main/user-manual/what-is.html"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:27:29.005884+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "c8f665d0162e18d15fcaf55c17155d323786a08508dd6b8e1d27b5e65b921c22", "snapshot_path": "sources/c8f665d0162e18d15fcaf55c17155d323786a08508dd6b8e1d27b5e65b921c22.txt", "url": "https://doc.mbse-syson.org/syson/main/user-manual/key-features.html"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:27:29.506168+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "cbca8d9a20abb3475f7bb55acbee99aa99c3997c1def4a697b00a729aba7bfc5", "snapshot_path": "sources/cbca8d9a20abb3475f7bb55acbee99aa99c3997c1def4a697b00a729aba7bfc5.txt", "url": "https://doc.mbse-syson.org/syson/main/installation-guide/how-tos/install.html"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:27:47.643258+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "20d22b11d8a39f0334fea97495032501c9934e4d22c5b09c0ee5575bb5039e8f", "snapshot_path": "sources/20d22b11d8a39f0334fea97495032501c9934e4d22c5b09c0ee5575bb5039e8f.txt", "url": "https://doc.mbse-syson.org/syson/main/installation-guide/how-tos/install/production_deploy.html"}], "summary": "Eclipse SysON 是开源、Web 端的 SysML v2 建模环境：以系统模型为持久记录，提供图形、表单与表格编辑器，General/Interconnection 等视图展示模型元素，文本记法作为模型的附加视图；按 OMG SysML v2 标准与模型库组织工程系统，覆盖需求、架构与行为建模。程序本体为 EPL-2.0 开源核心（仓库内 SysML v2 标准库为 LGPL-3.0-only），可用单个可执行 JAR 配合 PostgreSQL 部署为多用户 Web 应用，并与 Capella、Papyrus 等 MBSE 工具互操作。", "technology_stack": ["Java", "Spring Boot", "Eclipse Sirius Web", "PostgreSQL"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:1143546390','vcad','{"deployment": ["官方提供免安装的浏览器 Web 应用 vcad.io", "仓库包含 packages/app Web 应用与 supabase 迁移，README 给出本地启动开发服务的命令；生产环境自托管未单独验证", "另提供 macOS 原生应用与 CLI；两者不作为本次 Web 应用服务形态的依据"], "features": ["约束草图与参数化特征：2D constraints、extrude、revolve、sweep、loft", "B-Rep 实体建模：primitives、booleans、fillets、chamfers、shell", "装配产品结构：parts、instances、joints、forward kinematics", "模型派生交付：STEP 导入，STL/GLB/STEP/DXF 导出", "浏览器 Web 应用，官方托管于 vcad.io；仓库含 React + Three.js 应用与 Supabase 云同步"], "github_repository_id": 1143546390, "homepage": "https://vcad.io", "id": "github:1143546390", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方 README 说明 vcad 是开源参数化 CAD，提供约束草图、拉伸/旋转/扫掠/放样等特征建模与 B-Rep 实体，构成工程模型和意图携带的可编辑定义；以 parts、instances、joints 和正向运动学组织装配产品结构；并支持 STEP/STL/GLB/DXF 导出，形成由模型派生的制造交付物。README 同时说明 Web App、React + Three.js 应用和 Supabase 云同步，满足完整 Web 应用服务形态。", "slug": "mechanical-cad", "source_urls": ["https://github.com/ecto/vcad", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ecto/vcad/main/README.md"]}], "license": "Apache-2.0", "license_evidence_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ecto/vcad/main/LICENSE", "license_review": {"rationale": "仓库根目录 LICENSE 为完整 Apache License 2.0 正文，含版本、条款与免责声明；README 亦明确写明以 Apache License 2.0 授权。", "reviewer": "opencode-go/deepseek-v4.1-flash collection pass", "scope": "repository", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ecto/vcad/main/LICENSE", "spdx_id": "Apache-2.0"}, "name": "vcad", "repository_url": "https://github.com/ecto/vcad", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:31:44.402920+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "15f143701772b9a72a1cafa951639e560c5f510c9a7bcb2599c2b62a2a09f1c0", "snapshot_path": "sources/15f143701772b9a72a1cafa951639e560c5f510c9a7bcb2599c2b62a2a09f1c0.txt", "url": "https://github.com/ecto/vcad"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:32:00.262229+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "a71e004c0f562b2ab14583010568e5ce96f0cb431e1a1a84d9e309ddac7939c2", "snapshot_path": "sources/a71e004c0f562b2ab14583010568e5ce96f0cb431e1a1a84d9e309ddac7939c2.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ecto/vcad/main/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:32:09.807043+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "f2273114f8f1c93b32a8e9b2569743fda0aba5ad3d1ddbec2093780020cdd0de", "snapshot_path": "sources/f2273114f8f1c93b32a8e9b2569743fda0aba5ad3d1ddbec2093780020cdd0de.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ecto/vcad/main/LICENSE"}], "summary": "开源参数化机械 CAD Web 应用：以约束草图和特征构建 B-Rep 实体，以部件、实例和关节组织装配并支持正向运动学，可从模型导出 STEP、DXF 等制造交付物；仓库包含浏览器端应用与 Supabase 云同步，官方另运营 vcad.io 托管服务。", "technology_stack": ["Rust", "WebAssembly", "TypeScript", "React", "Three.js", "Supabase"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:862650765','tscircuit','{"deployment": ["托管在线版：tscircuit.com，可直接在浏览器使用，无需安装", "仓库提供本地开发与生产构建：Bun 安装依赖，bun run dev 启动开发服务器，bun run build 生成生产构建", "开发模式使用 fake API；完整生产后端/注册表部署未在本次验证"], "features": ["在线编辑器：创建 board/module 项目，TypeScript 语法高亮、补全与类型检查", "板级设计：board 轮廓与尺寸，footprint 放置及自定义（platedhole、smtpad 等）", "连接性：net 分组网络，trace 连接元件/网络/引脚，支持铜宽、长度约束与 pcbPath 手工走线", "实时 PCB/原理图/3D 视图与自动布线", "制造输出：Gerber 铜层、钻孔、板框、BOM，在线下载 fabrication files", "分享与协作：项目分享、评论、版本差异与回滚（官网/README 所述）"], "github_repository_id": 862650765, "homepage": "https://tscircuit.com", "id": "github:862650765", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "tscircuit.com 仓库 README 明确其为创建/共享/管理电路设计的 Web 应用与在线编辑器，可设计电路板、封装和 3D 模型，实时预览 PCB，并给出本地开发与生产构建说明；官方 Web Quickstart 说明无需安装即可在在线编辑器创建 board，查看 PCB/Schematic/3D 并下载制造文件；官方文档正文给出 net（网络分组）、trace（铜走线/铜宽/pcbPath）、footprint（platedhole/smtpad 封装）与 Gerber/钻孔/BOM 制造输出。据此覆盖板、封装、网表、铜几何、制造输出核心，且形态为完整 Web 应用服务而非桌面/CLI/SDK。", "slug": "pcb-design", "source_urls": ["https://github.com/tscircuit/tscircuit.com", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tscircuit/tscircuit.com/main/README.md", "https://tscircuit.com/", "https://docs.tscircuit.com/", "https://docs.tscircuit.com/intro/quickstart-web", "https://docs.tscircuit.com/guides/understanding-fabrication-files", "https://docs.tscircuit.com/elements/net", "https://docs.tscircuit.com/elements/trace", "https://docs.tscircuit.com/elements/footprint"]}], "license": "MIT", "license_evidence_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tscircuit/tscircuit.com/main/LICENSE", "license_review": {"rationale": "仓库根目录 LICENSE 为完整 MIT 文本，含版权声明、许可授予与免责声明；README 的 License 段亦明确写明 MIT。", "reviewer": "collector: deepseek-v4.1-flash (unit 137)", "scope": "repository", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tscircuit/tscircuit.com/main/LICENSE", "spdx_id": "MIT"}, "name": "tscircuit", "repository_url": "https://github.com/tscircuit/tscircuit.com", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:33:23.219957+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "102afa1429b192d9dc6cd952e19cd3abe2d6be3414075447277f7457154fcf30", "snapshot_path": "sources/102afa1429b192d9dc6cd952e19cd3abe2d6be3414075447277f7457154fcf30.txt", "url": "https://github.com/tscircuit/tscircuit.com"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:33:21.674776+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "0cf63448d1de225a3cb6043c3ecf385d3bd5108d2fee05d721ac4252fd891dea", "snapshot_path": "sources/0cf63448d1de225a3cb6043c3ecf385d3bd5108d2fee05d721ac4252fd891dea.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tscircuit/tscircuit.com/main/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:33:21.743500+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "a5f5fb24026081322e48c6de970de4300dbc516fcddf02468d74b3978909f156", "snapshot_path": "sources/a5f5fb24026081322e48c6de970de4300dbc516fcddf02468d74b3978909f156.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tscircuit/tscircuit.com/main/LICENSE"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:33:41.575863+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "9f716dcedbb9058218fe398e79170e07fcdc1425b9ab72bbee98e2f9141f8436", "snapshot_path": "sources/9f716dcedbb9058218fe398e79170e07fcdc1425b9ab72bbee98e2f9141f8436.txt", "url": "https://tscircuit.com/"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:33:41.636165+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "f9a31cfe71b13755328527b3c6be0681e4914d3f00b83d6ccc60d31583f60196", "snapshot_path": "sources/f9a31cfe71b13755328527b3c6be0681e4914d3f00b83d6ccc60d31583f60196.txt", "url": "https://docs.tscircuit.com/"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:33:53.268989+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "2b35e4978f5444b0cb951385d5872ca221cddb42212fa9fbbda4d2fd878ecbdf", "snapshot_path": "sources/2b35e4978f5444b0cb951385d5872ca221cddb42212fa9fbbda4d2fd878ecbdf.txt", "url": "https://docs.tscircuit.com/intro/quickstart-web"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:33:41.665815+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "5eb254fdce309970d480a6aa3f313649a550346804dca734604ecbfc2c7e0f84", "snapshot_path": "sources/5eb254fdce309970d480a6aa3f313649a550346804dca734604ecbfc2c7e0f84.txt", "url": "https://docs.tscircuit.com/guides/understanding-fabrication-files"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:34:09.750244+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "bb8de82904a9238208526e4688437973dcb93fadcb99b830d43b4166be41b237", "snapshot_path": "sources/bb8de82904a9238208526e4688437973dcb93fadcb99b830d43b4166be41b237.txt", "url": "https://docs.tscircuit.com/elements/net"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:34:10.048362+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "e6095f0e3ca9d54e41f2da195e18b6bc278edf6ceae81ce010a3e44d86958335", "snapshot_path": "sources/e6095f0e3ca9d54e41f2da195e18b6bc278edf6ceae81ce010a3e44d86958335.txt", "url": "https://docs.tscircuit.com/elements/trace"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:34:09.958864+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "62d763ddd5928a01bfd5518feb3a4c709c04d51efe9a820fea166b7a548d4f1b", "snapshot_path": "sources/62d763ddd5928a01bfd5518feb3a4c709c04d51efe9a820fea166b7a548d4f1b.txt", "url": "https://docs.tscircuit.com/elements/footprint"}], "summary": "开源（MIT）在线 PCB 设计 Web 应用：在浏览器中用 TypeScript/React 描述电路板，放置封装、定义网络与走线，实时查看 PCB/原理图/3D 视图，并下载 Gerber、钻孔、BOM 等制造文件；仓库包含在线编辑器及本地开发/生产构建脚本。", "technology_stack": ["React", "TypeScript", "Vite", "Tailwind CSS", "Bun"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:chipverify','ChipVerify Lab','{"homepage": "https://lab.chipverify.com/", "id": "commercial:chipverify", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方首页正文明确提供浏览器内 RTL→GDSII 全流程：Verilog 编辑、Icarus/Verilator 仿真、Yosys 综合、OpenSTA 时序、OpenROAD 布局布线、KLayout 版图查看、DRC/LVS 与 GDSII 导出；覆盖功能描述→电路实现→物理版图、验证与可制造数据三部分核心，且为持续可用的 Web 应用服务。", "slug": "semiconductor-design-platform", "source_urls": ["https://lab.chipverify.com/"]}], "name": "ChipVerify Lab", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:35:23.825323+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "9920fd9a97236076aefc2de9f47958e3c470bc8790ffaed967390ec243023ed2", "snapshot_path": "sources/9920fd9a97236076aefc2de9f47958e3c470bc8790ffaed967390ec243023ed2.txt", "url": "https://lab.chipverify.com/"}], "summary": "商业浏览器端半导体设计平台：在 Web IDE 中编写 Verilog，完成仿真、综合、时序分析、OpenROAD 布局布线、DRC/LVS，并导出可供制造的 GDSII。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:1159568793','OpenMES','{"deployment": ["Docker Compose 自托管（Laravel + PostgreSQL 两个容器）", "提供单命令安装脚本与在线演示；平板/PWA 操作员端"], "features": ["多产线排程与工单生命周期（Pending/Accepted/In Progress/Paused/Done）", "实时产线状态（运行、换型、故障、计划停机、非计划停机）及批次/工序进度", "Andon 问题上报、预定义类别（物料短缺、质量缺陷、工具故障、机器故障）、升级主管与处置闭环", "关键问题自动阻断工单，解决后可继续生产", "停机原因分解、停机报表、计划与实际产量、周期时间、问题趋势与 OEE 看板/API", "质量检验与处置、维护事件、批次与物料谱系追溯", "MQTT 机器数据采集、REST API、CSV/Excel 从 SAP/Odoo/Comarch 导入"], "github_repository_id": 1159568793, "homepage": "https://getopenmes.com", "id": "github:1159568793", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "三项定义核心均有官方正文：主管指南中的产线实时状态表、工单/批次/工序进度与当前班次历史构成实时运营图景；操作员按类别上报问题、主管接收并按 Open→Acknowledged→Resolved→Closed 处理且关键问题阻断工单，构成事件—响应闭环；停机原因分解、计划与实际产量、周期时间、问题趋势及 OEE 看板/API 构成运营绩效记录。README 还说明 MQTT 机器数据、REST API 与 ERP/CSV 导入，覆盖计划下行和实际/状态上行。", "slug": "factory-operations-management", "source_urls": ["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Mes-Open/OpenMes/main/README.md", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Mes-Open/OpenMes/main/docs/supervisor-guide.md", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Mes-Open/OpenMes/main/docs/isa95.md"]}], "license": "AGPL-3.0", "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Mes-Open/OpenMes/license", "name": "OpenMES", "repository_url": "https://github.com/Mes-Open/OpenMes", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:43:52.279392+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "79cd987480662899c877f270735d29851ee220e8715d3aaec4908acfdd5ccdc0", "snapshot_path": "sources/79cd987480662899c877f270735d29851ee220e8715d3aaec4908acfdd5ccdc0.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Mes-Open/OpenMes/license"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:43:51.306983+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "0ee12524bc1a733eec6147a1308e4380383491f5d0f5c05806b13468e6b19641", "snapshot_path": "sources/0ee12524bc1a733eec6147a1308e4380383491f5d0f5c05806b13468e6b19641.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Mes-Open/OpenMes/main/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:43:51.877447+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "217dba89650d4097c4cfdd36dcb5e1da9d816fddccbbd8ae1355793c75f4dd5e", "snapshot_path": "sources/217dba89650d4097c4cfdd36dcb5e1da9d816fddccbbd8ae1355793c75f4dd5e.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Mes-Open/OpenMes"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:43:51.702330+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "7120034ea08e83f0fb221120ebb74a63ff125dd5ad4cfec6624f65c4f33aa6fe", "snapshot_path": "sources/7120034ea08e83f0fb221120ebb74a63ff125dd5ad4cfec6624f65c4f33aa6fe.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Mes-Open/OpenMes/main/docs/isa95.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:43:51.238310+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "caa75ec4dccc4c06acbc68efe6a8182bc4b4cefe5b5ab38afa6c8801bc4f0cd7", "snapshot_path": "sources/caa75ec4dccc4c06acbc68efe6a8182bc4b4cefe5b5ab38afa6c8801bc4f0cd7.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Mes-Open/OpenMes/main/docs/supervisor-guide.md"}], "summary": "可自托管的开源制造执行系统（MES）Web 应用，面向中小制造车间。以产线、工位、工单、批次与工序为实时运营对象，操作员可按类别上报问题并由主管按 Open→Acknowledged→Resolved→Closed 流程处理，关键问题自动阻断工单；提供停机原因与停机报表、计划与实际产量、周期时间和 OEE 看板，并通过 MQTT、REST API 与 ERP/CSV 导入连接计划层和机器层。", "technology_stack": ["PHP", "Laravel 12", "Livewire 4", "PostgreSQL 17", "Docker", "MQTT"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:1333252617','ScanRuler','{"deployment": ["浏览器端静态 Web 应用（Vite + React + three.js），无需安装客户端", "官方托管实例 https://scanruler.com/，源码可自行构建和自托管", "扫描件与计算均在本地浏览器处理，不上传服务器；无多租户后端"], "features": ["载入 STL/PLY/OBJ/3MF/STEP 扫描件和名义 CAD 网格或 STEP", "按 3-2-1 基准、自动对齐或 ICP 最佳拟合完成零件对齐", "拟合球、圆柱、圆锥、圆环、平面、圆等几何特征", "构造点、线、面并测量距离、角度、直径和半径", "为尺寸设置名义值及正负公差并逐项给出 PASS/FAIL", "按 ISO 1101 评估形状、方向、位置 GD&T 并汇总通过/超差计数", "生成偏差色图、壁厚图和二维截面测量", "保存 .scanruler 工程，复制检验摘要/报告并导出 CSV、SVG、DXF、STEP"], "github_repository_id": 1333252617, "homepage": "https://scanruler.com/", "id": "github:1333252617", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方 README 与用户手册正文显示可核对的最小闭环：载入扫描件作为被测几何，载入名义 CAD 网格/STEP 或为尺寸输入名义值与正负公差；以 3-2-1/自动对齐/ICP 建立坐标关系，拟合球、圆柱、平面、圆等特征，计算尺寸、角度和表面偏差，逐特性给出 PASS/FAIL 并汇总计数，GD&T 限值同样逐项判定；工程保存、复制摘要/报告及 CSV 导出构成零件级检验记录。应用为浏览器端完整 Web 应用，官方托管且可自托管；开源 AGPL 仓库覆盖四个检测工作区，闭源的仅是逆向建模和网格编辑附加工具。", "slug": "inspection-metrology-software", "source_urls": ["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/CNCKitchen/ScanRuler/main/README.md", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/CNCKitchen/ScanRuler/main/docs/manual.md", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/CNCKitchen/ScanRuler/main/COMMERCIAL.md", "https://api.github.com/repos/CNCKitchen/ScanRuler"]}], "license": "AGPL-3.0", "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/CNCKitchen/ScanRuler/license", "name": "ScanRuler", "repository_url": "https://github.com/CNCKitchen/ScanRuler", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:46:34.824194+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "5e7a301b965c694ec7a19a75c961a9c7dd00a22ae7f99fef4dc51a7fddd8dcb9", "snapshot_path": "sources/5e7a301b965c694ec7a19a75c961a9c7dd00a22ae7f99fef4dc51a7fddd8dcb9.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/CNCKitchen/ScanRuler"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:46:34.590686+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "721cabb6505faa8dc84710cf5ea8f819b5833eaba7574fe74345bfc49271a007", "snapshot_path": "sources/721cabb6505faa8dc84710cf5ea8f819b5833eaba7574fe74345bfc49271a007.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/CNCKitchen/ScanRuler/main/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:46:35.112919+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "51a22bd54b7530770840ee74ba2f67d801b233fcd04b34c21fe03ec25186dd3d", "snapshot_path": "sources/51a22bd54b7530770840ee74ba2f67d801b233fcd04b34c21fe03ec25186dd3d.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/CNCKitchen/ScanRuler/license"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:46:35.462391+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "5a38bd223933003062372a459b4ad4bcf559667f2d4ea17ddc9701bbabb035a8", "snapshot_path": "sources/5a38bd223933003062372a459b4ad4bcf559667f2d4ea17ddc9701bbabb035a8.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/CNCKitchen/ScanRuler/main/docs/manual.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:46:34.791095+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "ed5fe121dba3b83d873089fe22995e2e27d8257e30e4d5e5286756573039f439", "snapshot_path": "sources/ed5fe121dba3b83d873089fe22995e2e27d8257e30e4d5e5286756573039f439.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/CNCKitchen/ScanRuler/main/COMMERCIAL.md"}], "summary": "开源浏览器端三维/二维检测与计量应用：载入扫描件（STL/PLY/OBJ/3MF/STEP）和名义 CAD 网格或 STEP，按 3-2-1 基准、自动对齐或 ICP 最佳拟合建立坐标关系，拟合球、圆柱、平面、圆等特征并测量距离与角度；可为尺寸输入名义值及正负公差，逐项判定 PASS/FAIL 并汇总计数，另支持 ISO 1101 形状/方向/位置 GD&T 及公差限，输出偏差色图、保存 .scanruler 工程并复制检验摘要/报告或导出 CSV。开源仓库覆盖 3D Measure、Deviation、Wall thickness、2D Measure 四个工作区；scanruler.com 上的 Reverse engineer 与 Mesh Tools 为闭源附加模块，不属于 AGPL 社区核心。", "technology_stack": ["TypeScript", "React", "three.js", "Vite", "Web Worker"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:relyence-rcm','Relyence RCM','{"homepage": "https://relyence.com", "id": "commercial:relyence-rcm", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "Official RCM product page shows browser-based RCM analysis with decision diagrams, worksheets, failure consequences and maintenance task schedules, FMEA data integration and SAE JA1011/JA1012, MIL-HDBK-2173 and NAVAIR templates, matching the failure-evaluation-to-maintenance-strategy core; the page also evidences no-download trial access, confirming an application service rather than only a desktop client.", "slug": "reliability-management", "source_urls": ["https://relyence.com/products/rcm/"]}], "name": "Relyence RCM", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:44:34.689512+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "5ae23800bb49b1a0a990867db2ac83fe7e024928b0230d14f56838e7b0ed3bd8", "snapshot_path": "sources/5ae23800bb49b1a0a990867db2ac83fe7e024928b0230d14f56838e7b0ed3bd8.txt", "url": "https://relyence.com/products/rcm/"}], "summary": "Commercial browser-based Reliability Centered Maintenance analysis software for building RCM decision diagrams and worksheets, recording failure consequences and maintenance tasks, and developing standards-based maintenance strategies.", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:1287198494','Reliafy','{"deployment": ["Self-hosted via docker compose, served on a single port", "Single-user self-host mode with no login page", "MongoDB persistence with an in-memory fallback when MongoDB is unavailable", "Hosted cloud edition adds accounts, team workspaces and an optional AI assistant; the core codebase remains AGPL-3.0"], "features": ["RCM studies structured as Function → Functional failure → Failure mode worksheets with effects, consequences and maintenance decisions", "Each maintenance decision links to the fitted life model, cost-optimal replacement analysis, degradation model or availability calculation that supports it", "Live revalidation marks decisions as supported, unverified or contradicted when new failure data changes the underlying evidence", "Life-distribution modelling with Weibull, Exponential, Normal, Lognormal, Gamma and proportional-hazards models for exact, censored and truncated data", "Reliability block diagrams with series, parallel, k-out-of-n and standby arrangements, system reliability, MTTF, importance measures and minimal cut sets", "Maintenance strategy comparison and cost-optimal preventive-replacement interval calculation", "Datasets and saved models reusable across analyses; RCM worksheets export to CSV for reports and audits"], "github_repository_id": 1287198494, "homepage": "https://reliafy.com", "id": "github:1287198494", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "Official README and RCM product page describe Function → Functional failure → Failure mode worksheets in which every maintenance decision cites the fitted life model, cost-optimal replacement analysis, degradation model or availability calculation, with live revalidation when failure data changes; together with maintenance-strategy optimisation and CSV export this covers the failure-knowledge-to-strategy loop in a complete self-hostable web application.", "slug": "reliability-management", "source_urls": ["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Reliafy/reliafy/main/README.md", "https://reliafy.com/rcm-software"]}], "license": "AGPL-3.0", "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Reliafy/reliafy/license", "name": "Reliafy", "repository_url": "https://github.com/Reliafy/reliafy", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:44:10.037336+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "1a228c4aaaba06f278d8e10126ebda3bf99c78405fa03c5fe43b5edc0d8bac91", "snapshot_path": "sources/1a228c4aaaba06f278d8e10126ebda3bf99c78405fa03c5fe43b5edc0d8bac91.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Reliafy/reliafy"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:44:12.031018+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "d4d053b6a7d9410ac7766bdf99dd2c4d006e5eda0e991f82d9d6a4a457809bec", "snapshot_path": "sources/d4d053b6a7d9410ac7766bdf99dd2c4d006e5eda0e991f82d9d6a4a457809bec.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Reliafy/reliafy/license"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:44:14.110618+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "8591d984611b94ed49a7bffd4cbc5b2bbbdb7033d5515f4d494b4b37e7490ca8", "snapshot_path": "sources/8591d984611b94ed49a7bffd4cbc5b2bbbdb7033d5515f4d494b4b37e7490ca8.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Reliafy/reliafy/main/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:44:34.409094+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "641cba4714907564e65e9aa164e48c961cffaaab0994cc2273f83e69d13e4449", "snapshot_path": "sources/641cba4714907564e65e9aa164e48c961cffaaab0994cc2273f83e69d13e4449.txt", "url": "https://reliafy.com/"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:45:00.633913+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "5db2666d69ef961abcee10a0ca68fa4f94d244ce700794ae4fe50cf61ad5b990", "snapshot_path": "sources/5db2666d69ef961abcee10a0ca68fa4f94d244ce700794ae4fe50cf61ad5b990.txt", "url": "https://reliafy.com/rcm-software"}], "summary": "Open-source reliability engineering web app (AGPL-3.0 core) that fits life-distribution models to failure data and links every RCM maintenance decision to the analysis that justifies it, revalidating those links when new failure data arrives.", "technology_stack": ["FastAPI", "React", "MongoDB", "SurPyval", "RePyability", "Docker"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:flexgen-hybridos','FlexGen HybridOS','{"homepage": "https://www.flexgen.com/software/hybridos-energy-management-system", "id": "commercial:flexgen-hybridos", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方页面正文说明 HybridOS 管理电池充放电模式，支持单站点和站点组合（fleet）的调度与实时监控，并覆盖性能/健康/可用性管理、收入优化、计量核对（revenue check meter）、电池控制与保护，符合储能资产充放电运营与收益管理的核心用途；该页面为厂商材料，未独立核验客户、合同或实际交付。", "slug": "battery-energy-storage-management", "source_urls": ["https://www.flexgen.com/software/hybridos-energy-management-system"]}], "name": "FlexGen HybridOS", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T12:59:04.996316+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "47896f934faf92e3e44062b2649be96fa782faae7bc1e4731f60f2ea2f8c9ae7", "snapshot_path": "sources/47896f934faf92e3e44062b2649be96fa782faae7bc1e4731f60f2ea2f8c9ae7.txt", "url": "https://www.flexgen.com/software/hybridos-energy-management-system"}], "summary": "面向电池储能站点与资产组合（fleet）的商用能量管理系统，提供充放电模式管理、站点与组合级调度、实时监控、性能/健康/可用性管理、收入优化与计量核对，以及电池控制和保护。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:nokia-mantaray-nm','Nokia MantaRay NM','{"homepage": "https://www.nokia.com/autonomous-networks/network-management/", "id": "commercial:nokia-mantaray-nm", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "Nokia 官方 MantaRay NM 页面说明该网络管理系统面向移动运营商，统一管理现网中的 radio/core/transport 网元，提供配置管理、软件管理、性能管理、告警关联与故障排查，并明确“mass change verification on network elements”；覆盖 2G/3G/4G/5G 多技术网络，符合本叶对现网受管资产及配置-故障-性能闭环的核心要求。", "slug": "mobile-network-management", "source_urls": ["https://www.nokia.com/autonomous-networks/network-management/"]}], "name": "Nokia MantaRay NM", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:04:50.107680+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "9d99282b60bf5a9564e315a4bcaa18b0ad5a2b22c0324f5a1ebd34742e88ffb0", "snapshot_path": "sources/9d99282b60bf5a9564e315a4bcaa18b0ad5a2b22c0324f5a1ebd34742e88ffb0.txt", "url": "https://www.nokia.com/autonomous-networks/network-management/"}], "summary": "面向移动运营商的多技术网络管理系统；官方页面称其为覆盖 RAN 与核心网的单一管理系统，提供现网网元配置/软件管理、性能管理、告警关联、故障排查与批量变更验证，支持 2G/3G/4G/5G。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:170803235','Magma NMS','{"deployment": ["Docker Compose 自托管 NMS 与 Orchestrator", "需要 PostgreSQL、Prometheus/Grafana 等依赖", "支持私有云或自托管部署"], "features": ["组织、网络、网关与 eNodeB、用户、策略/APN 的创建与管理", "网关/eNodeB 配置开通、软件升级与远程重启", "访问网关和用户的 KPI/状态仪表盘与指标分析", "告警展示、故障定位与处置", "呼叫跟踪等远程排障"], "github_repository_id": 170803235, "homepage": "https://magma.github.io/magma/", "id": "github:170803235", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "Magma NMS 官方文档明确其为 provisioning and operating Magma based networks 的企业级 GUI，可创建/管理 Organizations、Networks、Gateways and eNodeBs、Subscribers、Policies and APNs；仪表盘展示接入网关与用户 KPI/状态、firing alerts，并提供远程重启、软件升级和呼叫跟踪等故障处置。结合 README 中 Orchestrator 对无线网络的配置/监控与指标能力，可对应本叶四项核心：现网网关/eNodeB 受管资产、配置下发与软件升级、告警处置、KPI/指标性能管理。边界说明：其受管对象是 Magma 网络的网关与 eNodeB，并非多厂商宏站网管；本叶未要求多厂商，故按核心闭环收录，不扩展到 OSS 伞形或规划工具。", "slug": "mobile-network-management", "source_urls": ["https://github.com/magma/magma", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/magma/magma/master/README.md", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/magma/magma/master/LICENSE", "https://magma.github.io/magma/docs/nms/overview"]}], "license": "BSD-3-Clause", "license_evidence_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/magma/magma/master/LICENSE", "license_review": {"rationale": "仓库 LICENSE 为完整 BSD-3-Clause 文本，含版权声明、再分发三条款与免责声明；GitHub API 未自动识别（NOASSERTION），故按原始许可证文本人工核对并绑定该来源。", "reviewer": "opencode-go/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "scope": "repository", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/magma/magma/master/LICENSE", "spdx_id": "BSD-3-Clause"}, "name": "Magma NMS", "repository_url": "https://github.com/magma/magma", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:06:53.811158+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "0facc9dd5e41f2259e1dc3a445fa6d39a2b87904e0d63d3f56c89908d80059bd", "snapshot_path": "sources/0facc9dd5e41f2259e1dc3a445fa6d39a2b87904e0d63d3f56c89908d80059bd.txt", "url": "https://github.com/magma/magma"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:06:55.544291+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "3d95841656dfdcedf28ba7bda4758f0c6a659d428a1e6d8e59f4c9c1527cf2cf", "snapshot_path": "sources/3d95841656dfdcedf28ba7bda4758f0c6a659d428a1e6d8e59f4c9c1527cf2cf.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/magma/magma/master/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:06:57.174507+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "a08fac18983788f67dbd15f93faf5edb56f48ac5907b3a98732b056a30e74ec4", "snapshot_path": "sources/a08fac18983788f67dbd15f93faf5edb56f48ac5907b3a98732b056a30e74ec4.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/magma/magma/master/LICENSE"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:06:58.945311+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "4a7333a1058553d1fd6fc407c83ece9249ce13ab4729195d38e7ae39bbc232c4", "snapshot_path": "sources/4a7333a1058553d1fd6fc407c83ece9249ce13ab4729195d38e7ae39bbc232c4.txt", "url": "https://magma.github.io/magma/docs/nms/overview"}], "summary": "开源移动网络管理系统：Magma Orchestrator 的 NMS Web 界面，面向 Magma LTE/5G 网络，管理组织/网络、网关与 eNodeB、用户与策略，提供配置开通、软件升级、KPI/指标、告警与远程故障处置。", "technology_stack": ["Web UI（Magma NMS）", "Magma Orchestrator（Orc8r）", "PostgreSQL", "Prometheus / Grafana", "Docker / Kubernetes"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:2196186','Ekylibre','{"deployment": ["自托管 Web 应用", "Docker Compose（开发/生产）", "Ubuntu 原生安装"], "features": ["会计：日记账、会计期间、科目表、VAT、资金、固定资产、试算与总账", "采购：采购订单→收货→发票→付款", "销售：报价/订单→发货→开票→收款", "库存：初始库存、库存移动、交付/发货、盘点", "农业生产：地块与作物活动、按 campaign 的生产、干预计划与记录、生产成本", "库存、采购、销售与盘点自动生成会计分录", "栽培记录、植保登记等可追溯文档", "多用户角色与权限管理"], "github_repository_id": 2196186, "homepage": "https://ekylibre.org/", "id": "github:2196186", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方主页列出会计、销售、采购等经营功能并声明全部组件开源；用户文档第 8 章说明库存从初始库存、移动、交付到盘点，且库存、采购收货、销售发货与盘点校验会自动转为会计分录；第 9 章说明地块/作物活动、按 campaign 的生产、干预与生产成本；技术文档与 README 证明其为可自托管的 Ruby on Rails 完整 Web 应用。会计、采购、销售、库存与农业生产共用同一后台，符合本叶‘单一集成后台 + 农业生产模型 + 农产品库存与商品流’的核心。官方材料未展示种植者合同结算或接收质检分级定价，未将该类附加规则写入关系。", "slug": "agribusiness-erp", "source_urls": ["https://ekylibre.org/", "https://ekylibre.org/fr/user-doc/chapitre8", "https://ekylibre.org/fr/user-doc/chapitre9", "https://ekylibre.org/techdoc/", "https://api.github.com/repos/ekylibre/ekylibre/readme"]}], "license": "AGPL-3.0", "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ekylibre/ekylibre/license", "name": "Ekylibre", "repository_url": "https://github.com/ekylibre/ekylibre", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:02:21.606862+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "34888f4c0873a6aa94f61b8a458accc776cebec5f562d2c341aa70722ef2f5b5", "snapshot_path": "sources/34888f4c0873a6aa94f61b8a458accc776cebec5f562d2c341aa70722ef2f5b5.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ekylibre/ekylibre"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:01:38.366632+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "96629854a1d396b789b4e7abd1ef6eb6aa301de7932fd047dbbda9453277f6c3", "snapshot_path": "sources/96629854a1d396b789b4e7abd1ef6eb6aa301de7932fd047dbbda9453277f6c3.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ekylibre/ekylibre/readme"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:01:38.683344+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "2347fed120ad814bf1b48d6c8135c0693c2dfcb21c0ace3bf5c0df4a45364f83", "snapshot_path": "sources/2347fed120ad814bf1b48d6c8135c0693c2dfcb21c0ace3bf5c0df4a45364f83.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ekylibre/ekylibre/license"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:02:27.854886+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "508d5dc15d0875f360cb14ac9bc0916b83c56fec7c32b2e95c07f498d459d071", "snapshot_path": "sources/508d5dc15d0875f360cb14ac9bc0916b83c56fec7c32b2e95c07f498d459d071.txt", "url": "https://ekylibre.org/"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:02:57.405411+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "221a26a4660423a75f9ee9c4bb89e93414f04ade94dd5ea1ebf60b5c52b5d380", "snapshot_path": "sources/221a26a4660423a75f9ee9c4bb89e93414f04ade94dd5ea1ebf60b5c52b5d380.txt", "url": "https://ekylibre.org/fr/user-doc/chapitre8"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:02:57.402739+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "34034c5ff075801fb4fd2c72f4265b17f39c9987e7f8be3ef71d77b5b2ceb20f", "snapshot_path": "sources/34034c5ff075801fb4fd2c72f4265b17f39c9987e7f8be3ef71d77b5b2ceb20f.txt", "url": "https://ekylibre.org/fr/user-doc/chapitre9"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:02:36.756800+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "25614fad01c30eb290397840eb3036afb58bcbb7c5d03846cf8c90e689fbb0b0", "snapshot_path": "sources/25614fad01c30eb290397840eb3036afb58bcbb7c5d03846cf8c90e689fbb0b0.txt", "url": "https://ekylibre.org/techdoc/"}], "summary": "Ekylibre 是开源的农业企业资源计划/农场管理信息系统，以 Ruby on Rails 构建的自托管 Web 应用。官方文档显示其把会计（日记账、总账、科目表、VAT、固定资产）、采购（订单→收货→发票）、销售（报价/订单→发货→开票）、库存（初始库存、移动、交付、盘点）与农业生产（地块、作物活动、按 campaign 的生产、干预与成本）放在同一后台，并自动把库存、采购、销售和盘点转换为会计分录。", "technology_stack": ["Ruby on Rails", "PostgreSQL/PostGIS", "Redis", "Sidekiq", "Caddy"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:flexmanager','FlexManager','{"homepage": "https://flexmanager.com/", "id": "commercial:flexmanager", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方 Environmental Incident 模块页正文说明其以单一事件记录承载从发现、调查到解决的闭环，采集 SDS 物质、地点与天气等信息，跟踪根因、纠正措施和清理工单，并提供面向环境法规的报告及 ISO 14001 风险评分/签核；覆盖环境事件记录、响应-调查-纠正闭环与监管报告姿态三项核心。", "slug": "environmental-incident-management", "source_urls": ["https://flexmanager.com/solutions/environmental-incident"]}], "name": "FlexManager", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:14:10.627311+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "1b200ed85d40fce0528967fa71f4c8e582cd56d8376afda03460abeab33f3df9", "snapshot_path": "sources/1b200ed85d40fce0528967fa71f4c8e582cd56d8376afda03460abeab33f3df9.txt", "url": "https://flexmanager.com/solutions/environmental-incident"}], "summary": "面向 EHS/合规团队的 SaaS 环境事件管理模块：以单一事件记录贯穿发现、调查、解决与纠正措施，记录 SDS 物质、地点和天气，支持根因分析、清理工单、环境法规报告与 ISO 14001 风险评分/签核。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:quire','Quire TRM','{"homepage": "https://www.openquire.com/", "id": "commercial:quire", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方 CRE 尽调页正文将 records research、site observations/photos、report creation、review and approval、delivery to client or lender 描述为一条治理工作流，支持 Phase I/II ESA 并按 ASTM 要求配置模板；TRM 平台页进一步说明从 field data、结构化模板撰写、复核审批到发布交付的完整生命周期。以项目/物业/客户为记录单元，三项核心结构均有官方正文支撑。", "slug": "environmental-site-assessment", "source_urls": ["https://www.openquire.com/cre-due-diligence/", "https://www.openquire.com/trm-platform/"]}], "name": "Quire TRM", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:15:32.070414+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "445c81018b1600f50197792e9f14e3a6bb482371520735258fedf9cbec90ec22", "snapshot_path": "sources/445c81018b1600f50197792e9f14e3a6bb482371520735258fedf9cbec90ec22.txt", "url": "https://www.openquire.com/cre-due-diligence/"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:16:12.995522+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "25d8340aeab8b704515ccec137a71d0920ae5e60157819aab69fb43b182ff79f", "snapshot_path": "sources/25d8340aeab8b704515ccec137a71d0920ae5e60157819aab69fb43b182ff79f.txt", "url": "https://www.openquire.com/trm-platform/"}], "summary": "面向商业房地产技术尽调的报告管理平台：官方页面称其把案卷研究、现场数据（含移动端照片与观察记录）、报告撰写、复核审批和交付连成一体，并支持 Phase I/II ESA 与 ASTM 模板。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:805297890','TianGong LCA','{"deployment": ["官方托管 Web 服务 https://lca.tiangong.earth", "Docker 私有部署", "团队数据空间、审核与系统管理工作区"], "features": ["在 My Data 中创建 flow 与 process，填写输入输出并指定 reference flow", "用节点选择器把 processes 组装为 model，连接节点流并设置 reference process 与 reference flow quantity", "保存 model 后生成聚合清单结果，供其他模型复用", "process 级与 model 级 LCIA，支持影响方法、特征化因子覆盖检查、影响类别对比与贡献路径分析", "TIDAS ZIP 导入导出、OpenAPI/MCP/CLI 集成、团队数据空间与审核协作"], "github_repository_id": 805297890, "homepage": "https://tiangong.earth", "id": "github:805297890", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方建模文档说明在 Web 工作区创建 flows/processes，以 reference flow 连接节点组装 model，并设置 reference process 与 reference flow quantity；保存后生成聚合清单。LCIA 文档说明把 life cycle inventory 转成气候变化、酸化等影响类别结果，并要求 reference flow 或 functional unit 正确；平台同时提供 process/model 级 LCIA 与贡献路径分析。README 确认完全开源、提供在线服务和 Docker 私有部署，构成完整 Web 应用服务。", "slug": "life-cycle-assessment-application", "source_urls": ["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tiangong-lca/platform/main/README.md", "https://docs.tiangong.earth/en/docs/user-guide/create-my-data/", "https://docs.tiangong.earth/en/docs/user-guide/lcia/", "https://www.tiangong.earth/en"]}], "license": "MIT", "license_evidence_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tiangong-lca/platform/main/LICENSE", "license_review": {"rationale": "仓库根目录 LICENSE 快照包含完整 MIT 许可正文（版权声明、授权条款与免责声明），与 tiangong-lca/platform 仓库身份绑定，据此确认仓库整体为 MIT 许可。", "reviewer": "opencode-go/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "scope": "repository", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tiangong-lca/platform/main/LICENSE", "spdx_id": "MIT"}, "name": "TianGong LCA", "repository_url": "https://github.com/tiangong-lca/platform", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:23:40.572857+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "0996080fa9f818d64defa987d8d15952589a1fdbec344985ec6681bd14ca4529", "snapshot_path": "sources/0996080fa9f818d64defa987d8d15952589a1fdbec344985ec6681bd14ca4529.txt", "url": "https://github.com/tiangong-lca/platform"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:23:48.981218+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "e3ed13005802307e1abf6f641f8720612b8682c3759294f4d394f05a541c0c74", "snapshot_path": "sources/e3ed13005802307e1abf6f641f8720612b8682c3759294f4d394f05a541c0c74.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tiangong-lca/platform/main/LICENSE"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:23:48.999491+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "53badc4fa4c71be7beeb0f125824d4967ea916874a6e0b6ebd47e5a5bd9e968d", "snapshot_path": "sources/53badc4fa4c71be7beeb0f125824d4967ea916874a6e0b6ebd47e5a5bd9e968d.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tiangong-lca/platform/main/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:23:49.571240+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "844bd508a03bcfe0c7bdb11276ac6389e97c80b248c5e5ab768e36f4cdf4137b", "snapshot_path": "sources/844bd508a03bcfe0c7bdb11276ac6389e97c80b248c5e5ab768e36f4cdf4137b.txt", "url": "https://docs.tiangong.earth/en/docs/user-guide/create-my-data/"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:23:49.399340+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "e104d65eab45ba2e7a0556a434362257115f2599fdc2a1267bdb7fb850dcadb5", "snapshot_path": "sources/e104d65eab45ba2e7a0556a434362257115f2599fdc2a1267bdb7fb850dcadb5.txt", "url": "https://docs.tiangong.earth/en/docs/user-guide/lcia/"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:23:49.713501+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "b7c813f939b697136751b0770024fe4fe6cffd03d0e02eb8756821858ab36e55", "snapshot_path": "sources/b7c813f939b697136751b0770024fe4fe6cffd03d0e02eb8756821858ab36e55.txt", "url": "https://www.tiangong.earth/en"}], "summary": "TianGong LCA（天工 LCA）是 MIT 许可、完全开源的 Web 生命周期评估平台，提供在线服务与 Docker 私有部署：用户在浏览器工作区创建 flow/process、连接输入输出并设定 reference flow，把多个 processes 组装成 model，保存后生成聚合清单，并运行 process/model 级 LCIA、影响类别对比与贡献路径分析。", "technology_stack": ["Web 前端（浏览器访问）", "Docker", "OpenAPI / MCP / CLI 集成"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:costing-nature','Co$tingNature','{"homepage": "https://www.policysupport.org/costingnature", "id": "commercial:costing-nature", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方产品页正文（同一页面的可读正文快照）明确其为 web-based spatial policy support system，用于 natural capital accounting、识别生态系统服务受益者并评估人类干预；页面说明系统以空间数据与模型量化 18 类服务的供给与需求，计算现状基线并比较政策选项或土地/气候情景对服务交付的影响，输出地图、受益者分析、保护与投资优先区等决策材料，闭合“资产存量→服务量化→变化评估→决策输出”核心。页面所称 open access 指 Co$tingNatureMAP/global/local 可视化入口；PSS 本体需创建账号，Scientist 级非商业免费，Superuser/Hyperuser/Megauser 及商业用途需许可，故按 commercial 记录。", "slug": "natural-capital-management", "source_urls": ["https://www.policysupport.org/costingnature", "https://www.policysupport.org/access-costs"]}], "name": "Co$tingNature", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:27:38.917735+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "eeaeabb1b17eee831e5d047c987645d6f94215fd97ccb25fcf38f5ec6202c200", "snapshot_path": "sources/eeaeabb1b17eee831e5d047c987645d6f94215fd97ccb25fcf38f5ec6202c200.txt", "url": "https://www.policysupport.org/costingnature"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:27:38.917735+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "20a5b602287f558ec8e8bc291adcada932c33daab20662c4f2daf1fc58aaeed2", "snapshot_path": "sources/20a5b602287f558ec8e8bc291adcada932c33daab20662c4f2daf1fc58aaeed2.txt", "url": "https://www.policysupport.org/costingnature"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:34:37.159003+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "6a30c06810789ece9fcbdd936401ba308c1bf535eff4362e83dcee15fc85444c", "snapshot_path": "sources/6a30c06810789ece9fcbdd936401ba308c1bf535eff4362e83dcee15fc85444c.txt", "url": "https://www.policysupport.org/access-costs"}], "summary": "Co$tingNature（V3）是由 King''s College London、AmbioTEK 与 UNEP-WCMC 参与开发的托管式 Web 空间政策支持系统（PSS），用于自然资本核算与生态系统服务分析。系统以全球空间数据与生物物理/社会经济模型量化生态系统服务的供给与需求（产品页称 18 类），先计算现状基线，再叠加土地利用或气候情景/政策干预，比较服务变化及其对受益者的影响，输出地图、受益者分析、保护与投资优先区等决策材料。PSS 需注册账号；Scientist 级对非商业用途免费，商业用途及 Superuser/Hyperuser/Megauser 级别需许可。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:imdsoft-metavision-anesthesia','iMDsoft MetaVision Anesthesia','{"homepage": "https://imd-soft.com/metavision/anesthesia/", "id": "commercial:imdsoft-metavision-anesthesia", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方产品页称 MetaVision Anesthesia 为麻醉信息管理系统，覆盖术前、术中与麻醉后护理，生成完整准确的麻醉记录；页面并说明可查看系统与设备数据、以一键或条码扫描记录事件和用药，并与医院信息系统及数百种医疗设备集成，符合病例级麻醉记录、设备数据进入记录及临床人员记录的核心。", "slug": "anesthesia-information-management-system", "source_urls": ["https://imd-soft.com/metavision/anesthesia/"]}], "name": "iMDsoft MetaVision Anesthesia", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:26:36.181750+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "a70d42a534bdd0e7515891a8d78dcbdcfd8d331c5829f38a88c7fe169c1c85e2", "snapshot_path": "sources/a70d42a534bdd0e7515891a8d78dcbdcfd8d331c5829f38a88c7fe169c1c85e2.txt", "url": "https://imd-soft.com/metavision/anesthesia/"}], "summary": "面向围手术期的麻醉信息管理系统，生成贯穿术前、术中与 PACU 的完整麻醉记录；集中显示设备数据，支持一键或条码记录事件与用药，并与医院系统和医疗设备集成。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:philips-intellispace-critical-care-and-anesthesia','Philips IntelliSpace Critical Care and Anesthesia','{"homepage": "https://www.usa.philips.com/healthcare/product/HCNOCTN332/intellispace-critical-care-and-anesthesia-information-system", "id": "commercial:philips-intellispace-critical-care-and-anesthesia", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方页面设“ICCA for perioperative care”专节，说明麻醉医生与麻醉护士在围手术期记录护理，系统以 flowsheet 覆盖围手术期旅程，并整合床旁监护仪、输液泵、呼吸机和检验系统等患者数据；页面另确认其用于围手术期及医院麻醉护理场景且为 CE 标记的医疗软件，符合病例级麻醉记录与设备数据自动进入记录的核心。", "slug": "anesthesia-information-management-system", "source_urls": ["https://www.usa.philips.com/healthcare/product/HCNOCTN332/intellispace-critical-care-and-anesthesia-information-system"]}], "name": "Philips IntelliSpace Critical Care and Anesthesia", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:26:40.840290+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "8b36434dd91430ee908673ca60cb7033d072bd667f8a803ebaed011f0c481117", "snapshot_path": "sources/8b36434dd91430ee908673ca60cb7033d072bd667f8a803ebaed011f0c481117.txt", "url": "https://www.usa.philips.com/healthcare/product/HCNOCTN332/intellispace-critical-care-and-anesthesia-information-system"}], "summary": "患者数据管理系统，覆盖 ICU 与围手术期麻醉护理；将床旁监护仪、输液泵、呼吸机和检验数据整合为结构化 flowsheet，支持麻醉记录与临床决策。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:picis-anesthesia-manager','Picis Anesthesia Manager','{"homepage": "https://www.picis.com/solution/anesthesia-manager/", "id": "commercial:picis-anesthesia-manager", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方产品页将 Anesthesia Manager 描述为自动化麻醉文档的电子病历与记录系统，覆盖术前评估、术中监护到术后护理；页面说明其从多个系统自动采集设备数据，并可生成含人口学、用药、生命体征、检验和静脉液体的临床打印件，符合麻醉病例记录和自动设备数据采集的核心。", "slug": "anesthesia-information-management-system", "source_urls": ["https://www.picis.com/solution/anesthesia-manager/"]}], "name": "Picis Anesthesia Manager", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:27:27.168399+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "52e1c9d1c294b9a00e37fa5e8b3a65d446700017db55ac1c805c4c64fbe83061", "snapshot_path": "sources/52e1c9d1c294b9a00e37fa5e8b3a65d446700017db55ac1c805c4c64fbe83061.txt", "url": "https://www.picis.com/solution/anesthesia-manager/"}], "summary": "面向麻醉团队的电子麻醉记录系统，覆盖术前评估、术中监护与 PACU；自动采集多种设备数据，支持用药与事件文档及围手术期连续病历。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:1030765464','Marley Frontend','{"deployment": ["作为 Frappe app 通过 bench get-app 安装并部署到自托管站点", "依赖 Frappe v16、ERPNext v16、Healthcare v16、MariaDB/Redis"], "features": ["可视化床位/房间看板，按服务单元类型分组展示", "床位状态：Vacant、Occupied、Cleaning、Under Maintenance", "预约入院、收治入院、转床、清洁完成与状态回写", "按床位、房型、患者、状态和日期筛选", "与 Frappe Healthcare 的 Inpatient Record / Healthcare Service Unit 数据联动"], "github_repository_id": 1030765464, "homepage": "https://github.com/earthians/marley_frontend", "id": "github:1030765464", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方 README 与仓库内 bed_management.vue / bed_management.py 显示：页面以 Healthcare Service Unit 为床位单元提供按服务单元类型分组的可视化床位看板，维护 Vacant/Occupied/Cleaning/Under Maintenance 状态，并实现预约入院、收治入院、转床与清洁完成回写（Cleaning Completed 后按住院状态转为 Vacant/Occupied），构成床位库存、床位状态、患者安置与共享看板四项核心。", "slug": "bed-capacity-management", "source_urls": ["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/earthians/marley_frontend/develop/README.md", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/earthians/marley_frontend/develop/frontend/src/pages/bed_management.vue", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/earthians/marley_frontend/develop/marley_frontend/bed_management.py"]}], "license": "GPL-3.0", "license_evidence_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/earthians/marley_frontend/develop/license.txt", "license_review": {"rationale": "仓库 license.txt 为完整的 GNU GPL v3 条款文本（约 35 KB，含序言、全部条款与 terms and conditions），与 GitHub 仓库页标注的 GPL-3.0 一致，覆盖该仓库全部代码。", "reviewer": "opencode-go/deepseek-v4.1-flash unit-160", "scope": "repository", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/earthians/marley_frontend/develop/license.txt", "spdx_id": "GPL-3.0"}, "name": "Marley Frontend", "repository_url": "https://github.com/earthians/marley_frontend", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:25:10.231364+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "dda8d6d8743fb85379c126e9a0dc5ec2b382426728dedf4fd0449afc33f608c4", "snapshot_path": "sources/dda8d6d8743fb85379c126e9a0dc5ec2b382426728dedf4fd0449afc33f608c4.txt", "url": "https://github.com/earthians/marley_frontend"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:25:12.085101+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "04a9bf2be3b3bde1a1152ae6cba5400376625da2b4e39bbe1da94400060cc003", "snapshot_path": "sources/04a9bf2be3b3bde1a1152ae6cba5400376625da2b4e39bbe1da94400060cc003.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/earthians/marley_frontend/develop/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:25:28.220481+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "8b1ba204bb69a0ade2bfcf65ef294a920f6bb361b317dba43c7ef29d96332b9b", "snapshot_path": "sources/8b1ba204bb69a0ade2bfcf65ef294a920f6bb361b317dba43c7ef29d96332b9b.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/earthians/marley_frontend/develop/license.txt"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:26:08.733673+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "df441417120e045c89495235132fb7ac8dd469af64e459daa5f1192c3810bd73", "snapshot_path": "sources/df441417120e045c89495235132fb7ac8dd469af64e459daa5f1192c3810bd73.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/earthians/marley_frontend/develop/frontend/src/pages/bed_management.vue"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:26:39.378549+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "c3053bb3cea508ad101e629bda6c0fe5c60989edb34bec5ec5cadb20ca2e1712", "snapshot_path": "sources/c3053bb3cea508ad101e629bda6c0fe5c60989edb34bec5ec5cadb20ca2e1712.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/earthians/marley_frontend/develop/marley_frontend/bed_management.py"}], "summary": "Marley Frontend 是运行在 Frappe/ERPNext/Healthcare 之上的自托管医疗 Web 应用，其床位管理页面把 Healthcare Service Unit 作为床位/房间单元，提供按服务单元类型分组的可视化床位看板，维护 Vacant/Occupied/Cleaning/Under Maintenance 状态，并支持预约入院、收治入院、转床和清洁完成等操作；同仓库的 Python 后端方法负责床位查询、状态回写、入院与转床。", "technology_stack": ["Vue 3", "Frappe UI / Vite", "Python (Frappe)", "Socket.IO"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:399456228','Marley Health','{"deployment": ["基于 Frappe/ERPNext bench 自托管，安装 healthcare 应用", "浏览器访问的 Web 应用，可部署在云端或本地"], "features": ["患者登记与患者主记录", "门诊预约与 Patient Encounter 就诊记录", "住院 Inpatient Record：入院、病房/服务单元分配与 ADT", "临床医嘱、检验（Lab Test）与临床操作", "从就诊带入 ERPNext 销售发票计费（药品、检验、临床服务）"], "github_repository_id": 399456228, "homepage": "https://marleyhealth.io", "id": "github:399456228", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方 README 自述为开源医院信息系统（HIS），覆盖门诊/住院管理；文档显示医院以 Medical Department 与 Healthcare Service Unit 组织科室和病房，患者登记后可预约并进入 Patient Encounter，Practitioner 在就诊中下住院单生成 Inpatient Record，入院时分配空房并管理 ADT；Patient Encounter 文档 2.6 明确药房/账户人员可用 Sales Invoice 的 Get items from > Prescription 与 Healthcare Services 拉取就诊中的药品、检验和临床服务计费，账户与支付由 ERPNext 承载，构成就诊→费用→账单/支付的闭环。该仓库是 Frappe/ERPNext 的完整 healthcare 业务子模块，不是独立单体应用；ERPNext 依赖仓库许可证未在本条核对。", "slug": "hospital-management-system", "source_urls": ["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/earthians/marley/develop/README.md", "https://marleyhealth.io/docs", "https://marleyhealth.io/docs/v13/user/manual/en/healthcare/inpatient_record", "https://marleyhealth.io/docs/v13/user/manual/en/healthcare/patient_encounter"]}], "license": "GPL-3.0", "license_evidence_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/earthians/marley/develop/license.txt", "license_review": {"rationale": "本仓库 license.txt 为完整 GNU General Public License v3 文本，GitHub 仓库页亦标注 GPL-3.0；许可结论仅覆盖 earthians/marley 本仓库，Frappe/ERPNext 等依赖按各自许可证，不在本次结论内。", "reviewer": "opencode-go/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "scope": "repository", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/earthians/marley/develop/license.txt", "spdx_id": "GPL-3.0"}, "name": "Marley Health", "repository_url": "https://github.com/earthians/marley", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:36:25.720737+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "36777f44a4e8ae066188ebcf1878a194e5661cf72ae38be6c1920a5f80483478", "snapshot_path": "sources/36777f44a4e8ae066188ebcf1878a194e5661cf72ae38be6c1920a5f80483478.txt", "url": "https://github.com/earthians/marley"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:39:19.107876+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "e111f2ee31ccd74c07f0379b3d98705fc4caf75ac4f941021704a0aef941d807", "snapshot_path": "sources/e111f2ee31ccd74c07f0379b3d98705fc4caf75ac4f941021704a0aef941d807.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/earthians/marley/develop/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:35:15.707147+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "3972dc9744f6499f0f9b2dbf76696f2ae7ad8af9b23dde66d6af86c9dfb36986", "snapshot_path": "sources/3972dc9744f6499f0f9b2dbf76696f2ae7ad8af9b23dde66d6af86c9dfb36986.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/earthians/marley/develop/license.txt"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:35:26.043970+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "77d99e698ce4460cac83f2203619203ef8f83fbd35e8954a54afbb5bc9024e00", "snapshot_path": "sources/77d99e698ce4460cac83f2203619203ef8f83fbd35e8954a54afbb5bc9024e00.txt", "url": "https://marleyhealth.io/"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:35:36.083115+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "53cdab29f707a32a03f95ab949ff28230b58866342f803e49492257bdec1c060", "snapshot_path": "sources/53cdab29f707a32a03f95ab949ff28230b58866342f803e49492257bdec1c060.txt", "url": "https://marleyhealth.io/docs"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:35:54.300761+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "bb5e91e9f31b9823f5c149f08786ca97d76ed28acfba49230d5ac455d864a020", "snapshot_path": "sources/bb5e91e9f31b9823f5c149f08786ca97d76ed28acfba49230d5ac455d864a020.txt", "url": "https://marleyhealth.io/docs/v13/user/manual/en/healthcare/inpatient_record"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:36:05.652704+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "edf9d45dd2bb749ee6db4f5070c3a6fe11147f7358480244d7bedf86bfcf161c", "snapshot_path": "sources/edf9d45dd2bb749ee6db4f5070c3a6fe11147f7358480244d7bedf86bfcf161c.txt", "url": "https://marleyhealth.io/docs/v13/user/manual/en/healthcare/patient_encounter"}], "summary": "Marley Health（原 Frappe Health / ERPNext Healthcare）是构建于 Frappe/ERPNext 之上的开源医院信息系统 Web 应用：覆盖患者登记、门诊预约与就诊、住院入院/病房与服务单元分配/ADT、临床医嘱与检验，并可由就诊记录把药品、检验和临床服务带入 ERPNext 销售发票计费，账户与支付由 ERPNext 承载。本仓库采用 GPL-3.0，自托管部署；不宣称自建独立计费引擎，也不包含影像归档或独立收入周期后台。", "technology_stack": ["Python", "Frappe Framework", "ERPNext", "JavaScript"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:13254298','BSIS (Blood Safety Information System)','{"deployment": ["浏览器访问的自托管 Web 应用", "Docker Compose 部署", "Java WAR 部署到 Apache Tomcat，使用 MySQL"], "features": ["以 Component 为单位的血液制品标识：DIN、成分代码、血型、有效期、状态及库存状态", "状态门控生命周期：隔离、可用、过期、发放、输血、不安全、废弃、处理；可用需放行、血型确认与 TTI 安全", "检测结果驱动的不安全/废弃标记及终态保护", "按地点、成分类型、血型、到期日与库存状态查询单位库存", "OrderForm 订单项与患者/机构请求，DISPATCHED 时执行发放或调拨", "发放至使用点、退回入库与患者输血记录", "ComponentStatusChange 记录状态变更、原因、操作者与时间，连接献血、单位、发放与输血"], "github_repository_id": 13254298, "homepage": "https://www.jembi.org/Project/blood-safety-strengthening-programme-(bssp)", "id": "github:13254298", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方项目页说明 BSIS 覆盖献血登记、采集、检测、成分制备/贴签、储存及向医院/诊所分发；代码把每个 Component 作为单独标识的血液单位（献血识别号 DIN、成分代码、血型、有效期、状态、库存状态），状态按隔离/可用/过期/发放/输血/不安全/废弃/处理流转，可用状态需放行、血型确认与 TTI 安全门控；库存可按地点、成分类型、血型、到期日查询，OrderForm 以患者/机构请求匹配并发放单位，Transfusion 将单位与患者关联，ComponentStatusChange 记录操作者、时间和原因，构成从献血到最终处置的追溯链。", "slug": "blood-bank-management", "source_urls": ["https://www.jembi.org/Project/blood-safety-strengthening-programme-(bssp)", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jembi/bsis/develop/README.md", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jembi/bsis/develop/src/main/java/org/jembi/bsis/service/ComponentStatusCalculator.java", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jembi/bsis/develop/src/main/java/org/jembi/bsis/model/component/Component.java", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jembi/bsis/develop/src/main/java/org/jembi/bsis/service/InventoryCRUDService.java", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jembi/bsis/develop/src/main/java/org/jembi/bsis/service/ComponentCRUDService.java", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jembi/bsis/develop/src/main/java/org/jembi/bsis/service/OrderFormCRUDService.java", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jembi/bsis/develop/src/main/java/org/jembi/bsis/model/transfusion/Transfusion.java"]}], "license": "BSD-3-Clause", "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/jembi/bsis/license", "name": "BSIS (Blood Safety Information System)", "repository_url": "https://github.com/jembi/bsis", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:38:53.142311+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "28d1d5b4a97931d543350d7603dd005b448ebcb6ffd3a345649450d84b967f4f", "snapshot_path": "sources/28d1d5b4a97931d543350d7603dd005b448ebcb6ffd3a345649450d84b967f4f.txt", "url": "https://www.jembi.org/Project/blood-safety-strengthening-programme-(bssp)"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:38:55.065083+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "12385b022b8cb05d33a4fb87f1043813851a0cd339c82cfc9eb6045c950e2440", "snapshot_path": "sources/12385b022b8cb05d33a4fb87f1043813851a0cd339c82cfc9eb6045c950e2440.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/jembi/bsis"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:38:56.894104+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "ce00799adee2615c85449e19662f59562c51633610a1aa8379d45c4aece54488", "snapshot_path": "sources/ce00799adee2615c85449e19662f59562c51633610a1aa8379d45c4aece54488.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/jembi/bsis/license"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:38:58.490913+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "80537df2e4b8ebaa9a0cd3453caea00ac94af8aba976b297e8ec8a1714c9cb7d", "snapshot_path": "sources/80537df2e4b8ebaa9a0cd3453caea00ac94af8aba976b297e8ec8a1714c9cb7d.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jembi/bsis/develop/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:39:02.774364+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "7d19ab07c94b610ee3b1913b818b3bcee66f1b296551e2ed45b076cbae77f87a", "snapshot_path": "sources/7d19ab07c94b610ee3b1913b818b3bcee66f1b296551e2ed45b076cbae77f87a.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jembi/bsis/develop/src/main/java/org/jembi/bsis/service/ComponentStatusCalculator.java"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:39:04.241996+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "93ecb590f36ac05c487d2ed3bb5f35999469a4aa87d61e2a2ed20e5aa3ecd024", "snapshot_path": "sources/93ecb590f36ac05c487d2ed3bb5f35999469a4aa87d61e2a2ed20e5aa3ecd024.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jembi/bsis/develop/src/main/java/org/jembi/bsis/model/component/ComponentStatus.java"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:39:05.844771+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "806ed7bb9a83f45754cac9790b3726c0e6f6feba764ffd9dcba6a36d4ddf5206", "snapshot_path": "sources/806ed7bb9a83f45754cac9790b3726c0e6f6feba764ffd9dcba6a36d4ddf5206.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jembi/bsis/develop/src/main/java/org/jembi/bsis/model/component/Component.java"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:39:07.346422+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "81c9b9114688dfe7c57a84ebcd0cb3944aad2001901780c7ff5a27f9eecdf6a2", "snapshot_path": "sources/81c9b9114688dfe7c57a84ebcd0cb3944aad2001901780c7ff5a27f9eecdf6a2.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jembi/bsis/develop/src/main/java/org/jembi/bsis/service/InventoryCRUDService.java"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:39:09.073127+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "b435df3f5c670f9c17d71158b42e9a42533c82f72819d89989c9ef2ad8013a22", "snapshot_path": "sources/b435df3f5c670f9c17d71158b42e9a42533c82f72819d89989c9ef2ad8013a22.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jembi/bsis/develop/src/main/java/org/jembi/bsis/service/OrderFormCRUDService.java"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:39:10.593915+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "840a5714dc9a9aa2c2bf4eeb1c41241cd8d1afe2f5cdab3e2abea68a09276887", "snapshot_path": "sources/840a5714dc9a9aa2c2bf4eeb1c41241cd8d1afe2f5cdab3e2abea68a09276887.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jembi/bsis/develop/src/main/java/org/jembi/bsis/model/order/OrderForm.java"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:39:12.078298+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "4fcb3de18b1614d66ed3938eda23927bd9a2b82d5f22c653d13c686baf023b07", "snapshot_path": "sources/4fcb3de18b1614d66ed3938eda23927bd9a2b82d5f22c653d13c686baf023b07.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jembi/bsis/develop/src/main/java/org/jembi/bsis/model/transfusion/Transfusion.java"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:40:54.027797+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "4a06d73533037ec09fcdba832ad076577bda4688cc1668d6018115f66917351c", "snapshot_path": "sources/4a06d73533037ec09fcdba832ad076577bda4688cc1668d6018115f66917351c.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jembi/bsis/develop/src/main/java/org/jembi/bsis/service/ComponentCRUDService.java"}], "summary": "面向血液中心与医院输血服务的开源、可自托管 Web 应用：以可识别的血液成分为单位，记录从献血、检测、隔离/放行、库存、订单发放/调拨到输血与退回的生命周期，并保留状态变更追溯。", "technology_stack": ["Java", "Spring", "Hibernate", "MySQL", "Liquibase", "Apache Tomcat", "Docker"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:editlife','EDITLife Solid Organ Transplant','{"homepage": "https://editlife.msa.com/", "id": "commercial:editlife", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方产品页明确面向医院和移植中心，管理从转诊到长期随访的患者旅程，逐项列出候选评估、等待名单状态、手术流程与移植后照护，并记录器官供给、手术细节和移植后结果，符合医院移植项目系统记录的核心。", "slug": "organ-transplant-management", "source_urls": ["https://editlife.msa.com/solid-organ-transplant/"]}], "name": "EDITLife Solid Organ Transplant", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:44:06.263357+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "d7f2f3e61af8afc9810f32be060983f93e9dfb1bad8c75dfd328f5929d834133", "snapshot_path": "sources/d7f2f3e61af8afc9810f32be060983f93e9dfb1bad8c75dfd328f5929d834133.txt", "url": "https://editlife.msa.com/solid-organ-transplant/"}], "summary": "面向医院移植项目的固体器官移植管理模块：覆盖转诊、候选评估与选择会议、等待名单状态与 UNOS 表单、器官供给与手术记录，以及移植后随访和移植物失败记录。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:ottr','Ottr Organ & TransChart','{"homepage": "https://www.caredx.com/", "id": "commercial:ottr", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "CareDx 官方页面称 Ottr Organ & TransChart 为器官移植专用 EMR，覆盖移植患者阶段管理、随访事件排程、UNOS 数据提交与注册报告，足以证明其作为医院移植项目持续记录系统的定位；页面未逐项展开供给接受/拒绝流程，按商业基本记录不延伸。", "slug": "organ-transplant-management", "source_urls": ["https://www.caredx.com/professionals/emr-integration"]}], "name": "Ottr Organ & TransChart", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:44:12.954956+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "27d961fdb01b14ed6e3ff83a133ec4b27b6587ae280794c0afd32d9c609615e2", "snapshot_path": "sources/27d961fdb01b14ed6e3ff83a133ec4b27b6587ae280794c0afd32d9c609615e2.txt", "url": "https://www.caredx.com/professionals/emr-integration"}], "summary": "CareDx 旗下面向器官移植项目的专用 EMR：标准化移植数据录入、患者阶段管理、随访事件排程、UNOS 表单自动提交，以及注册报告和质量分析。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:1283596730','Pathology LIS','{"deployment": ["Docker Compose 自托管部署", "医院内网直接访问或 HTTPS 反向代理部署"], "features": ["外科病理、妇科细胞学和非妇科细胞学病例登记与统一 accession", "大体检查、标本管理、大体图像上传及组织块生成", "组织处理、包埋、切片和 H&E/特殊染色工作流跟踪", "组织块与玻片管理、分发和存储追踪", "病理医师结构化诊断、多角色签署与报告审批", "PDF 报告生成、报告归档及修订/补充报告", "基于角色的访问控制与审计日志"], "github_repository_id": 1283596730, "homepage": "https://github.com/korawit-t/Pathology-LIS", "id": "github:1283596730", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方 README 明确覆盖病例登记、大体检查、组织处理/包埋/切片/染色、组织块与玻片管理、病理医师多角色签署及 PDF 报告；工作流文档以八步说明从接收标本到签署出报告，并以快照/归档保留报告，符合病例记录、标本到载玻片制备和签署诊断三项核心。", "slug": "pathology-information-system", "source_urls": ["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/korawit-t/Pathology-LIS/main/README.md", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/korawit-t/Pathology-LIS/main/docs/lis-workflow-overview.html"]}], "license": "MIT", "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/korawit-t/Pathology-LIS/license", "name": "Pathology LIS", "repository_url": "https://github.com/korawit-t/Pathology-LIS", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:43:41.618068+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "df9cbc698cee67f081e095eefe022447393783d11b7ab6cc511d2885d2c5f965", "snapshot_path": "sources/df9cbc698cee67f081e095eefe022447393783d11b7ab6cc511d2885d2c5f965.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/korawit-t/Pathology-LIS"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:43:41.581529+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "b571865fb579144ac18189435a377f24cfeab4bbd17fe549cea2a0a9f9d57a8e", "snapshot_path": "sources/b571865fb579144ac18189435a377f24cfeab4bbd17fe549cea2a0a9f9d57a8e.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/korawit-t/Pathology-LIS/main/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:43:41.638651+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "253d6f60643dc249c6bd221c6687ba4d3b37a76bdfa836c84e279c7b1c0435be", "snapshot_path": "sources/253d6f60643dc249c6bd221c6687ba4d3b37a76bdfa836c84e279c7b1c0435be.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/korawit-t/Pathology-LIS/license"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:43:41.815654+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "b11cd4dba821fc87bd7e2057af259368d983eb7940e3a43ae7277a10c093537f", "snapshot_path": "sources/b11cd4dba821fc87bd7e2057af259368d983eb7940e3a43ae7277a10c093537f.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/korawit-t/Pathology-LIS/main/docs/lis-workflow-overview.html"}], "summary": "面向解剖病理科的自托管开源 LIS，覆盖病例登记、标本大体检查、组织处理/包埋/切片/染色、玻片分发、病理医师诊断签署以及 PDF 报告归档，使用 React、FastAPI 与 PostgreSQL，可通过 Docker Compose 部署。", "technology_stack": ["React 18 + Vite + Ant Design 5", "Python 3.11 + FastAPI", "PostgreSQL 15", "WeasyPrint + Jinja2", "Docker Compose"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:1279052725','LabAnimal','{"deployment": ["self-hosted via Docker Compose", "PostgreSQL database"], "features": ["individual animal records with species, strain, genotype, sex, birth/arrival dates and identifiers", "room, rack and cage hierarchy with capacity and occupancy status", "breeding pairs, litters and weaning records", "health records, medications and death reports", "IACUC protocol assignment and animal-limit tracking", "audit log and electronic signatures", "self-hosted Docker deployment"], "github_repository_id": 1279052725, "homepage": "https://github.com/xxjzone01-cyber/labanimal", "id": "github:1279052725", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "Official Prisma schema and API sources evidence the four core structures: Animal records carry internalId, species, strain, genotype, sex, birth/arrival dates, status and identifiers; Room, Rack and Cage models provide capacity, position and occupancy status; breeding, litter/weaning, health, medication and death-report records provide the census-and-disposition loop; Protocol records carry IACUC number, status, animalLimit and version, while Animal.protocolId and the protocols API animalCount provide research-use linkage. README confirms a React/Hono/Prisma/PostgreSQL web application with Docker self-hosting and an Apache-2.0 community edition limited to 500 animals per lab. Cage moves are applied through the animal''s current cage assignment rather than a separate movement-history event, protocol amendments are not separately modeled, and animal status is operational rather than an explicit newborn/weaned life-stage; those limits are recorded in the research note.", "slug": "research-animal-facility-management", "source_urls": ["https://api.github.com/repos/xxjzone01-cyber/labanimal", "https://api.github.com/repos/xxjzone01-cyber/labanimal/license", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xxjzone01-cyber/labanimal/main/README.md", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xxjzone01-cyber/labanimal/main/packages/db/prisma/schema.prisma", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xxjzone01-cyber/labanimal/main/packages/api/src/routes/protocols.ts", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xxjzone01-cyber/labanimal/main/packages/api/src/routes/animals.ts"]}], "license": "Apache-2.0", "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/xxjzone01-cyber/labanimal/license", "name": "LabAnimal", "repository_url": "https://github.com/xxjzone01-cyber/labanimal", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:50:19+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "fa63e7873e93c4215ec7aafaf6b06b596ceb28a1e097b072c02f314ad0253ab3", "snapshot_path": "sources/fa63e7873e93c4215ec7aafaf6b06b596ceb28a1e097b072c02f314ad0253ab3.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/xxjzone01-cyber/labanimal"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:50:19+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "7c8877d5204a552f30d32ab5a20c22137eb9743d257693008099b47fd214b3a6", "snapshot_path": "sources/7c8877d5204a552f30d32ab5a20c22137eb9743d257693008099b47fd214b3a6.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/xxjzone01-cyber/labanimal/license"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:54:35.310442+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "a0d94add818b51b0a4234bd141408fe9e69077ff9b36d71d327fa7476273ebdd", "snapshot_path": "sources/a0d94add818b51b0a4234bd141408fe9e69077ff9b36d71d327fa7476273ebdd.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xxjzone01-cyber/labanimal/main/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:54:37.271759+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "1941e25a61fbe8903306e7c6c2556bf5bc063a1d111205a070ae138003b01439", "snapshot_path": "sources/1941e25a61fbe8903306e7c6c2556bf5bc063a1d111205a070ae138003b01439.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xxjzone01-cyber/labanimal/main/packages/db/prisma/schema.prisma"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:54:38.971157+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "2a35525fce2046e97bd124730f9122ce855f07d299cf02407cd189ee2ae116b9", "snapshot_path": "sources/2a35525fce2046e97bd124730f9122ce855f07d299cf02407cd189ee2ae116b9.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xxjzone01-cyber/labanimal/main/packages/api/src/routes/protocols.ts"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:54:26.508789+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "194b6d4e3f3e80f3b648d3233fcc7eb7950d57d72e2770a821b1bd7707ed1246", "snapshot_path": "sources/194b6d4e3f3e80f3b648d3233fcc7eb7950d57d72e2770a821b1bd7707ed1246.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xxjzone01-cyber/labanimal/main/packages/api/src/routes/animals.ts"}], "summary": "Open-source lab animal facility management web application (React/Hono/Prisma/PostgreSQL) covering individually identified animals, room-rack-cage occupancy, breeding and litter/weaning records, health and death records, and IACUC protocol assignment with animal limits; Apache-2.0 community edition is limited to 500 animals per lab.", "technology_stack": ["React", "Hono", "Prisma", "PostgreSQL", "TypeScript"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:768180287','MOCCA2 Web App','{"deployment": ["self-hosted web application (Dash, served on localhost)"], "features": ["raw chromatogram import from Agilent, Shimadzu and Waters files", "automatic baseline correction and adaptive peak picking", "calibration standards and internal-standard quantitation", "campaign save/load with chromatograms, processing settings and results", "interactive chromatogram and concentration result views"], "github_repository_id": 768180287, "homepage": "https://github.com/Bayer-Group/MOCCA-frontend", "id": "github:768180287", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "The official README documents a browser-based, self-hosted HPLC processing application with its own Data, Process and Results pages rather than a desktop client or bare library: raw Agilent/Shimadzu/Waters files are loaded and named by sample, baseline correction and peak picking are performed, calibration standards and internal standards produce calibrated concentrations, and the campaign stores chromatograms, processing settings and processed results for later restoration. That covers the CDS core in a complete web application form; it does not claim instrument control, audit trails or multi-user enterprise features.", "slug": "chromatography-data-system", "source_urls": ["https://api.github.com/repos/Bayer-Group/mocca-frontend", "https://api.github.com/repos/Bayer-Group/mocca-frontend/license", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Bayer-Group/mocca-frontend/main/README.md"]}], "license": "MIT", "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Bayer-Group/mocca-frontend/license", "name": "MOCCA2 Web App", "repository_url": "https://github.com/Bayer-Group/MOCCA-frontend", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:45:03.541798+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "e84cdd7c594db871d59fc8049571ec56e7df222636b38eb6a8761144237c1444", "snapshot_path": "sources/e84cdd7c594db871d59fc8049571ec56e7df222636b38eb6a8761144237c1444.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Bayer-Group/mocca-frontend"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:45:03.452182+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "337bf2ba605db53fec6f9890e70e3b2cc9bb24ed6c0b2fa6b4351a4e1a0b8db7", "snapshot_path": "sources/337bf2ba605db53fec6f9890e70e3b2cc9bb24ed6c0b2fa6b4351a4e1a0b8db7.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Bayer-Group/mocca-frontend/license"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:45:03.021049+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "4922b420fe817d852da63d7a641fc6de6c0db7c5ae45d4875631ceea1139425b", "snapshot_path": "sources/4922b420fe817d852da63d7a641fc6de6c0db7c5ae45d4875631ceea1139425b.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Bayer-Group/mocca-frontend/main/README.md"}], "summary": "Open-source self-hosted web application for automated HPLC chromatogram processing: it accepts raw data files from Agilent, Shimadzu and Waters instruments, performs baseline correction and adaptive peak picking, uses calibration standards and internal standards to calculate concentrations, and saves chromatograms, processing settings and processed results in a restorable campaign. MIT-licensed.", "technology_stack": ["Python", "Dash", "MOCCA2"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:1169459491','Clinical Insight Engine','{"deployment": ["React + Express + PostgreSQL 本地自托管", "Python/scikit-learn 模型服务", "按 README 的环境变量与数据库步骤部署"], "features": ["患者风险表单（年龄、BMI、HbA1c、血糖、病史、吸烟史等）", "可解释逻辑回归模型输出风险百分比与因素贡献", "医生视图展示风险、主要因素及建议临床随访动作", "患者视图提供简化风险等级与预防性生活方式说明", "评估历史留存与查看（跨就诊纵向追踪仍为 Roadmap 规划项）"], "github_repository_id": 1169459491, "homepage": "https://github.com/gopaljilab/Clinical-Insight-Engine", "id": "github:1169459491", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "完整全栈 Web 应用而非模型/SDK：README 明确患者级输入字段、模型计算的风险百分比与贡献因素、医生视图中的建议随访动作，以及患者视图；建议由医生采纳，系统不执行临床动作。其定位为糖尿病早期风险评估型 CDSS，README 同时声明仅用于教育/研究，不能据此扩展为诊断或自动处方能力。", "slug": "clinical-decision-support-system", "source_urls": ["https://api.github.com/repos/gopaljilab/Clinical-Insight-Engine", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/gopaljilab/Clinical-Insight-Engine/main/README.md", "https://api.github.com/repos/gopaljilab/Clinical-Insight-Engine/license"]}], "license": "MIT", "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/gopaljilab/Clinical-Insight-Engine/license", "name": "Clinical Insight Engine", "repository_url": "https://github.com/gopaljilab/Clinical-Insight-Engine", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:50:57.353398+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "77b8ab88ae12adb9fdb65cfe3fe5f94579f9d3dc7e3c5e640abd0bce56ded189", "snapshot_path": "sources/77b8ab88ae12adb9fdb65cfe3fe5f94579f9d3dc7e3c5e640abd0bce56ded189.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/gopaljilab/Clinical-Insight-Engine"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:51:37.527605+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "5c3debe80f1dbe03e4150d018a52410d23641128646cdb23a59d0333b21a36d1", "snapshot_path": "sources/5c3debe80f1dbe03e4150d018a52410d23641128646cdb23a59d0333b21a36d1.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/gopaljilab/Clinical-Insight-Engine/main/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:51:37.474518+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "23b128c60fd868ccbec3375dd6f2df80856f9a80625f3e22867ea9a43e085d26", "snapshot_path": "sources/23b128c60fd868ccbec3375dd6f2df80856f9a80625f3e22867ea9a43e085d26.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/gopaljilab/Clinical-Insight-Engine/license"}], "summary": "MIT 许可的全栈开源临床决策支持应用，面向糖尿病早期风险，定位为教育与研究用途。采集年龄、性别、BMI、HbA1c、血糖、高血压/心脏病史与吸烟史等患者数据，使用可解释逻辑回归模型输出风险百分比、主要贡献因素及建议的临床随访动作，并区分医生视图与患者视图；提供评估历史留存与查看，跨就诊纵向追踪仍为 Roadmap 规划项。React + Express + Python/scikit-learn + PostgreSQL，可本地自托管。", "technology_stack": ["React", "TypeScript", "Express.js", "PostgreSQL", "Python", "scikit-learn"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:121619061','GenericCDSS','{"deployment": ["Docker Compose + Make 自托管", "PostgreSQL 数据库", "Django REST API 与 ReactJS 前端"], "features": ["医护人员患者仪表盘与患者临床信息维护", "自定义临床方案（protocol）及 inquiry/decision/action 元素", "按患者临床变量执行方案决策分支", "执行后列出建议动作（Actions recommended）；执行记录保存执行医生、执行时间与状态", "按计划分配与执行方案，并按排程计算下一次测量时间"], "github_repository_id": 121619061, "homepage": "https://github.com/bioinformatics-ua/GenericCDSS", "id": "github:121619061", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "完整开源 Web 应用而非引擎或 EHR：README 说明患者仪表盘、临床方案创建/分配/执行；Protocol.run 源码按患者 inquiryData 执行 decision 分支并汇总 action 结果；运行界面将结果标为 “Actions recommended”。ProtocolViewSet.run 从当前请求用户取得 Profile 并写入 ExecutedProtocol.physician，模型同时保存 execution_time、state 与 elementsExecuted，ExecutedProtocolViewSet 提供按患者查询已执行记录的 API；可证明建议由医生触发、执行医生与执行历史被记录，且系统只输出建议动作、不自动执行临床动作。单条建议的接受/拒绝/覆写及原因编码未在保留来源中出现，覆盖审计仍属证据缺口，故不据此扩展。", "slug": "clinical-decision-support-system", "source_urls": ["https://api.github.com/repos/bioinformatics-ua/GenericCDSS", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bioinformatics-ua/GenericCDSS/master/README.md", "https://api.github.com/repos/bioinformatics-ua/GenericCDSS/license", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bioinformatics-ua/GenericCDSS/master/Backend/protocol/models/Protocol.py", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bioinformatics-ua/GenericCDSS/master/UI/src/js/components/buttons/RunProtocolButton.js", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bioinformatics-ua/GenericCDSS/master/Backend/protocol/models/ExecutedProtocol.py", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bioinformatics-ua/GenericCDSS/master/Backend/protocol/api/views/ProtocolViewSet.py", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bioinformatics-ua/GenericCDSS/master/Backend/protocol/api/views/ExecutedProtocolViewSet.py"]}], "license": "GPL-3.0", "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bioinformatics-ua/GenericCDSS/license", "name": "GenericCDSS", "repository_url": "https://github.com/bioinformatics-ua/GenericCDSS", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:48:32.527494+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "d557662408d1b6a26be4fcef8e09b5e6813b359228871ad398cdf8c2393d4fa5", "snapshot_path": "sources/d557662408d1b6a26be4fcef8e09b5e6813b359228871ad398cdf8c2393d4fa5.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bioinformatics-ua/GenericCDSS"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:48:32.251873+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "566d2b3d5e174b3424be17db5c17641c7df1ed7e0f840be9e827d40acafd2638", "snapshot_path": "sources/566d2b3d5e174b3424be17db5c17641c7df1ed7e0f840be9e827d40acafd2638.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bioinformatics-ua/GenericCDSS/master/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:48:32.803602+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "c1a856fa4a7c6dcc0ee585b37045db43df09343bb0fd0d9be6ef87b03e2df422", "snapshot_path": "sources/c1a856fa4a7c6dcc0ee585b37045db43df09343bb0fd0d9be6ef87b03e2df422.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bioinformatics-ua/GenericCDSS/license"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:51:37.689778+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "d33753369ddeaba8327459a1a93c33d1bbefa0b327bd224de9918aae0c00e07e", "snapshot_path": "sources/d33753369ddeaba8327459a1a93c33d1bbefa0b327bd224de9918aae0c00e07e.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bioinformatics-ua/GenericCDSS/master/LICENSE"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:52:31.053144+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "dcf58cf96a67ffe8b49b3be47e946493873fb81fd66c62d3963c762a5d4d4756", "snapshot_path": "sources/dcf58cf96a67ffe8b49b3be47e946493873fb81fd66c62d3963c762a5d4d4756.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bioinformatics-ua/GenericCDSS/master/Backend/protocol/models/Protocol.py"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:52:58.193401+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "1def1bda4a532c6475b1561c36dcf2a3b33f1e3000eed277185dd1acee0f6b2d", "snapshot_path": "sources/1def1bda4a532c6475b1561c36dcf2a3b33f1e3000eed277185dd1acee0f6b2d.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bioinformatics-ua/GenericCDSS/master/UI/src/js/components/buttons/RunProtocolButton.js"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:58:02.676426+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "e7a347a8731e2bb49182e3a093f5144b30d1a6f0abd58dc31c500348deedd025", "snapshot_path": "sources/e7a347a8731e2bb49182e3a093f5144b30d1a6f0abd58dc31c500348deedd025.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bioinformatics-ua/GenericCDSS/master/Backend/protocol/models/ExecutedProtocol.py"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:58:02.704846+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "65c328cccedbba169343e4a929867a32602d6e314733d27538d17b4f2a99fcde", "snapshot_path": "sources/65c328cccedbba169343e4a929867a32602d6e314733d27538d17b4f2a99fcde.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bioinformatics-ua/GenericCDSS/master/Backend/protocol/api/views/ProtocolViewSet.py"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:58:02.663139+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "7bc9dc1a0ae4c5c4047027be38633d15200a7345106b3e11a3975e1635ff084b", "snapshot_path": "sources/7bc9dc1a0ae4c5c4047027be38633d15200a7345106b3e11a3975e1635ff084b.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bioinformatics-ua/GenericCDSS/master/Backend/protocol/api/views/ExecutedProtocolViewSet.py"}], "summary": "GPL-3.0 的开源 Web 临床决策支持应用。面向医护人员提供患者仪表盘、临床变量与临床方案管理；方案由 inquiry、decision、action 元素组成，运行时按患者输入的临床数据走决策分支，并在界面列出 “Actions recommended” 供医生执行。执行由当前登录用户的医生 Profile 触发，执行记录保存执行医生、执行时间与状态。使用 Django REST Framework + ReactJS + PostgreSQL，可通过 Docker Compose 自托管。", "technology_stack": ["Python", "Django", "Django REST Framework", "ReactJS", "PostgreSQL", "Docker"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:crio','CRIO','{"homepage": "https://clinicalresearch.io/", "id": "commercial:crio", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方 Site CTMS 与 Sites 页正文明确面向 clinical research sites：管理患者数据库、可行性筛选、招募漏斗、预筛与按方案排程的访视窗口；财务上设置访视/操作级应收、受试者津贴与应付，生成并跟踪发票和付款凭证，记录并核对申办方回款，支持 1099 年终报告。Sites 页还说明其面向多研究、多申办方现场运营（3,000 站点、6,000+ 方案、3,000+ 申办方），覆盖站点组合、执行记录与双向资金核心。", "slug": "clinical-trial-site-management", "source_urls": ["https://clinicalresearch.io/products/site-ctms/", "https://clinicalresearch.io/solutions/sites/"]}], "name": "CRIO", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:53:22.042467+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "d75843dfa9919608dce1856c279e562011e7dc24d415563e69fe650fa254056e", "snapshot_path": "sources/d75843dfa9919608dce1856c279e562011e7dc24d415563e69fe650fa254056e.txt", "url": "https://clinicalresearch.io/products/site-ctms/"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:53:22.164770+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "4e60bf5c84c67b40696837965c0ebb8964f0cc83bfc551562fee6d261b8102fa", "snapshot_path": "sources/4e60bf5c84c67b40696837965c0ebb8964f0cc83bfc551562fee6d261b8102fa.txt", "url": "https://clinicalresearch.io/solutions/sites/"}], "summary": "CRIO is an eSource and site CTMS platform for clinical research sites, covering patient recruitment and prescreening, protocol-driven visit scheduling and window tracking, participant tracking, study receivables and payables, invoicing, sponsor reimbursement reconciliation, and participant stipends.", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:realtime-ctms','RealTime CTMS','{"homepage": "https://realtime-eclinical.com/", "id": "commercial:realtime-ctms", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方 CTMS 产品页正文以研究现场为运营主体：在同一仪表盘查看按申办方/方案/状态筛选的全部活跃、招募中和待启动研究，管理受试者与访视，按方案模板自动计算目标日期并执行访视窗口；财务上跟踪研究预算、已完成访视、发票、付款与未结应收，并内置受试者津贴管理。覆盖站点研究组合、逐研究执行记录与站点侧双向资金记录核心。", "slug": "clinical-trial-site-management", "source_urls": ["https://realtime-eclinical.com/solutions/ctms/"]}], "name": "RealTime CTMS", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:53:22.531340+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "4efe7204ab9fb5fd07f025cfd32c75385eb6b63815f880f8e4337f9dc24a4f3a", "snapshot_path": "sources/4efe7204ab9fb5fd07f025cfd32c75385eb6b63815f880f8e4337f9dc24a4f3a.txt", "url": "https://realtime-eclinical.com/solutions/ctms/"}], "summary": "RealTime CTMS is a clinical trial management system for research sites and site networks, covering study and visit management, participant recruitment, budgets, invoices, payments, receivables, and participant stipends.", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:inovalon-vigilanz-infection-prevention','Inovalon VigiLanz Infection Prevention','{"homepage": "https://www.inovalon.com/products/provider-cloud/care-management/infection-prevention/", "id": "commercial:inovalon-vigilanz-infection-prevention", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方产品页正文说明该软件 24/7 监测实验室、生命体征、用药、记录等临床数据，按规则近实时产生警报和优先级工作列表，支持 HAI/MDRO 追踪、集群/疫情监测、隔离提示、NHSN 自动提交及机构级分析，符合设施 IPC 记录与报告工作流核心。", "slug": "infection-prevention-platform", "source_urls": ["https://www.inovalon.com/products/provider-cloud/care-management/infection-prevention/"]}], "name": "Inovalon VigiLanz Infection Prevention", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:57:22+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "d5b9e3682e88f5010d8e5035d5db47794c92d9bbfc0f9a92eff484be673d4287", "snapshot_path": "sources/d5b9e3682e88f5010d8e5035d5db47794c92d9bbfc0f9a92eff484be673d4287.txt", "url": "https://www.inovalon.com/products/provider-cloud/care-management/infection-prevention/"}], "summary": "商业感染监测软件：从实验室、生命体征、用药和记录等多源临床数据近实时检测 HAI、MDRO 与疫情信号，提供规则警报、工作列表、隔离提示、集群工具、NHSN 自动报告和分析仪表板，覆盖急症与急性后期机构。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:premier-theradoc-clinical-surveillance','Premier Clinical Surveillance (TheraDoc)','{"homepage": "https://premierinc.com/providers/care-transformation/clinical-surveillance", "id": "commercial:premier-theradoc-clinical-surveillance", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方产品页正文说明其与 EHR 实时接口，提供自动感染追踪、标准化工作流、可定制警报和仪表板，并支持自动化 NHSN 报告，面向医院和长期护理机构的感染预防与药事监测。", "slug": "infection-prevention-platform", "source_urls": ["https://premierinc.com/providers/care-transformation/clinical-surveillance"]}], "name": "Premier Clinical Surveillance (TheraDoc)", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T13:57:09+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "643744aad038c35b8933aaee71dda99037ce1070ee50d7a1c9a434939a2b01c5", "snapshot_path": "sources/643744aad038c35b8933aaee71dda99037ce1070ee50d7a1c9a434939a2b01c5.txt", "url": "https://premierinc.com/providers/care-transformation/clinical-surveillance"}], "summary": "面向医院和长期护理机构的临床监测平台：实时接入 EHR，自动追踪感染并生成可定制警报和仪表板，支持 NHSN 报告、抗菌药物管理与感染预防工作流。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:eab-navigate360','EAB Navigate360','{"homepage": "https://eab.com/solutions/navigate360/", "id": "commercial:eab-navigate360", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方产品页列出 Complete Student Profile、Coordinated Care Network、Appointments & Surveys、Notes & Attachments、Program Advising，并说明可连接 SIS；这些能力共同覆盖带学术上下文的学生记录、正式顾问协作关系与有记录的咨询互动三项核心。", "slug": "academic-advising-platform", "source_urls": ["https://eab.com/solutions/navigate360/"]}], "name": "EAB Navigate360", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T14:05:24.319421+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "07c7016b15d8b0cd584eb62a153cba0eec673e3ad745666b73714d099e2c4161", "snapshot_path": "sources/07c7016b15d8b0cd584eb62a153cba0eec673e3ad745666b73714d099e2c4161.txt", "url": "https://eab.com/solutions/navigate360/"}], "summary": "面向高校的学生成功与学术咨询 SaaS；以学生档案和 SIS 数据为基础，支持顾问协作、预约、咨询笔记与附件、预警及进展报告。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:1204742108','Alumni Management Portal','{"deployment": ["自托管 Django + PostgreSQL Web 应用，前端为静态 SPA", "按 README 执行 npm run setup:backend、数据库迁移与 npm run dev 启动前端和 API"], "features": ["校友登记：注册必填院系与毕业批次，导师或协调员审核后生效", "校友目录：按批次、院系、角色和公司筛选检索", "活动管理：协调员/管理员创建活动，校友/导师/协调员/管理员可报名并记录 RSVP", "导师辅导：学生发起申请，导师按容量上限审批并维护 active_mentees", "沟通与公告：私聊、批次群聊、按批次广播及系统公告", "就业与实习：职位发布、两级审核与申请跟踪", "分析看板：院系就业率与 platform 级统计"], "github_repository_id": 1204742108, "homepage": "https://github.com/kulkarnishub377/Alumni_Management_portal", "id": "github:1204742108", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "仓库文档证明其具备校友登记册（院系 + 毕业批次、机构审核）、每位校友的档案与关系记录（导师申请、活动 RSVP、职位申请、消息），以及机构侧按院系/批次创建活动、发布公告并用就业分析看板回看参与的闭环；是完整的自托管 Web 应用而非客户端或组件。", "slug": "alumni-management", "source_urls": ["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kulkarnishub377/Alumni_Management_portal/main/README.md", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kulkarnishub377/Alumni_Management_portal/main/docs/DATABASE_SCHEMA.md", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kulkarnishub377/Alumni_Management_portal/main/docs/PROCESS_FLOWS.md", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kulkarnishub377/Alumni_Management_portal/main/docs/FUNCTIONAL_REFERENCE.md"]}], "license": "MIT", "license_evidence_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kulkarnishub377/Alumni_Management_portal/main/LICENSE", "license_review": {"rationale": "完整 MIT 许可证正文已随仓库保存，含授权、版权声明与免责声明，覆盖整个仓库，未发现按模块拆分的社区版限制。", "reviewer": "opencode-go/deepseek-v4.1-flash collection review", "scope": "repository", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kulkarnishub377/Alumni_Management_portal/main/LICENSE", "spdx_id": "MIT"}, "name": "Alumni Management Portal", "repository_url": "https://github.com/kulkarnishub377/Alumni_Management_portal", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T14:10:52.636415+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "8bfae86853e78d67b5e56291b3f8411ef017f516d44b40488ae8b2bceeda8d0a", "snapshot_path": "sources/8bfae86853e78d67b5e56291b3f8411ef017f516d44b40488ae8b2bceeda8d0a.txt", "url": "https://github.com/kulkarnishub377/Alumni_Management_portal"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T14:10:54.274373+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "1126322e2cc8d165adc4c792eeb195717de2bcc7b39be1ce77959d78e87ef685", "snapshot_path": "sources/1126322e2cc8d165adc4c792eeb195717de2bcc7b39be1ce77959d78e87ef685.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kulkarnishub377/Alumni_Management_portal/main/LICENSE"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T14:10:55.807852+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "265a16485736909b77339bc89362a8d62aa22143700991b084c2d99f3b5ae0c5", "snapshot_path": "sources/265a16485736909b77339bc89362a8d62aa22143700991b084c2d99f3b5ae0c5.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kulkarnishub377/Alumni_Management_portal/main/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T14:10:57.413682+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "4bc3d821e67e46a13b748a405ae130455bdb10ef8ed3c235c99dc93fe3fab281", "snapshot_path": "sources/4bc3d821e67e46a13b748a405ae130455bdb10ef8ed3c235c99dc93fe3fab281.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kulkarnishub377/Alumni_Management_portal/main/docs/DATABASE_SCHEMA.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T14:10:58.997021+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "610a98bb7e5789f24098c38387a03415c73294d3d3e84da80977a4df98ea6f9e", "snapshot_path": "sources/610a98bb7e5789f24098c38387a03415c73294d3d3e84da80977a4df98ea6f9e.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kulkarnishub377/Alumni_Management_portal/main/docs/PROCESS_FLOWS.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T14:11:00.643878+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "e88045ce42d93d21a35741126fa016312911f3b21fdf3e760fd842ce6836e1dd", "snapshot_path": "sources/e88045ce42d93d21a35741126fa016312911f3b21fdf3e760fd842ce6836e1dd.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kulkarnishub377/Alumni_Management_portal/main/docs/FUNCTIONAL_REFERENCE.md"}], "summary": "面向高校的校友管理与联络平台，采用 Django/DRF + PostgreSQL 的自托管 Web 应用。校友注册时填写院系与毕业批次并经导师或协调员审核，目录可按批次、院系、角色与公司筛选；协调员/管理员可创建活动，校友可报名并留下 RSVP 记录，同时提供导师辅导申请与容量审批、按批次群聊与公告、院系就业数据看板，形成按院系/批次组织项目、回写参与并再用于公告与分析的机构互动闭环。", "technology_stack": ["Python 3.11+", "Django 5.2", "Django REST Framework", "SimpleJWT", "PostgreSQL 14+", "JavaScript/HTML/CSS"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:1432012861','Campus Tap','{"deployment": ["自托管 FastAPI 服务与 SQLite 数据库，提供 admin、student、vendor 三类网页", "可选 ESP32 + PN532 读卡器固件；无硬件时可用软件模拟刷卡运行完整演示"], "features": ["一名学生一张 NTAG 424 DNA NFC 卡，按学号/UID 绑定到已识别持卡人", "同一张卡用于课堂考勤、食堂餐次计次和校园商户余额支付", "每次刷卡由服务端验证签名 URL，并按余额、单笔/每日限额、卡状态与重复刷卡规则逐次判定", "每名学生仅允许一张在用卡，停用立即生效、恢复需学生 PIN；台账与事件追加写入且禁止改写", "保存消费与考勤台账，拒绝重复刷卡、余额不足、未登记卡和篡改刷卡", "管理员控制台支持发卡、停用/恢复、充值调账与规则配置，学生和商户各有自助页面"], "github_repository_id": 1432012861, "homepage": "https://github.com/kartikeyy12/campus-tap", "id": "github:1432012861", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "仓库是完整的自托管校园 NFC 卡 Web 应用：卡按学号绑定持卡人，服务端按卡状态与余额逐次评估并记录考勤、餐次与商户消费，每生仅一张在用卡且可停用/恢复，覆盖机构端凭证生命周期与服务点使用记录。", "slug": "campus-card-management", "source_urls": ["https://github.com/kartikeyy12/campus-tap", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kartikeyy12/campus-tap/main/README.md", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kartikeyy12/campus-tap/main/LICENSE", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kartikeyy12/campus-tap/main/docs/architecture.md"]}], "license": "MIT", "license_evidence_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kartikeyy12/campus-tap/main/LICENSE", "license_review": {"rationale": "逐字核对仓库根 LICENSE 全文（1065 字节），包含 MIT 授权条款与免责声明；README 亦明确代码为 MIT，覆盖本仓库代码。", "reviewer": "opencode-go/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "scope": "repository", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kartikeyy12/campus-tap/main/LICENSE", "spdx_id": "MIT"}, "name": "Campus Tap", "repository_url": "https://github.com/kartikeyy12/campus-tap", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T14:12:48.638960+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "53445e1125599c0786ab341e44c89ef05e60de7d329c3477a5718d869a015570", "snapshot_path": "sources/53445e1125599c0786ab341e44c89ef05e60de7d329c3477a5718d869a015570.txt", "url": "https://github.com/kartikeyy12/campus-tap"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T14:12:47.625972+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "4b2b8d1809b7c552ab228a935ceeb40498d7617e6cf776b96d6535a3ee406dc0", "snapshot_path": "sources/4b2b8d1809b7c552ab228a935ceeb40498d7617e6cf776b96d6535a3ee406dc0.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kartikeyy12/campus-tap/main/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T14:12:47.574559+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "3408463be5035c7f04f09ad98e23e5230918f68708eab686b71dcc57aa445d00", "snapshot_path": "sources/3408463be5035c7f04f09ad98e23e5230918f68708eab686b71dcc57aa445d00.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kartikeyy12/campus-tap/main/LICENSE"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T14:14:23.990658+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "5c0d4be293f931742ad3ee54df9eb6de3df73d51096d7d8678313a176ff99021", "snapshot_path": "sources/5c0d4be293f931742ad3ee54df9eb6de3df73d51096d7d8678313a176ff99021.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kartikeyy12/campus-tap/main/docs/architecture.md"}], "summary": "Campus Tap 是面向高校的开源 NFC 校园卡系统：每名学生一张在用 NTAG 424 DNA 卡，服务端将卡按学号绑定，统一处理课堂考勤、食堂餐次和校园商户消费，逐次按余额、限额、卡状态与重复刷卡规则判定并记录追加式台账；管理员页面可停用/恢复和充值调账。代码采用 MIT 许可，以 FastAPI + SQLite 自托管，实体读卡器为可选的硬件端。", "technology_stack": ["Python / FastAPI", "SQLite", "NTAG 424 DNA（SUN/SDM）", "ESP32 / PN532 固件", "HTML / JavaScript 管理、学生与商户页面"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:153947364','Online Hostel Allotment','{"deployment": ["自托管 Django Web 应用（Python + SQLite）"], "features": ["房间/楼栋库存与容量、空位维护", "学生住宿档案与房间关联", "管理员分配房间并校验空位", "换房与空位回补", "学生间换宿及接受确认", "按入学批次腾退与空房查询"], "github_repository_id": 153947364, "homepage": "https://github.com/singhshubham98/Online-Hostel-Allotment", "id": "github:153947364", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "models.py 定义 Room(room_no, block_no, capacity, vacancy) 与指向房间的 Student(room, join_year, roll_no)，views.py 的 allocate/change/swap/deallocate 在分配和换房时校验 vacancy 并增减，swap_ack 记录换宿接受，vacant_room 查询空房；这构成机构侧房间库存—已识别学生—房间分配—占用/空位的完整 Web 工作流。仓库含 manage.py、Django 视图与模板，README 目标亦写明 web application，并按 Django 应用部署，形态为可自托管 Web 应用；README 中遗留的 desktop application 字样与实现不符，按代码和部署形态判断。", "slug": "campus-housing-management", "source_urls": ["https://github.com/singhshubham98/Online-Hostel-Allotment", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/singhshubham98/Online-Hostel-Allotment/master/README.md", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/singhshubham98/Online-Hostel-Allotment/master/hostel/models.py", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/singhshubham98/Online-Hostel-Allotment/master/hostel/views.py"]}], "license": "MIT", "license_evidence_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/singhshubham98/Online-Hostel-Allotment/master/LICENSE", "license_review": {"rationale": "仓库根目录 LICENSE 为完整 MIT 许可文本，含 2018 年版权声明、授予条款与免责声明；仓库页面同标 MIT，未发现额外商业限制。", "reviewer": "collector: opencode-go/deepseek-v4.1-flash unit-178", "scope": "repository", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/singhshubham98/Online-Hostel-Allotment/master/LICENSE", "spdx_id": "MIT"}, "name": "Online Hostel Allotment", "repository_url": "https://github.com/singhshubham98/Online-Hostel-Allotment", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T14:16:05.174513+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "c6a105442eac318ab70f51a6dd22619011601cd5f7cda9fffb261035e960e201", "snapshot_path": "sources/c6a105442eac318ab70f51a6dd22619011601cd5f7cda9fffb261035e960e201.txt", "url": "https://github.com/singhshubham98/Online-Hostel-Allotment"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T14:16:03.977444+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "20abf49affb0a63a2696b56b4c0629f8558ebd37d83f4871d40f4be693a2e86f", "snapshot_path": "sources/20abf49affb0a63a2696b56b4c0629f8558ebd37d83f4871d40f4be693a2e86f.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/singhshubham98/Online-Hostel-Allotment/master/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T14:16:03.963056+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "9b96ad407b40ff360ad20512ce3db05f7dfb5369c0e18b35d394bb4d15976e70", "snapshot_path": "sources/9b96ad407b40ff360ad20512ce3db05f7dfb5369c0e18b35d394bb4d15976e70.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/singhshubham98/Online-Hostel-Allotment/master/LICENSE"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T14:16:10.948872+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "b43ef6b714cad537412196c3cd818ccb13a137e891b73b4c41c668fe81636d69", "snapshot_path": "sources/b43ef6b714cad537412196c3cd818ccb13a137e891b73b4c41c668fe81636d69.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/singhshubham98/Online-Hostel-Allotment/master/hostel/models.py"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T14:16:10.946574+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "b2e1c51d8834561b9060d1036a73a352d05e3a68c4d63c30025dbb3b4eedf8f4", "snapshot_path": "sources/b2e1c51d8834561b9060d1036a73a352d05e3a68c4d63c30025dbb3b4eedf8f4.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/singhshubham98/Online-Hostel-Allotment/master/hostel/views.py"}], "summary": "自托管 Django Web 应用，面向高校宿舍的房间分配：按房间/楼栋维护容量与空位，将已登记学生分配到具体房间，支持换房、学生间换宿及按入学批次腾退，并在分配时校验和更新空位。", "technology_stack": ["Python", "Django", "SQLite", "Bootstrap", "HTML", "CSS"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:technolutions-slate','Technolutions Slate','{"homepage": "https://technolutions.com/", "id": "commercial:technolutions-slate", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方招生页将 Slate 描述为面向高校招生办公室的 CRM/一体化平台，列出 Application Management、Reading Facilitation、Decision Release、Advanced Texting Features、Events Management；Drip Marketing 段明确说明按 recruitment funnel 分阶段向 leads 自动发送定时邮件，Queries 段说明可识别 prospective students、跟踪申请趋势与活动出席并调整沟通；官网首页同时给出 admissions CRM、communications、application processing 与 decision release 的定位。共同支撑潜在学生记录、招生漏斗与外展结果回写的核心循环。", "slug": "student-recruitment-crm", "source_urls": ["https://technolutions.com/", "https://technolutions.com/admissions"]}], "name": "Technolutions Slate", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T14:25:34.167044+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "ca900def74317f39231e7bc582d865126e3b8e89688801b85b8ca45ef373a1cc", "snapshot_path": "sources/ca900def74317f39231e7bc582d865126e3b8e89688801b85b8ca45ef373a1cc.txt", "url": "https://technolutions.com/"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T14:25:34.414572+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "7b20064fc06fc29d26cb332d9b01ace5f6bd74545fe20310ddc7aa7030982f79", "snapshot_path": "sources/7b20064fc06fc29d26cb332d9b01ace5f6bd74545fe20310ddc7aa7030982f79.txt", "url": "https://technolutions.com/admissions"}], "summary": "面向高校招生与注册的商用 CRM：官方页面说明其统一管理 prospective students 的申请、材料审阅、决定发布、活动与短信/邮件沟通，并按 recruitment funnel 分阶段进行 drip marketing，帮助招生办公室识别潜在学生、跟踪申请趋势并调整外展。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:national-student-clearinghouse-transcript-services','National Student Clearinghouse Transcript Services','{"homepage": "https://www.studentclearinghouse.org/solutions/ed-transcripts/", "id": "commercial:national-student-clearinghouse-transcript-services", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方 Transcript Services 正文明确覆盖 24/7 在线订购、第三方代订需学习者同意、电子 PDF 与安全打印递送、管理端端到端跟踪、holds 提示及 SIS 集成，符合机构侧成绩单请求、授权、发布、递送并跟踪的定义核心。", "slug": "transcript-management", "source_urls": ["https://www.studentclearinghouse.org/solutions/ed-transcripts/"]}], "name": "National Student Clearinghouse Transcript Services", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T14:40:43.731235+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "103daeb9c6973276743deab13679898a14bfe773f5abce998d444d33c5bd82c8", "snapshot_path": "sources/103daeb9c6973276743deab13679898a14bfe773f5abce998d444d33c5bd82c8.txt", "url": "https://www.studentclearinghouse.org/solutions/ed-transcripts/"}], "summary": "面向高校的成绩单订购与履行服务：学习者可 24/7 在线下单，机构按授权核验并向指定接收方提供电子或打印递送，管理端跟踪订单、holds、第三方代订和 SIS 集成。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:parchment-transcript-services','Parchment Award Transcript Services','{"homepage": "https://www.parchment.com/platform/higher-education/transcript-services/", "id": "commercial:parchment-transcript-services", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方高等教育 Transcript Services 正文明确描述学生门户下单、数字与打印递送至任意目的地、机构管理端 hold/release/附件/退款/取消、hold 通知、接收网络及 SIS 集成，符合成绩单请求→机构发布→指定接收方递送并跟踪的核心。", "slug": "transcript-management", "source_urls": ["https://www.parchment.com/platform/higher-education/transcript-services/"]}], "name": "Parchment Award Transcript Services", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T14:40:43.517791+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "f89ea42a15db8812c9c9cb2dd85674ca5c888edb7cfa698b4c23706c84a4c21d", "snapshot_path": "sources/f89ea42a15db8812c9c9cb2dd85674ca5c888edb7cfa698b4c23706c84a4c21d.txt", "url": "https://www.parchment.com/platform/higher-education/transcript-services/"}], "summary": "面向高校的成绩单订购与履行平台：学生从门户下单，机构可数字或打印递送至任一接收方，管理端支持 holds、放行、附件、退款、取消及 SIS 集成。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:ellucian-crm-advance','Ellucian CRM Advance','{"homepage": "https://www.ellucian.com/products/student/advancement", "id": "commercial:ellucian-crm-advance", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方产品页与 CRM Advance 解决方案表均定位高等教育 advancement，正文列出集中支持者数据、prospect/proposal portfolios、donor cultivation/stewardship、contribution processing、活动/捐赠者管道，并明确区分 who''s given and who hasn''t；对应成员登记（含未捐赠者）、捐赠记录和潜在支持者推进循环。", "slug": "university-advancement-platform", "source_urls": ["https://www.ellucian.com/products/student/advancement", "https://www.ellucian.com/assets/en/solution-sheet/ellucian-crm-advance.pdf"]}], "name": "Ellucian CRM Advance", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T14:32:17.939808+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "2482ca0bb284f53cb2a67bcf73f4e42599f5a0003a38c07d488a190cb8cc6f41", "snapshot_path": "sources/2482ca0bb284f53cb2a67bcf73f4e42599f5a0003a38c07d488a190cb8cc6f41.txt", "url": "https://www.ellucian.com/products/student/advancement"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T14:34:13.442111+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "6fefa252deb63bd426f3fe31c3f0bc18b71d6501018d0839b5513e20d997d93d", "snapshot_path": "sources/6fefa252deb63bd426f3fe31c3f0bc18b71d6501018d0839b5513e20d997d93d.txt", "url": "https://www.ellucian.com/assets/en/solution-sheet/ellucian-crm-advance.pdf"}], "summary": "面向高校发展部门的高级筹款 CRM：集中管理支持者与捐赠者、潜在支持者/提案组合、捐赠培养与贡献处理，并提供活动与捐赠者管道分析。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:kindsight','Kindsight','{"homepage": "https://kindsight.io/", "id": "commercial:kindsight", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方页面将产品定位为高等教育筹款的 comprehensive advancement solution，正文列出 constituent management、prospect management、pledge commitments、gift matching 与 complex gift processing、annual giving/capital campaigns，并以捐赠者情报支持培养与募集，覆盖成员登记、承诺/复杂赠与记录和潜在支持者循环三项核心；页面未逐项展开基金指定细节，按商业基本记录不扩展。", "slug": "university-advancement-platform", "source_urls": ["https://kindsight.io/education/"]}], "name": "Kindsight", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T14:32:39.336395+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "6706a4c73fd464bd2d45b90dfcc21b6328e7729b78019fd340aad3ea59f6f643", "snapshot_path": "sources/6706a4c73fd464bd2d45b90dfcc21b6328e7729b78019fd340aad3ea59f6f643.txt", "url": "https://kindsight.io/education/"}], "summary": "面向高校筹款的发展平台：提供支持者与捐赠者管理、潜在支持者研究、年度捐赠与资本活动、承诺及复杂赠与处理，并含校友与支持者门户。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:salesforce-education-advancement','Salesforce Education Cloud — Advancement & Alumni Relations','{"homepage": "https://www.salesforce.com/education/advancement-software/", "id": "commercial:salesforce-education-advancement", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方页面面向高校 Advancement & Alumni Relations，正文明确列出集中支持者/校友记录、Philanthropic Research（研究档案与财富指标）、Pledge and Donation Management、Gift Planning 以及 record gifts and designate funds，分别对应成员登记、带指定用途的捐赠记录和记录式潜在支持者循环三项定义核心。", "slug": "university-advancement-platform", "source_urls": ["https://www.salesforce.com/education/advancement-software/"]}], "name": "Salesforce Education Cloud — Advancement & Alumni Relations", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T14:32:15.924804+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "c25b61d1291ebc68a7da4e846976e95c7749f6fd2dfa842cc017798772f718a3", "snapshot_path": "sources/c25b61d1291ebc68a7da4e846976e95c7749f6fd2dfa842cc017798772f718a3.txt", "url": "https://www.salesforce.com/education/advancement-software/"}], "summary": "面向高校发展部门的高级 CRM：集中管理支持者与校友记录，记录带基金指定的捐赠、承诺和复杂赠与，并提供潜在支持者研究、资格与培养闭环。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:1225544568','FreeLingo','{"deployment": ["Docker Compose 自托管", "官方托管服务 freelingo.app"], "features": ["CEFR A1-C2 对齐、按单元与先修关系组织的学习计划", "定级测评后生成周路线并按序解锁语法、词汇、阅读、写作和复习课程", "AI 生成的听说读写练习，逐题评分并持久保存反馈与解释", "SM-2 间隔重复闪卡与复习安排", "仪表盘持久展示 XP、连续天数、计划进度与单元能力", "AI 导师对话与语音练习（附加功能）"], "github_repository_id": 1225544568, "homepage": "https://freelingo.app/", "id": "github:1225544568", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方 README 明确学习计划按 CEFR A1-C2 的单元、能力与先修关系组织，并在定级测评后按周路线顺序解锁语法、词汇、阅读、写作与复习课程；study-plan 规格说明练习会持久保存题目、正确/用户答案、分数、反馈与解释，并在完成时原子持久化进度、XP 与能力。应用拥有课程边界与教学顺序，且同时提供托管服务和 Docker 自托管完整应用。", "slug": "language-learning-application", "source_urls": ["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/artcc/freelingo/main/README.md", "https://freelingo.app/", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/artcc/freelingo/main/specs/study-plan.instructions.md"]}], "license": "AGPL-3.0", "license_evidence_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/artcc/freelingo/main/LICENSE", "license_review": {"rationale": "完整读取该仓库 LICENSE 全文，确认是 GNU Affero General Public License Version 3；README 另说明商业许可仅用于免除 AGPL 义务的定制部署。", "reviewer": "opencode-go/deepseek-v4.1-flash (unit 186)", "scope": "repository", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/artcc/freelingo/main/LICENSE", "spdx_id": "AGPL-3.0"}, "name": "FreeLingo", "repository_url": "https://github.com/artcc/freelingo", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T14:31:33.905380+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "93d1c69b90d5d0484c557d81601fdf838ec119d04b1a56cb1c5caa8b3636f672", "snapshot_path": "sources/93d1c69b90d5d0484c557d81601fdf838ec119d04b1a56cb1c5caa8b3636f672.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/artcc/freelingo/main/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T14:31:35.491447+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "ea94d5765c590b119bad466b57a83806667f24f5d2840434e88cf4e8bbf40d57", "snapshot_path": "sources/ea94d5765c590b119bad466b57a83806667f24f5d2840434e88cf4e8bbf40d57.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/artcc/freelingo/main/LICENSE"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T14:31:37.987961+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "c24adc67a94ff1060bf0dc2a162f26d5882fe6f096bc72026f8e3ef317def4bd", "snapshot_path": "sources/c24adc67a94ff1060bf0dc2a162f26d5882fe6f096bc72026f8e3ef317def4bd.txt", "url": "https://github.com/artcc/freelingo"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T14:32:19.767756+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "2b4e8410c9492f9446f79f454dcfa0ecf57acb100f95856989373d980bb141c8", "snapshot_path": "sources/2b4e8410c9492f9446f79f454dcfa0ecf57acb100f95856989373d980bb141c8.txt", "url": "https://freelingo.app/"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T14:34:56.562861+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "6ae4ce1989c20acf96bf1efdaad84d9ae7b7a6f0fe20d0543e12163a9f8c2028", "snapshot_path": "sources/6ae4ce1989c20acf96bf1efdaad84d9ae7b7a6f0fe20d0543e12163a9f8c2028.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/artcc/freelingo/main/specs/study-plan.instructions.md"}], "summary": "开源且可自托管（同时提供托管服务）的 AI 语言学习平台：按 CEFR A1-C2 生成含单元、能力与先修关系的个性化学习计划，依周路线依次解锁语法、词汇、阅读、写作与复习课程，练习逐题评分并保存反馈与解释，并以 SM-2 间隔重复、XP、连续天数和计划进度持久记录学习状态。", "technology_stack": ["Next.js 16", "FastAPI", "PostgreSQL 16", "Redis 7", "Docker Compose"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:225245314','LibreLingo','{"deployment": ["自托管 Web 应用（Svelte + PouchDB）"], "features": ["按语言对组织的 Courses > Modules > Skills 分层课程体系", "由应用自动生成 cards、short input、listening、options、chips 等练习", "练习即时判定并接受课程作者声明的备选答案", "间隔重复复习队列", "保存并监控学习进度，支持跨设备同步"], "github_repository_id": 225245314, "homepage": "https://github.com/kantord/LibreLingo", "id": "github:225245314", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方课程文档明确课程是针对特定目标语言、按 Courses > Modules > Skills 排序的层级体系；README、skill 与 challenge 文档证明应用自动生成选择、输入、听写等需学习者作答的练习，并按课程声明的备选答案判定正误；README 明确保存进度、间隔重复与跨设备同步，三要素齐备。仓库已归档、官方演示站当前 404，但自托管 Web 应用形态与核心工作流有官方正文证据。", "slug": "language-learning-application", "source_urls": ["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kantord/LibreLingo/main/README.md", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kantord/LibreLingo/main/docs/courses/README.md", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kantord/LibreLingo/main/docs/courses/course.md", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kantord/LibreLingo/main/docs/courses/skill.md", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kantord/LibreLingo/main/docs/courses/challenge.md"]}], "license": "AGPL-3.0", "license_evidence_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kantord/LibreLingo/main/LICENSE", "license_review": {"rationale": "完整读取该仓库 LICENSE 全文，确认是 GNU Affero General Public License Version 3，未发现附加限制。", "reviewer": "opencode-go/deepseek-v4.1-flash (unit 186)", "scope": "repository", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kantord/LibreLingo/main/LICENSE", "spdx_id": "AGPL-3.0"}, "name": "LibreLingo", "repository_url": "https://github.com/kantord/LibreLingo", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T14:30:19.591000+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "c6bf4d1a5074ed4e56a0f4be3bacf598faa007039a360722f12fa3a28264661e", "snapshot_path": "sources/c6bf4d1a5074ed4e56a0f4be3bacf598faa007039a360722f12fa3a28264661e.txt", "url": "https://github.com/kantord/LibreLingo"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T14:30:18.535338+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "ad27c8fe3f3c748475607278837fdc040d178eb746948f445b708daa10c3d98b", "snapshot_path": "sources/ad27c8fe3f3c748475607278837fdc040d178eb746948f445b708daa10c3d98b.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kantord/LibreLingo/main/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T14:30:18.361517+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "e9df4c4e4e64b8168a71c3c67668dcffabbe8fca11d4ac4a7d5482562cd1679c", "snapshot_path": "sources/e9df4c4e4e64b8168a71c3c67668dcffabbe8fca11d4ac4a7d5482562cd1679c.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kantord/LibreLingo/main/LICENSE"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T14:31:10.155190+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "4e9aa595c814e4680ab04da24df91686cbff01d4460dcdd6c5ea387b2256286e", "snapshot_path": "sources/4e9aa595c814e4680ab04da24df91686cbff01d4460dcdd6c5ea387b2256286e.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kantord/LibreLingo/main/docs/courses/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T14:31:10.131169+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "6a0654572a739c3401eac9c6ad328e07074b15672cb44a0d16e43a833e5e8d9d", "snapshot_path": "sources/6a0654572a739c3401eac9c6ad328e07074b15672cb44a0d16e43a833e5e8d9d.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kantord/LibreLingo/main/docs/courses/course.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T14:31:23.544738+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "2816927bab0f0e73cdfaafc97a315696a3913501702d8ec12c8c64916d2f5a3e", "snapshot_path": "sources/2816927bab0f0e73cdfaafc97a315696a3913501702d8ec12c8c64916d2f5a3e.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kantord/LibreLingo/main/docs/courses/skill.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T14:34:22.729852+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "2168caa17d293cf1aea2e3c072a3172a5d3e84864c442dbe73400eb541aff89e", "snapshot_path": "sources/2168caa17d293cf1aea2e3c072a3172a5d3e84864c442dbe73400eb541aff89e.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kantord/LibreLingo/main/docs/courses/challenge.md"}], "summary": "社区所有的开源语言学习 Web 应用：课程按 Courses > Modules > Skills 分层并绑定特定目标语言，应用自动生成选择、输入、听写等练习并逐题判定正误、接受备选答案，保存学习进度、安排间隔重复并支持跨设备同步。仓库现已归档，官方演示站当前不可访问，但完整代码可自托管运行。", "technology_stack": ["Svelte", "PouchDB", "Python (librelingo-yaml-loader / librelingo-json-export)"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:degreed','Degreed','{"homepage": "https://degreed.com/", "id": "commercial:degreed", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方 LXP 页正文明确：LXP 是正式与非正式学习的单一访问入口，LMS 课程与文章、视频、播客、电子书从同一处追踪；连接 Udemy、Skillsoft、Pluralsight、SharePoint 等内容源；按员工角色/技能/兴趣/历史推荐，提供技能计划与路径，并以徽章、个人档案和技能数据记录进展。以上分别对应组织学习人群、多源内容生态、学习者主导的个人发展档案三项核心。", "slug": "learning-experience-platform-lxp", "source_urls": ["https://degreed.com/experience/lxp/", "https://degreed.com/"]}], "name": "Degreed", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T14:38:35.362636+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "63a163be17839b19a6d70cd25ba7e3fa21bee88dcb4576156ec2d5505040877f", "snapshot_path": "sources/63a163be17839b19a6d70cd25ba7e3fa21bee88dcb4576156ec2d5505040877f.txt", "url": "https://degreed.com/experience/lxp/"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T14:38:17.827761+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "9f8e043d3595727423553b06898ed0e94e6971c38682fdfe086d633590945fdd", "snapshot_path": "sources/9f8e043d3595727423553b06898ed0e94e6971c38682fdfe086d633590945fdd.txt", "url": "https://degreed.com/"}], "summary": "面向企业员工的学习体验平台（LXP）。官方 LXP 页说明其把 LMS 中的正式课程与企业内部培训，同文章、视频、播客、电子书等非正式资源汇聚为单一访问入口，连接 Udemy、Skillsoft、Pluralsight 及 SharePoint 等既有内容源；按员工角色、技能、兴趣与历史提供个性化推荐、技能计划和路径，并以徽章、个人档案与技能数据记录发展进展，同时提供学习自动化与管理工作流。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:439861','Moodle','{"deployment": ["官方 README 说明可下载 Moodle 并运行在自有 Web 服务器；本次未部署或运行"], "features": ["教育者在课程中创建并交付学习内容与活动", "管理员可代为选课，教师可手动将学习者加入课程（participants/enrolment）", "作业、测验、工作坊等课程内评估活动，支持评分标准与反馈", "课程成绩簿（gradebook / Grader Report）汇总学生成绩与进度", "GPL-3.0 开源，可自托管"], "github_repository_id": 439861, "homepage": "https://moodle.com/", "id": "github:439861", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方产品站正文显示：Moodle LMS 是学习管理系统，教育者可创建课程并面向学习者交付；官方评估页显示课程内作业、测验、工作坊等评估活动及课程成绩簿/Grader Report；官方选课说明显示管理员可代为选课、教师可手动将学习者加入课程（participants/enrolment）。结合仓库 README 与 GPL-3.0 证据，符合课程容器、课程内教学交付与评估成绩记录三项 LMS 核心。", "slug": "learning-management-system-lms", "source_urls": ["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/moodle/moodle/main/README.md", "https://moodle.com/products/lms/", "https://moodle.com/explore-moodle-lms/", "https://moodle.com/moodle-and-assessment/", "https://moodle.com/news/educators-dont-leave-moodle-course-empty-learn-enrol-learners/"]}], "license": "GPL-3.0", "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/moodle/moodle/license", "license_review": {"rationale": "The fetched GitHub license API snapshot contains the complete COPYING.txt license text with standard GPL-3.0 markers.", "reviewer": "collection-agent", "scope": "repository", "source_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/moodle/moodle/license", "spdx_id": "GPL-3.0"}, "name": "Moodle", "repository_url": "https://github.com/moodle/moodle", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-25T08:07:05.699658+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "0a0491aff16c8a9eec1a0576672625cd70c298fe43185e02c59f716ec530cbde", "snapshot_path": "sources/0a0491aff16c8a9eec1a0576672625cd70c298fe43185e02c59f716ec530cbde.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/moodle/moodle"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-25T08:07:13.162157+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "6d20d0125f46275ea12b9c5048d18d732a5ca508fe46f65eaa3d866485589944", "snapshot_path": "sources/6d20d0125f46275ea12b9c5048d18d732a5ca508fe46f65eaa3d866485589944.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/moodle/moodle/license"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-25T08:09:02.723846+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "1a8d83ef58c7971abf7915d7c7c66e548eb99bf487a29f88c2203b42c8eaf830", "snapshot_path": "sources/1a8d83ef58c7971abf7915d7c7c66e548eb99bf487a29f88c2203b42c8eaf830.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/moodle/moodle/main/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T14:42:39.416979+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "217dce2595140477903dd1da167be5ab297aa118d649b7ea088624493eb67a00", "snapshot_path": "sources/217dce2595140477903dd1da167be5ab297aa118d649b7ea088624493eb67a00.txt", "url": "https://moodle.com/products/lms/"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T14:41:25.515347+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "6bc733eb0ba9c784d33a65a878cb53852c9965d17f2d5a870437ffdb363ab581", "snapshot_path": "sources/6bc733eb0ba9c784d33a65a878cb53852c9965d17f2d5a870437ffdb363ab581.txt", "url": "https://moodle.com/explore-moodle-lms/"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T14:41:29.760335+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "97b9216f1ea5ab46ea23299a7759d1382212f370ff79a40490225420c0d1c2a9", "snapshot_path": "sources/97b9216f1ea5ab46ea23299a7759d1382212f370ff79a40490225420c0d1c2a9.txt", "url": "https://moodle.com/moodle-and-assessment/"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T14:41:29.723390+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "b35e285225350aa4b4c70d1be3f02c7b2b5c2bd4ccdf80ce0777eb481895f848", "snapshot_path": "sources/b35e285225350aa4b4c70d1be3f02c7b2b5c2bd4ccdf80ce0777eb481895f848.txt", "url": "https://moodle.com/news/educators-dont-leave-moodle-course-empty-learn-enrol-learners/"}], "summary": "面向教育机构的开源学习管理系统（LMS），支持课程创建与教学交付、管理员或教师选课、作业/测验/工作坊评估以及课程成绩簿；可下载并运行在自有 Web 服务器。", "technology_stack": ["PHP"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:scoir','Scoir','{"homepage": "https://www.scoir.com/", "id": "commercial:scoir", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方高中产品页正文面向咨询师提供学生名册与顾问分组/个人学生负载、任务表单和逐年计划、申请材料集中发送与缺失/截止跟踪、家校沟通及按顾问和群体过滤的结果报告，覆盖咨询师 caseload、学生升学计划与办公室申请/沟通/报告闭环三项核心。", "slug": "school-counseling-management", "source_urls": ["https://www.scoir.com/", "https://www.scoir.com/high-schools", "https://www.scoir.com/high-schools/feature-tasks-forms-plans", "https://www.scoir.com/high-schools/feature-send-documents", "https://www.scoir.com/high-schools/feature-reporting", "https://www.scoir.com/high-schools/feature-sis-sso-integrations"]}], "name": "Scoir", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T14:43:31.600498+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "1abf9fa6d7b3c2276ef4cab73404a2757b2fcbe9fde24bc378e48475aaead898", "snapshot_path": "sources/1abf9fa6d7b3c2276ef4cab73404a2757b2fcbe9fde24bc378e48475aaead898.txt", "url": "https://www.scoir.com/"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T14:43:43.877536+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "aee6cfd3fcf846fc5a6e3a17fdbc7225d5c9fe5fc0cc0de8a809cc362e59ccc4", "snapshot_path": "sources/aee6cfd3fcf846fc5a6e3a17fdbc7225d5c9fe5fc0cc0de8a809cc362e59ccc4.txt", "url": "https://www.scoir.com/high-schools"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T14:44:37.048303+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "fcb963da08d87c288c0bf0c7177462258ef058f5fad0a49ff51a763977c9e07e", "snapshot_path": "sources/fcb963da08d87c288c0bf0c7177462258ef058f5fad0a49ff51a763977c9e07e.txt", "url": "https://www.scoir.com/high-schools/feature-tasks-forms-plans"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T14:44:37.083081+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "24e05cc6e5569640d08ad5792d803c73a3c6073b7c437bd844147a449477348a", "snapshot_path": "sources/24e05cc6e5569640d08ad5792d803c73a3c6073b7c437bd844147a449477348a.txt", "url": "https://www.scoir.com/high-schools/feature-send-documents"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T14:44:44.733288+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "26d3e2d1c8f17e5a29ecf4867b5cb7a7b75b5963e2f8281eda8e1810d3408e2c", "snapshot_path": "sources/26d3e2d1c8f17e5a29ecf4867b5cb7a7b75b5963e2f8281eda8e1810d3408e2c.txt", "url": "https://www.scoir.com/high-schools/feature-reporting"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T14:46:20.873938+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "55b6b7886f9c480d54d3069f9fc894d6b4ce960741961452787d0cc49878b1e4", "snapshot_path": "sources/55b6b7886f9c480d54d3069f9fc894d6b4ce960741961452787d0cc49878b1e4.txt", "url": "https://www.scoir.com/high-schools/feature-sis-sso-integrations"}], "summary": "面向高中咨询师的大学与职业咨询管理平台，覆盖学生名单与顾问负载、任务表单和年度计划、申请材料发送与跟踪、家校沟通及结果报告。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:cpoms-studentsafe','CPOMS StudentSafe','{"homepage": "https://www.cpoms.co.uk/", "id": "commercial:cpoms-studentsafe", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方产品页正文说明可把事件直接升级为个案（Cases and Forms）、关联既往与未来事件、指派跟进任务，并按学生自动建立综合编年史；功能页说明可按角色控制访问并迁移学生的完整儿童保护历史，Insight 页说明可按开放/已关闭状态跟踪个案及解决天数。个案容器、经手任务与记录、按学生累积的跨个案历史三点均有官方正文依据；本次仅审阅官方页面，未部署验证。", "slug": "student-case-management", "source_urls": ["https://www.cpoms.co.uk/cpoms-studentsafe-software/", "https://www.cpoms.co.uk/features/", "https://www.cpoms.co.uk/cpoms-insight/"]}], "name": "CPOMS StudentSafe", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T14:54:14.252296+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "19113535715ea2ff5d5261c3e66d3bc0a10852f1f817ea18b17de6ac27c7a801", "snapshot_path": "sources/19113535715ea2ff5d5261c3e66d3bc0a10852f1f817ea18b17de6ac27c7a801.txt", "url": "https://www.cpoms.co.uk/cpoms-studentsafe-software/"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T14:54:21.693534+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "ad9938f39f67dd918d2b901986a705b88e81d125bd604dc0ccef88aeeb87c8bd", "snapshot_path": "sources/ad9938f39f67dd918d2b901986a705b88e81d125bd604dc0ccef88aeeb87c8bd.txt", "url": "https://www.cpoms.co.uk/features/"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T14:55:00.389240+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "666ad46ad34aa4a9aa99aa2141845b55397256ff3ecfe827ce4211ce9da1bb1d", "snapshot_path": "sources/666ad46ad34aa4a9aa99aa2141845b55397256ff3ecfe827ce4211ce9da1bb1d.txt", "url": "https://www.cpoms.co.uk/cpoms-insight/"}], "summary": "面向学校的儿童保护与学生福祉个案管理平台：按学生记录关切并自动形成编年史，可将事件升级为个案、关联既往与后续事件、指派跟进任务，并按开放/已关闭状态追踪个案及解决周期。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:1163607752','CloudCertPrep','{"deployment": ["Astro 静态站可部署到 Cloudflare Pages 或任意静态托管", "认证与进度持久化需自备 Supabase 项目（PostgreSQL + Auth + RLS）", "本地开发：npm install，配置 .env 中的 Supabase URL 与 anon key，运行 npm run dev", "官方在线实例：https://www.cloudcertprep.io"], "features": ["按 AWS CLF-C02 / AIF-C01 官方考试域组织的题库，合计 1,469+ 道题", "全真限时模考：题量、时长、及格分按各认证考试配置", "逐题正确答案与干扰项解析，域练习即时反馈", "自适应间隔重复，优先推送答错或未见的题", "登录后持久保存模考历史、逐题结果、域掌握度与薄弱域分析", "游客模式可免注册完成整卷模考", "多认证架构，可按域扩展新的目标考试"], "github_repository_id": 1163607752, "homepage": "https://www.cloudcertprep.io", "id": "github:1163607752", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "以 AWS CLF-C02/AIF-C01 两个外部认证考试为目标，题库按官方域组织，提供全真限时模考、评分与逐题解析，并通过 Supabase 持久保存考试历史和域掌握度，覆盖定义中的外部考试、考试对齐内容、评分练习闭环和持久准备记录。", "slug": "test-preparation-platform", "source_urls": ["https://api.github.com/repos/nastaso/cloudcertprep", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nastaso/cloudcertprep/main/README.md", "https://api.github.com/repos/nastaso/cloudcertprep/license", "https://www.cloudcertprep.io/"]}], "license": "MIT", "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/nastaso/cloudcertprep/license", "name": "CloudCertPrep", "repository_url": "https://github.com/nastaso/cloudcertprep", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T14:49:31.140111+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "08a16329a7dab311a5b260df23b191e62f53252ff3b26652e7dd8c6bdd45798b", "snapshot_path": "sources/08a16329a7dab311a5b260df23b191e62f53252ff3b26652e7dd8c6bdd45798b.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/nastaso/cloudcertprep"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T14:49:31.081284+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "d5efcfd9be82d86933937b5a90a694c6f3631d5092e0c5393d9316115256e744", "snapshot_path": "sources/d5efcfd9be82d86933937b5a90a694c6f3631d5092e0c5393d9316115256e744.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nastaso/cloudcertprep/main/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T14:49:31.125352+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "f5b2e6bf0dc6baf8b388b69a7fd31c1a2e6c813adb7e971b4583011134d931d9", "snapshot_path": "sources/f5b2e6bf0dc6baf8b388b69a7fd31c1a2e6c813adb7e971b4583011134d931d9.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/nastaso/cloudcertprep/license"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T14:49:36.320419+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "f9623f4335625fcca75e33cdbf1252691f8ffcebe2a6dd31135927f179ba87a7", "snapshot_path": "sources/f9623f4335625fcca75e33cdbf1252691f8ffcebe2a6dd31135927f179ba87a7.txt", "url": "https://www.cloudcertprep.io/"}], "summary": "CloudCertPrep 是面向 AWS 认证考试的开源备考 Web 应用，覆盖 AWS Cloud Practitioner（CLF-C02）与 AWS AI Practitioner（AIF-C01）两个由外部权威定义的目标考试。题库按官方考试域组织，提供全真限时模考（题量、时长与及格分按各认证配置）、逐题解析、按域练习与自适应间隔重复；登录后由 Supabase 持久保存模考历史、逐题结果与各域掌握度，形成可回看的评分练习闭环。代码 MIT 许可，可自托管（Astro 静态站 + 自备 Supabase），也有官方在线实例。", "technology_stack": ["Astro 6 + React 19 islands + TypeScript", "Tailwind CSS 3.4", "Supabase（PostgreSQL、Auth、Row Level Security）", "Cloudflare Pages 与 Turnstile", "GitHub Actions + Playwright"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:63231221','DSpace-CRIS','{"deployment": ["web", "self-hosted"], "features": ["研究人员与组织单位档案", "出版物、项目、资助、专利等关联实体", "ORCID、PubMed、WoS 等外部来源导入", "研究人员认领出版物", "潜在重复检测", "机构报告与公开研究展示"], "github_repository_id": 63231221, "homepage": "https://4science.com/dspace-cris/", "id": "github:63231221", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "DSpace-CRIS 是 DSpace 的开源 CRIS/RIMS 扩展（README、4Science 产品页与开源页）。官方产品页说明在单一系统中采集和管理研究人员、团队、部门/组织单位、实验室/基础设施、项目/合作、合同/活动、成果/专利/奖励，并与 ORCID、PubMed、WoS 等外部系统交换信息；DSpace-CRIS 9 发布说明说明出版物和元数据可自动导入、研究人员可认领自己的出版物；4Science 官方介绍材料进一步给出研究人员画像的 ORCID/部门关联、认领尚未认领的出版物，并另列存缴控制与去重工具（add-on）；其 Fraunhofer Publica 案例显示可与 ORCID、书目/文献计量数据库、HR/IDM 等内外部来源集成。仓库核心提供 DuplicateDetectionService 和 live import 包。以上共同覆盖关联记录库、多渠道获取与归因调和、画像/报告/公开展示三项核心。", "slug": "research-information-management-cris", "source_urls": ["https://github.com/4Science/DSpace", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/4Science/DSpace/main-cris/README.md", "https://4science.com/dspace-cris/", "https://4science.com/dspace-cris-9-2025-02-00-making-research-management-smarter-and-more-connected/", "https://4science.com/open-source/", "https://4science.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSpace-CRIS-general-presentation-2025_compressed-5.pdf", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/4Science/DSpace/main-cris/dspace-api/src/main/java/org/dspace/content/DuplicateDetectionServiceImpl.java", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/4Science/DSpace/main-cris/dspace-api/src/main/java/org/dspace/importer/external/package-info.java"]}], "license": "BSD-3-Clause", "license_evidence_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/4Science/DSpace/main-cris/LICENSE", "license_review": {"rationale": "main-cris 分支 LICENSE 为完整 BSD 3-Clause 文本，README 明确说明 DSpace-CRIS 源码按 BSD 3-Clause 发布；快照内容与 SPDX 标识一致。", "reviewer": "collector", "scope": "repository", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/4Science/DSpace/main-cris/LICENSE", "spdx_id": "BSD-3-Clause"}, "name": "DSpace-CRIS", "repository_url": "https://github.com/4Science/DSpace", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:01:09.519626+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "56c1dd0e2e1b9358aa9a2f0f2835ad1fbbc60fe9917084168a7136fd86e55805", "snapshot_path": "sources/56c1dd0e2e1b9358aa9a2f0f2835ad1fbbc60fe9917084168a7136fd86e55805.txt", "url": "https://github.com/4Science/DSpace"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:01:26.013207+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "c620553a4583528c9e4277f3a55b2d08ca35c1aafbd9bddb3301e01e0b4782d1", "snapshot_path": "sources/c620553a4583528c9e4277f3a55b2d08ca35c1aafbd9bddb3301e01e0b4782d1.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/4Science/DSpace/main-cris/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:01:27.484878+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "baf9ee18d437bf88b271cb233298c1b032d38b7e1629274069651ebcdbddd005", "snapshot_path": "sources/baf9ee18d437bf88b271cb233298c1b032d38b7e1629274069651ebcdbddd005.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/4Science/DSpace/main-cris/LICENSE"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:03:44.077571+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "37a79b37269dd431a42b91ab9fb8d0dbc36c96821f0e74e66f43cecad18e6cf7", "snapshot_path": "sources/37a79b37269dd431a42b91ab9fb8d0dbc36c96821f0e74e66f43cecad18e6cf7.txt", "url": "https://4science.com/dspace-cris/"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:03:46.815976+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "d074abce0618cef644a69fc99789a3a0dd9579b92b1d1635700b22579e3f7492", "snapshot_path": "sources/d074abce0618cef644a69fc99789a3a0dd9579b92b1d1635700b22579e3f7492.txt", "url": "https://4science.com/dspace-cris-9-2025-02-00-making-research-management-smarter-and-more-connected/"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:03:49.786202+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "083c28450517a186f0119d2342d071f0eba3f792e93b2b0c52bd178a1955f47e", "snapshot_path": "sources/083c28450517a186f0119d2342d071f0eba3f792e93b2b0c52bd178a1955f47e.txt", "url": "https://4science.com/open-source/"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:03:07+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "a46e0ed74a6d99af55926e363e0269a0f7681409ac2562d04ff9e309b6ad055c", "snapshot_path": "sources/a46e0ed74a6d99af55926e363e0269a0f7681409ac2562d04ff9e309b6ad055c.txt", "url": "https://4science.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/DSpace-CRIS-general-presentation-2025_compressed-5.pdf"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:04:13.653739+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "64e5721c0aa5b101d0c539de2fa1ab81de0d490c6a40ca1642421bb09c3f869c", "snapshot_path": "sources/64e5721c0aa5b101d0c539de2fa1ab81de0d490c6a40ca1642421bb09c3f869c.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/4Science/DSpace/main-cris/dspace-api/src/main/java/org/dspace/content/DuplicateDetectionServiceImpl.java"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:04:15.122067+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "52c5e4939b13e15f2790dc87fa8d058905412a31987eb9f7769f59369da92ec0", "snapshot_path": "sources/52c5e4939b13e15f2790dc87fa8d058905412a31987eb9f7769f59369da92ec0.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/4Science/DSpace/main-cris/dspace-api/src/main/java/org/dspace/importer/external/package-info.java"}], "summary": "开源 CRIS/RIMS 平台，基于 DSpace 扩展，管理研究人员、组织单位、成果、项目、资助等关联记录，并提供画像、归因认领与机构研究展示。", "technology_stack": ["Java", "Angular", "PostgreSQL", "Solr"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:51598133','SciNote','{"deployment": ["web", "self-hosted"], "features": ["项目容器与项目级权限", "实验与任务卡工作流", "任务分配负责人", "任务状态流转", "项目/实验起止与截止日期跟踪", "PDF/DOCX 报告生成"], "github_repository_id": 51598133, "homepage": "https://scinote.net", "id": "github:51598133", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方帮助文档明确以项目→实验→任务组织科研工作：任务可分配负责人并按 Not Started→In Progress→Completed 流转，项目/实验设有状态、起止与截止日期及项目负责人，并可按项目生成 PDF/DOCX 报告；GitHub 仓库身份与完整 MPL-2.0 许可证证明其为可自托管开源应用，满足科研工作项与协调闭环核心。", "slug": "research-project-management", "source_urls": ["https://github.com/scinote-eln/scinote-web", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/scinote-eln/scinote-web/develop/LICENSE.txt", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/scinote-eln/scinote-web/develop/README.md", "https://knowledgebase.scinote.net/en/knowledge/how-to-create-tasks-and-workflows", "https://knowledgebase.scinote.net/en/knowledge/how-to-assign-users-to-tasks", "https://knowledgebase.scinote.net/en/knowledge/tracking-project-status-progress", "https://knowledgebase.scinote.net/en/knowledge/how-to-create-a-report", "https://knowledgebase.scinote.net/en/knowledge/does-scinote-offer-open-source", "https://knowledgebase.scinote.net/en/knowledge/where-can-i-find-the-setup-guide-for-scinote-local-installation-on-github"]}], "license": "MPL-2.0", "license_evidence_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/scinote-eln/scinote-web/develop/LICENSE.txt", "license_review": {"rationale": "官方 LICENSE.txt 为完整 Mozilla Public License Version 2.0 正文（含 Exhibit A），README 亦明确标注 MPL-2.0；按仓库范围核验。", "reviewer": "collector", "scope": "repository", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/scinote-eln/scinote-web/develop/LICENSE.txt", "spdx_id": "MPL-2.0"}, "name": "SciNote", "repository_url": "https://github.com/scinote-eln/scinote-web", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:05:07.194312+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "ca8009b03bd88efee12bfaa92d0da1d3368c558f2387680631e980956e4e0caa", "snapshot_path": "sources/ca8009b03bd88efee12bfaa92d0da1d3368c558f2387680631e980956e4e0caa.txt", "url": "https://github.com/scinote-eln/scinote-web"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:05:06.079719+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "3287540a4f06ddf75dac4c7fc43c6764d12d0c5afa875162f03231b315e99fc1", "snapshot_path": "sources/3287540a4f06ddf75dac4c7fc43c6764d12d0c5afa875162f03231b315e99fc1.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/scinote-eln/scinote-web/develop/LICENSE.txt"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:05:05.965711+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "74e7d535de616d3490f13b7504c65fef5a01df0266409b0e97e0958f84771d92", "snapshot_path": "sources/74e7d535de616d3490f13b7504c65fef5a01df0266409b0e97e0958f84771d92.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/scinote-eln/scinote-web/develop/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:05:12.494031+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "abc2bcd0f038d5e9e02e4369814c1a0f7a153798e442313651230f72cdc45db6", "snapshot_path": "sources/abc2bcd0f038d5e9e02e4369814c1a0f7a153798e442313651230f72cdc45db6.txt", "url": "https://knowledgebase.scinote.net/en/knowledge/how-to-create-tasks-and-workflows"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:05:12.518828+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "aa67161a02bbf453bab9cfa954b85bfa3a13feb05049af15325e1d333889c3b9", "snapshot_path": "sources/aa67161a02bbf453bab9cfa954b85bfa3a13feb05049af15325e1d333889c3b9.txt", "url": "https://knowledgebase.scinote.net/en/knowledge/how-to-assign-users-to-tasks"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:05:12.735642+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "caf45b9bb67746d3f4ccf0f41e3006629a2fc8372ea022b1807a35f2a834c531", "snapshot_path": "sources/caf45b9bb67746d3f4ccf0f41e3006629a2fc8372ea022b1807a35f2a834c531.txt", "url": "https://knowledgebase.scinote.net/en/knowledge/tracking-project-status-progress"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:05:12.630222+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "f06373bc49d95dbcf5ac8421f00ec58a03d39525f77d3249c5cee3a57f0920de", "snapshot_path": "sources/f06373bc49d95dbcf5ac8421f00ec58a03d39525f77d3249c5cee3a57f0920de.txt", "url": "https://knowledgebase.scinote.net/en/knowledge/how-to-create-a-report"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:05:58.340090+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "44ebc27f88cfcdcf4a0fd1830d983cbcb26a446986a8d8f75f063abc3efcb734", "snapshot_path": "sources/44ebc27f88cfcdcf4a0fd1830d983cbcb26a446986a8d8f75f063abc3efcb734.txt", "url": "https://knowledgebase.scinote.net/en/knowledge/does-scinote-offer-open-source"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:05:58.293728+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "4e0ded58fe4f677e16faef5d51a43a616d5c3314b38ca34a86b67a70d427b8fd", "snapshot_path": "sources/4e0ded58fe4f677e16faef5d51a43a616d5c3314b38ca34a86b67a70d427b8fd.txt", "url": "https://knowledgebase.scinote.net/en/knowledge/where-can-i-find-the-setup-guide-for-scinote-local-installation-on-github"}], "summary": "MPL-2.0 开源电子实验记录本，以项目→实验→任务组织科研工作；支持任务负责人、状态流转、项目/实验起止与截止日期、实验工作流、项目权限及 PDF/DOCX 报告，可自托管。", "technology_stack": ["Ruby", "JavaScript"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:genemod','Genemod','{"homepage": "https://genemod.net/", "id": "commercial:genemod", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方设备产品页说明：仪器目录按仪器—物理单元登记型号、位置、共用团队与预约规则；设施级日/周日历可预约并在确认前做冲突检测，预约受培训状态门控；维护与校准记录可安排预防性维护并把单元标记为 down 后再阻止他人预约，覆盖仪器登记、共享时段分配和“服务记录→运行状态→可用性”三结构。", "slug": "scientific-instrument-management", "source_urls": ["https://genemod.net/products/equipments"]}], "name": "Genemod", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:09:56.458486+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "93e2beedcb3210f60919c53bc8f4892fdd8ba7139b6c1277a12ecb5553284543", "snapshot_path": "sources/93e2beedcb3210f60919c53bc8f4892fdd8ba7139b6c1277a12ecb5553284543.txt", "url": "https://genemod.net/products/equipments"}], "summary": "面向共享仪器与核心设施的实验室设备管理软件：以仪器目录登记仪器及下属单元（型号、位置、预约规则），提供设施级预约日历与冲突检测、培训门控预约，并记录维护和校准、可将单元标记为 down 后阻止预约。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:qbench','QBench','{"homepage": "https://qbench.com/", "id": "commercial:qbench", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "QBench 官方设备管理正文列出设备身份、位置与负责人、在用或不可用状态、预约信息、维护要求和校准到期；说明其支持设备预约与校准区间/维护日志跟踪，并记录可将不可用设备设为不可用、限制预约选项为“in service”设备，覆盖登记、时段分配和服务状态门控，属于 LIMS 内完整的设备管理子模块。", "slug": "scientific-instrument-management", "source_urls": ["https://qbench.com/blog/how-a-lims-helps-with-lab-equipment-maintenance-scheduling"]}], "name": "QBench", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:10:25.635537+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "e4283e8ffeb21603f5eb155486172c14a60e11be7831269e4baae08b25b0f0cf", "snapshot_path": "sources/e4283e8ffeb21603f5eb155486172c14a60e11be7831269e4baae08b25b0f0cf.txt", "url": "https://qbench.com/blog/how-a-lims-helps-with-lab-equipment-maintenance-scheduling"}], "summary": "面向检测实验室的商业 LIMS/QMS，其设备管理包含设备标识与位置、在用/不可用状态、设备预约与可用性控制、维护计划和校准历史；管理员可将不可用设备设为不可用并限制其被预约。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:295864168','VotingWorks VxSuite','{"deployment": ["vendor-managed web service (VxHub)", "offline (VxAdmin, VxPrint)"], "features": ["VxHub 在线选举管理：选举标题、日期、类型、state 与 jurisdiction", "district、precinct 与 precinct split、party、contest/ballot measure 的录入与编辑", "按 ballot style 预览和校对选票，支持音频校对与 finalize 锁定", "导出 election package、precinct/absentee 各版本 ballot PDF 与 test decks", "选举定义模型：ballot style 绑定 precinct，所含 contests 由关联 districts 决定", "VxAdmin 离线载入/签名选举包；VxPrint 按 precinct/split/party/language 打印预生成选票"], "github_repository_id": 295864168, "homepage": "https://voting.works", "id": "github:295864168", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "VxHub 官方文档《VxHub》称其为 election management 在线门户；《Data Entry and Proofing》正文列出 Election Info（标题、日期、类型、state、jurisdiction）、Districts、Precincts 与 precinct splits、Parties、Contests（含 ballot measures），并支持按 ballot style 预览/校对选票与 finalize 锁定；《Data Export》说明导出 election package 供设备配置、各版本 ballot PDF 与 test decks。既有 TDP《VxSuite Election Definition》说明 ballot style 的 contests 由关联 districts 决定、ballotStyle.precincts 绑定使用的 precinct；《Election Package》说明预生成选票 PDF 供 VxPrint 打印；《Configure VxAdmin》说明选举包从 VxHub 下载后载入；《VxAdmin Function》说明 VxAdmin 仅从外部系统载入选举包并承担离线配置/结果汇总。开源范围由同一 vxsuite 仓库 README（VxHub 为仓库内应用、所有文件 GPL v3.0 only）、apps/hub/backend/package.json（name @votingworks/hub-backend，license GPL-3.0-only）与 run-vxhub（运行 apps/hub/backend）确认。据此覆盖选举对象、地理到 ballot style 的分配、选票生产与设备配置链路；VxAdmin/VxPrint 仅作为下游离线设备端，不将离线套件当作唯一形态。", "slug": "election-management-system", "source_urls": ["https://github.com/votingworks/vxsuite", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/votingworks/vxsuite/main/LICENSE", "https://docs.voting.works/vxsuite-tdp-v4.1/system-overview/election-package.md", "https://docs.voting.works/vxsuite-tdp-v4.1/system-overview/election-package/vxsuite-election-definition.md", "https://docs.voting.works/vxsuite-tdp-v4.1/system-overview/vxprint-function.md", "https://docs.voting.works/vxsuite-user-manual-v4.1/vxadmin-system-setup/configure-vxadmin.md", "https://docs.voting.works/vxhub/vxhub.md", "https://docs.voting.works/vxhub/election-creation/data-entry-and-proofing.md", "https://docs.voting.works/vxhub/election-creation/data-export.md", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/votingworks/vxsuite/main/apps/hub/backend/package.json", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/votingworks/vxsuite/main/run-vxhub", "https://docs.voting.works/vxsuite-tdp-v4.1/system-overview/vxadmin-function.md"]}], "license": "GPL-3.0-only", "license_evidence_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/votingworks/vxsuite/main/LICENSE", "license_review": {"rationale": "官方 LICENSE 快照为 GNU GPL v3 完整文本；README 声明全部文件采用 GPL v3.0 only；apps/hub/backend/package.json 的 license 字段亦为 GPL-3.0-only，故按精确 SPDX 标识记 GPL-3.0-only。", "reviewer": "collector", "scope": "repository", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/votingworks/vxsuite/main/LICENSE", "spdx_id": "GPL-3.0-only"}, "name": "VotingWorks VxSuite", "repository_url": "https://github.com/votingworks/vxsuite", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-26T14:22:35.036355+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "6ed28cd077d7ed7976518ad60965e984cd452cebbaf668700ae5a17e8a824ff3", "snapshot_path": "sources/6ed28cd077d7ed7976518ad60965e984cd452cebbaf668700ae5a17e8a824ff3.txt", "url": "https://github.com/votingworks/vxsuite"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-26T14:22:34.037427+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "b13a3307e6df0d29b7ffb10ff16aefa1ff9989dec32887a01c302051e9cd06f2", "snapshot_path": "sources/b13a3307e6df0d29b7ffb10ff16aefa1ff9989dec32887a01c302051e9cd06f2.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/votingworks/vxsuite/main/LICENSE"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-27T13:01:28.537711+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "c109990215f618f61f8862be843564086391687665149f934e8432cc8b584169", "snapshot_path": "sources/c109990215f618f61f8862be843564086391687665149f934e8432cc8b584169.txt", "url": "https://docs.voting.works/vxsuite-tdp-v4.1/system-overview/election-package.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-27T13:01:29.032359+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "e621205f1a4d39b3be7c6008d3421526ad2e02a2d9a048a2c6e70132c7012ea9", "snapshot_path": "sources/e621205f1a4d39b3be7c6008d3421526ad2e02a2d9a048a2c6e70132c7012ea9.txt", "url": "https://docs.voting.works/vxsuite-tdp-v4.1/system-overview/election-package/vxsuite-election-definition.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-27T13:01:28.395806+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "c3a16beae9ef1034b58995600d62242e76e1a5355117b16898c408d263114848", "snapshot_path": "sources/c3a16beae9ef1034b58995600d62242e76e1a5355117b16898c408d263114848.txt", "url": "https://docs.voting.works/vxsuite-tdp-v4.1/system-overview/vxprint-function.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-27T13:01:59.490112+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "c7f974c4a396c8a47f9db0b06ed186ce07ec7b235bbe97d513dced5e9d2b33db", "snapshot_path": "sources/c7f974c4a396c8a47f9db0b06ed186ce07ec7b235bbe97d513dced5e9d2b33db.txt", "url": "https://docs.voting.works/vxsuite-user-manual-v4.1/vxadmin-system-setup/configure-vxadmin.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:13:26.282825+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "f9f11dd65709d1588342f2bc2cbd36452f315dfddb772d7991194c215a0c7d94", "snapshot_path": "sources/f9f11dd65709d1588342f2bc2cbd36452f315dfddb772d7991194c215a0c7d94.txt", "url": "https://docs.voting.works/vxhub/vxhub.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:13:26.460507+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "4ed45d309ea22b08f552d03abf3c4928774ec94d049cad5ea588eaddaba2682f", "snapshot_path": "sources/4ed45d309ea22b08f552d03abf3c4928774ec94d049cad5ea588eaddaba2682f.txt", "url": "https://docs.voting.works/vxhub/election-creation/data-entry-and-proofing.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:13:26.299184+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "650ca03ed662261d6f2651692f79a60a2a6b7c5e2ac8e51c925a3bf64565d90c", "snapshot_path": "sources/650ca03ed662261d6f2651692f79a60a2a6b7c5e2ac8e51c925a3bf64565d90c.txt", "url": "https://docs.voting.works/vxhub/election-creation/data-export.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:13:26.293613+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "610e022b59115399d33655eac7f4e23667546cc99d2200f680818aaf769ec3db", "snapshot_path": "sources/610e022b59115399d33655eac7f4e23667546cc99d2200f680818aaf769ec3db.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/votingworks/vxsuite/main/apps/hub/backend/package.json"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:13:31.358336+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "fc04c5fa11fe0fbef2a12a067f76b085392bc79398d070763e5824a7176d1491", "snapshot_path": "sources/fc04c5fa11fe0fbef2a12a067f76b085392bc79398d070763e5824a7176d1491.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/votingworks/vxsuite/main/run-vxhub"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:13:31.618045+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "762aa367471cea172b3493908c220889edc6754cbcb5050d7577bf338dcfa17d", "snapshot_path": "sources/762aa367471cea172b3493908c220889edc6754cbcb5050d7577bf338dcfa17d.txt", "url": "https://docs.voting.works/vxsuite-tdp-v4.1/system-overview/vxadmin-function.md"}], "summary": "开源选举管理套件。VxHub 是 VotingWorks 托管的在线选举管理门户：官方文档说明其用于创建选举（标题、日期、类型、state/jurisdiction）、维护 districts、precincts/precinct splits、parties 与 contests，按 ballot style 预览/校对选票，并导出 election package、各版本 ballot PDF 与 test decks。VxAdmin 离线载入选举包并签名后供 VxPrint 等设备打印预生成选票；选举定义模型将 ballot style 绑定 precinct，并由关联 districts 决定所含 contests。VxHub 代码位于同一 vxsuite 仓库 apps/hub（后端包 license 字段为 GPL-3.0-only），仓库 README 声明所有文件 GPL v3.0 only。", "technology_stack": ["TypeScript", "Rust", "Node.js", "PostgreSQL"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:4434819','e-petitions','{"deployment": ["Docker Compose 自托管", "Ruby on Rails + PostgreSQL"], "features": ["请愿起草与提交，需 5 名支持者后进入审核", "工作人员审核、拒绝并发布合规请愿", "发布后 6 个月限时收集署名", "10,000 署名触发政府回应，回应正文与发布日期显示在请愿页", "100,000 署名由请愿委员会考虑辩论，辩论记录链接回请愿页", "请愿进度时间线公开记录发布、回应、辩论与关闭", "内置审核后台与角色权限"], "github_repository_id": 4434819, "homepage": "https://petition.parliament.uk", "id": "github:4434819", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方帮助页说明请愿发布后开放 6 个月收集署名，10,000 署名由政府回应并显示在请愿页，100,000 署名考虑议会辩论；已回应请愿实例页公开呈现发布、政府回应、议会辩论和关闭的完整时间线。仓库 README 与元数据确认这是英国政府与议会请愿服务的完整 Rails 应用，MIT 许可，可自托管。", "slug": "petition-public-comment-platform", "source_urls": ["https://github.com/alphagov/e-petitions", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/alphagov/e-petitions/master/README.md", "https://petition.parliament.uk/help", "https://petition.parliament.uk/petitions/700143"]}], "license": "MIT", "license_evidence_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/alphagov/e-petitions/master/LICENCE.txt", "license_review": {"rationale": "LICENCE.txt 为 MIT 许可证全文（Crown Copyright 2011 Government Digital Service），授予复制、修改、再分发权利；仓库页亦标注 MIT。", "reviewer": "opencode-go/deepseek-v4.1-flash unit-203 collection", "scope": "repository", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/alphagov/e-petitions/master/LICENCE.txt", "spdx_id": "MIT"}, "name": "e-petitions", "repository_url": "https://github.com/alphagov/e-petitions", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:15:17.392215+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "3caf73669c8d6e7e61aece9a93c8e48a0f68fa7c58f6e208e2c4235ddbaf146c", "snapshot_path": "sources/3caf73669c8d6e7e61aece9a93c8e48a0f68fa7c58f6e208e2c4235ddbaf146c.txt", "url": "https://github.com/alphagov/e-petitions"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:15:22.074933+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "7a31a8ebe0a75feac66994fc11e052eb1d7cd2e393d5f309f79873012f9ebbde", "snapshot_path": "sources/7a31a8ebe0a75feac66994fc11e052eb1d7cd2e393d5f309f79873012f9ebbde.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/alphagov/e-petitions/master/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:15:22.175795+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "aca7eecd9c98e3b4e432b842f4443bd45ce45f85e712fb9d0c0d2f27142e5d44", "snapshot_path": "sources/aca7eecd9c98e3b4e432b842f4443bd45ce45f85e712fb9d0c0d2f27142e5d44.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/alphagov/e-petitions/master/LICENCE.txt"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:15:22.286605+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "77114a73bd33a8c2d9a9fadc45f3a7ad74f96d9cbeb8bcb0de75ea21a188bbb9", "snapshot_path": "sources/77114a73bd33a8c2d9a9fadc45f3a7ad74f96d9cbeb8bcb0de75ea21a188bbb9.txt", "url": "https://petition.parliament.uk/help"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:15:50.306859+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "8fe43eeba3d429b8c26cdf654f8d85edd48d733ba46cac0670a1df9119a7c7e6", "snapshot_path": "sources/8fe43eeba3d429b8c26cdf654f8d85edd48d733ba46cac0670a1df9119a7c7e6.txt", "url": "https://petition.parliament.uk/petitions/700143"}], "summary": "英国政府与议会官方电子请愿服务的开源完整 Web 应用：请愿经支持者提交并审核后发布，限时收集署名；达到 10,000 署名由政府在请愿页公开回应，达到 100,000 署名由请愿委员会考虑安排议会辩论，处置结果与时间线留存在同一请愿记录中。", "technology_stack": ["Ruby on Rails", "PostgreSQL", "Docker"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:emphasys-elite-hcv-housing','Emphasys Elite HCV Housing','{"homepage": "https://emphasyspha.com/elite-hcv-housing/", "id": "commercial:emphasys-elite-hcv-housing", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方产品页正文说明其面向住房管理局管理 HUD 住房选择券项目：候补名单模块收集申请人数据并作出资格认定；HCV 模块覆盖券管理、租赁、追溯调整、重新审查、HQS 检查、租金合理性与 PIC 提交；HCV Financials 管理总账/应付；Landlord Portal 提供按住户查看 HAP 付款登记；并提交 HUD 50058。具备援助计划、家庭认定与援助生命周期、补贴资金/合规证据三条核心结构。", "slug": "housing-assistance-management", "source_urls": ["https://emphasyspha.com/elite-hcv-housing/"]}], "name": "Emphasys Elite HCV Housing", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:21:44.681504+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "06ca27a4b321cfedde1439f0454a9d9da79a6a887ac4d953acd88975bb0bae2b", "snapshot_path": "sources/06ca27a4b321cfedde1439f0454a9d9da79a6a887ac4d953acd88975bb0bae2b.txt", "url": "https://emphasyspha.com/elite-hcv-housing/"}], "summary": "面向住房管理局（PHA）的住房选择券（HCV）项目管理套件：候补名单与资格认定、券发放与租赁、重新认证、HQS 检查、租金合理性、HAP 付款登记与财务，以及 HUD 50058 合规提交。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:1148837454','OpenSPP','{"deployment": ["Docker Compose 自托管（docker compose --profile ui up -d）", "Web 管理界面（Odoo 19，默认 8069 端口）"], "features": ["个人与家庭（group）统一登记、成员关系、证件与去重", "按项目配置资格规则、参保/退出与时间限定周期", "现金和实物权益的计算、审批与发放", "支付批次、发放对账与项目资金跟踪", "持续合规条件、通知与申诉处理"], "github_repository_id": 1148837454, "homepage": "https://openspp.org", "id": "github:1148837454", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "该仓库是完整社会保护管理 Web 应用：以个人/家庭登记为基础，按项目执行资格核验与参保，生成现金/实物权益并通过支付批次发放，再以周期、合规与申诉维持权益生命周期，符合公共福利管理的三项核心结构。", "slug": "public-benefits-management", "source_urls": ["https://api.github.com/repos/OpenSPP/OpenSPP2", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/OpenSPP/OpenSPP2/19.0/README.md", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/OpenSPP/OpenSPP2/19.0/spp_programs/README.rst", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/OpenSPP/OpenSPP2/19.0/spp_registry/README.rst", "https://docs.openspp.org/products/features/program_management", "https://docs.openspp.org/user_guide/programs/create_programs"]}], "license": "LGPL-3.0", "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/OpenSPP/OpenSPP2/license", "name": "OpenSPP", "repository_url": "https://github.com/OpenSPP/OpenSPP2", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:21:51.568629+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "4ced904f35ae60a46b3889520d2b571f9fc204926d8e29952e5ff8cdb61472bc", "snapshot_path": "sources/4ced904f35ae60a46b3889520d2b571f9fc204926d8e29952e5ff8cdb61472bc.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/OpenSPP/OpenSPP2"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:21:51.577969+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "e1c94bb858dbeea5dc3da6aa08346bd2e09b03ea003a298a550b65fea285d885", "snapshot_path": "sources/e1c94bb858dbeea5dc3da6aa08346bd2e09b03ea003a298a550b65fea285d885.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/OpenSPP/OpenSPP2/license"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:21:51.698197+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "63f7ca9e129f1a2ea7a7ae0e132504b46e823367db86cb1231020dec0198106e", "snapshot_path": "sources/63f7ca9e129f1a2ea7a7ae0e132504b46e823367db86cb1231020dec0198106e.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/OpenSPP/OpenSPP2/19.0/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:21:51.329683+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "e807c7ec2307ffd57d105fdcaebaea1d7e159dfbcec37a83ddb1496876636d19", "snapshot_path": "sources/e807c7ec2307ffd57d105fdcaebaea1d7e159dfbcec37a83ddb1496876636d19.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/OpenSPP/OpenSPP2/19.0/spp_programs/README.rst"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:21:51.307877+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "c553553e06940d9c075a52f48bd2dce6831129950e7f2353387c5d354c5b5dc7", "snapshot_path": "sources/c553553e06940d9c075a52f48bd2dce6831129950e7f2353387c5d354c5b5dc7.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/OpenSPP/OpenSPP2/19.0/spp_registry/README.rst"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:24:04.516445+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "5a00d4ae56991408a2bb6b017ddd3460d92e86db0547c6c399d649837144493b", "snapshot_path": "sources/5a00d4ae56991408a2bb6b017ddd3460d92e86db0547c6c399d649837144493b.txt", "url": "https://docs.openspp.org/products/features/program_management"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:24:04.729251+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "d3252d837d650a5f46f5851ba80265020119f8194b8daa5d96a5a938e3a67bd2", "snapshot_path": "sources/d3252d837d650a5f46f5851ba80265020119f8194b8daa5d96a5a938e3a67bd2.txt", "url": "https://docs.openspp.org/user_guide/programs/create_programs"}], "summary": "OpenSPP 是开源社会保护/公共福利管理平台（基于 Odoo 19），面向政府与机构管理受益人与家庭登记、项目资格规则、参保周期、现金与实物权益、支付批次、合规与申诉；仓库整体采用 LGPL-3.0，可通过 Docker Compose 自托管为完整 Web 应用。", "technology_stack": ["Python", "Odoo 19", "Docker"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:846854082','OpenRegister','{"deployment": ["Nextcloud 应用（App Store 或源码安装），自托管", "PHP 8.3+ 与 PostgreSQL/MySQL/SQLite 数据库"], "features": ["MDTO 归档元数据与 archiefactiedatum 保留期限计算", "基于 selectielijsten 的保留类别与处置依据", "到期对象自动生成销毁清单", "档案员/管理者多步审批与双人复核", "法律保留（legal hold）阻止销毁", "销毁证书（verklaring van vernietiging）与审计轨迹", "按 MDTO/SIP 向 Nationaal Archief 或市政 e-Depot 移交", "档案员角色与对象级访问控制"], "github_repository_id": 846854082, "homepage": "https://openregisters.app", "id": "github:846854082", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方文档明确其归档/记录管理模块面向荷兰政府合规：以《档案法》（Archiefwet 1995）和 selectielijsten 保留类别为依据，用 MDTO 元数据管理记录，按 archiefactiedatum 到期生成销毁清单，经档案员/管理者多步审批后执行并生成销毁证书，法律保留可阻止销毁，并按 MDTO/SIP 向 Nationaal Archief 或市政 e-Depot 移交；覆盖法定保留计划、有据处置和销毁/移交两种结局。该模块作为 Nextcloud 自托管应用的完整业务子模块纳入，而非以通用对象注册能力单独匹配。", "slug": "government-records-management", "source_urls": ["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ConductionNL/openregister/main/docs/features/archiving.md", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ConductionNL/openregister/main/README.md", "https://api.github.com/repos/ConductionNL/openregister"]}], "license": "EUPL-1.2", "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ConductionNL/openregister/license", "name": "OpenRegister", "repository_url": "https://github.com/ConductionNL/openregister", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:28:53.398659+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "653a8010511bf447da0ce41ebe1f310724e9bc59bbe31a10165182f2ffd7b499", "snapshot_path": "sources/653a8010511bf447da0ce41ebe1f310724e9bc59bbe31a10165182f2ffd7b499.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ConductionNL/openregister/license"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:28:48.253740+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "32e0f1ad9528f6740b68b4acf2485b3e94fc9d217340b5f5d635c122be2c5fe9", "snapshot_path": "sources/32e0f1ad9528f6740b68b4acf2485b3e94fc9d217340b5f5d635c122be2c5fe9.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ConductionNL/openregister"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:28:43.599468+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "8f719f18724135395f00817165ac624b7177ae97e7695956df89a113c6b23fcc", "snapshot_path": "sources/8f719f18724135395f00817165ac624b7177ae97e7695956df89a113c6b23fcc.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ConductionNL/openregister/main/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:28:43.539786+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "34f350e0bd617f6f1f94892618c77cc7a2581fd84b83d0d0f8b30983652eb663", "snapshot_path": "sources/34f350e0bd617f6f1f94892618c77cc7a2581fd84b83d0d0f8b30983652eb663.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ConductionNL/openregister/main/docs/features/archiving.md"}], "summary": "自托管的 Nextcloud 数据注册应用；其归档/记录管理模块面向荷兰政府合规，依据《档案法》（Archiefwet 1995）与 selectielijsten 管理 MDTO 保留期限，到期生成销毁清单并走多步审批，保留法律保留与销毁证书，并按 MDTO/SIP 向 Nationaal Archief 或市政 e-Depot 移交。", "technology_stack": ["PHP", "Nextcloud App Framework", "Vue 2", "PostgreSQL", "MySQL", "SQLite"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:b2gnow','B2Gnow','{"homepage": "https://b2gnow.com", "id": "commercial:b2gnow", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方供应商管理产品页写明可在线注册或按机构标准预审供应商，认证管理覆盖“申请→决定”及证书到期和续期，并可按认证状态分配分包商、在合同与付款中跟踪合规；政府公共部门页说明该产品服务联邦、州、地方各级政府机构。其持久供应商记录与政府授予的认证资格状态共同构成关系依据。", "slug": "government-vendor-management", "source_urls": ["https://b2gnow.com/solutions/vendor-management-software/", "https://b2gnow.com/industries/government-public-sector/"]}], "name": "B2Gnow", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:34:48.036316+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "53a45e143392a8920bf63a2e12eed00814f0cb19bf2079ed421473094eb912ff", "snapshot_path": "sources/53a45e143392a8920bf63a2e12eed00814f0cb19bf2079ed421473094eb912ff.txt", "url": "https://b2gnow.com/solutions/vendor-management-software/"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:34:48.080319+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "54d35f9b2bd6f8a4eefb1c0a43fdb7360677df317af174eab47b9f1a5cf7b7e8", "snapshot_path": "sources/54d35f9b2bd6f8a4eefb1c0a43fdb7360677df317af174eab47b9f1a5cf7b7e8.txt", "url": "https://b2gnow.com/industries/government-public-sector/"}], "summary": "面向州、地方及联邦等政府机构的供应商管理 SaaS，提供在线供应商注册、按机构标准登记或预审、供应商认证申请与审核、证书到期与续期管理、认证目录，以及合同和付款环节的供应商合规跟踪。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:opengov-erp','OpenGov ERP','{"homepage": "https://opengov.com/platform/enterprise-resource-planning/", "id": "commercial:opengov-erp", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方 ERP 页说明其以基金会计和统一总账作为政府财务记录，采购承诺实时更新、交易过账时即更新基金余额；请购页说明提交时按可用预算、既有承诺和预承诺校验，并贯穿请购到付款及总账；财务页列出总账、应付、应收、现金收款和银行对账等资金操作模块，符合统一账簿、预算执行控制与政府资金操作三合一核心。", "slug": "public-financial-management-system", "source_urls": ["https://opengov.com/platform/enterprise-resource-planning/", "https://opengov.com/products/financial-management/", "https://opengov.com/products/financial-management/requisitions/"]}], "name": "OpenGov ERP", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:38:01.309628+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "1adcdfc74f1cfec3ac910f4c477a4d5e82d0840aa334495f451c834612804d26", "snapshot_path": "sources/1adcdfc74f1cfec3ac910f4c477a4d5e82d0840aa334495f451c834612804d26.txt", "url": "https://opengov.com/platform/enterprise-resource-planning/"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:38:07.101405+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "df6fd53339f80e1405ea77ed2510d3534a2ee47879a4bc50f935c0c55171ca79", "snapshot_path": "sources/df6fd53339f80e1405ea77ed2510d3534a2ee47879a4bc50f935c0c55171ca79.txt", "url": "https://opengov.com/products/financial-management/"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:38:07.115597+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "35a89859ea48de78c15f52ac888dda13ddd237eafda87941f90c0414531ee38f", "snapshot_path": "sources/35a89859ea48de78c15f52ac888dda13ddd237eafda87941f90c0414531ee38f.txt", "url": "https://opengov.com/products/financial-management/requisitions/"}], "summary": "面向州与地方政府的云端政府 ERP/财政管理平台，以基金会计和统一总账为核心，在请购提交时按实时可用预算、既有承诺与预承诺校验，并覆盖请购、采购到付款以及收入、公用事业计费过账。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:armature-fabric-accreditation','ARMATURE Fabric','{"homepage": "https://armaturecorp.com/accreditation-management-software", "id": "commercial:armature-fabric-accreditation", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方产品页面向认证机构及其评审方，描述从申请到决定的认证/再认证周期管理、标准与模板、在线自评/评估/最终报告、评审组与决策环节；符合认证机构运营方的程序管理核心。", "slug": "accreditation-management", "source_urls": ["https://armaturecorp.com/accreditation-management-software"]}], "name": "ARMATURE Fabric", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:40:55.297792+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "2cc384ad5591423856f67b306cba268dc63bf382ade8e2970847834b02b75bcc", "snapshot_path": "sources/2cc384ad5591423856f67b306cba268dc63bf382ade8e2970847834b02b75bcc.txt", "url": "https://armaturecorp.com/accreditation-management-software"}], "summary": "ARMATURE Fabric is accreditation management software used by accrediting bodies and their stakeholders to run application-to-decision accreditation and re-accreditation cycles, with tailored portals, online self-studies/assessments/final reports, standards-referenced templates, reviewer teams, and cycle/activity tracking.", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:certemy','Certemy','{"homepage": "https://certemy.com/", "id": "commercial:certemy", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方产品页明确面向 professional certification boards & associations，说明处理 certification applications and renewals，并设有 Approval Workflows、Document Uploads、Experience Logs、References、可配置步骤与要求、Expiration Reminders 与 Document Generation，覆盖认证项目申请审核、记录授证和持续维护的基本用途；按商业产品作基本记录。", "slug": "certification-management", "source_urls": ["https://certemy.com/solutions/professional-certification-management-software/"]}], "name": "Certemy", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:46:25.889262+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "60e08d5327a1c65270822ee1cf06860f5943963668f0ab0ab205f19eb8792557", "snapshot_path": "sources/60e08d5327a1c65270822ee1cf06860f5943963668f0ab0ab205f19eb8792557.txt", "url": "https://certemy.com/solutions/professional-certification-management-software/"}], "summary": "面向专业认证委员会与协会的认证管理 SaaS：集中处理认证申请与续期，提供审批工作流、资料上传、经历记录与推荐人、可配置步骤要求及到期提醒。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:1174129021','Legal Training Tracker','{"deployment": ["本地自托管：./start.sh 或 start.bat 启动并在浏览器打开", "Docker Compose（前端 8501，API 8000）", "提供 Railway 部署配置"], "features": ["按 12 个美国州维护 CLE 报告周期、总学分与伦理/技能/多元化/网络安全专项学分要求", "按用户和司法辖区记录 CLE 学分活动，含提供方、学分类型、完成日期、证书编号与核验状态", "按辖区报告周期长度生成截至当日的滚动窗口，并计算个人 CLE 合规状态（compliant / at_risk / non_compliant）", "管理员和经理可查看指定用户的学分记录与合规状态", "admin / manager / member 角色权限控制", "团队合规汇总、培训完成率与测验表现报告", "内置培训课程库、自动评分测验、能力评估与发展目标"], "github_repository_id": 1174129021, "homepage": "https://github.com/noamrazbuilds/legal-training-tracker", "id": "github:1174129021", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "该应用的核心 CLE 模块覆盖继续教育管理四要素：User/BarAdmission 表示被跟踪个人，CLECredit 记录个人×活动×学分×完成日期，data/seed/cle_requirements.json 提供 12 个州的报告周期与总/专项学分要求框架，cle_service.py 据报告窗口计算个人合规状态。许可证签发与续期仍属州律师协会，不在应用内；符合“跟踪并证明继续教育、但不签发证照”的边界。", "slug": "continuing-education-management", "source_urls": ["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/noamrazbuilds/legal-training-tracker/HEAD/README.md", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/noamrazbuilds/legal-training-tracker/HEAD/data/seed/cle_requirements.json", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/noamrazbuilds/legal-training-tracker/HEAD/ltt_app/services/cle_service.py", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/noamrazbuilds/legal-training-tracker/HEAD/ltt_app/models/user.py"]}], "license": "MIT", "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/noamrazbuilds/legal-training-tracker/license", "name": "Legal Training Tracker", "repository_url": "https://github.com/noamrazbuilds/legal-training-tracker", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:45:52.062551+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "441927647b8d8c957c056a631aa8ec239b69532fcd4d2d822c917fa2c0522ebb", "snapshot_path": "sources/441927647b8d8c957c056a631aa8ec239b69532fcd4d2d822c917fa2c0522ebb.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/noamrazbuilds/legal-training-tracker"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:45:52.057355+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "9d6067d2cb87314244d7f53e43b9231347f3b43ae113182a45a08465ea2798dd", "snapshot_path": "sources/9d6067d2cb87314244d7f53e43b9231347f3b43ae113182a45a08465ea2798dd.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/noamrazbuilds/legal-training-tracker/license"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:45:51.808873+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "472bdefcb0167c6d9b10404a74c1ab145828563507a92509cc59af1188ec9232", "snapshot_path": "sources/472bdefcb0167c6d9b10404a74c1ab145828563507a92509cc59af1188ec9232.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/noamrazbuilds/legal-training-tracker/HEAD/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:45:52.017295+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "df21b22bdfa18fd520f257955e0d9ddcd550d99860e04624add0b3314aa082e0", "snapshot_path": "sources/df21b22bdfa18fd520f257955e0d9ddcd550d99860e04624add0b3314aa082e0.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/noamrazbuilds/legal-training-tracker/HEAD/data/seed/cle_requirements.json"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:45:57.749195+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "5fb9a5ffb8879ed0f6e3193f3eab123cce6439677b103fba79625192b621284e", "snapshot_path": "sources/5fb9a5ffb8879ed0f6e3193f3eab123cce6439677b103fba79625192b621284e.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/noamrazbuilds/legal-training-tracker/HEAD/ltt_app/services/cle_service.py"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:46:42.933001+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "39e726c06e5a106118e2f85e08c2b6f34fbd15501b1df988d5c0f91f405905f7", "snapshot_path": "sources/39e726c06e5a106118e2f85e08c2b6f34fbd15501b1df988d5c0f91f405905f7.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/noamrazbuilds/legal-training-tracker/HEAD/ltt_app/models/user.py"}], "summary": "Legal Training Tracker 是 MIT 许可的自托管法律培训与 CLE 继续教育管理 Web 应用（FastAPI 后端 + Streamlit 前端）。它按 12 个美国州维护 CLE 报告周期、总学分及伦理、技能、多元化、网络安全等专项学分要求，按用户和司法辖区记录学分活动（提供方、学分类型、学分数、完成日期、证书编号、核验状态），并按辖区报告周期长度生成截至当日的滚动窗口计算个人合规状态；另提供培训课程、测验、能力评估和团队合规报告。", "technology_stack": ["Python 3.11+", "FastAPI 与 Pydantic v2", "SQLAlchemy 2.0", "Streamlit", "SQLite（原型数据库，设计可迁移 PostgreSQL）", "bcrypt 密码哈希与会话令牌认证"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:1324163874','OpenBooks','{"deployment": ["Docker Compose 自托管 Web 应用", "PostgreSQL 16、Redis 7、MinIO 与独立后台 worker"], "features": ["基金维度：FundKind 为 operating/restricted/endowment/plant/board_designated；createFund 要求 fund 段存在且 is_balancing，并记录 restriction_class 与 off/advisory/hard 预算控制（funds.ts:7,73-102,205-208）", "逐笔基金入账与基金平衡：分录行使用 extra_dims.fund；非零残差无基金时以 fund_missing 拒绝，缺省时回填默认基金，按基金汇总后生成平衡腿，集成测试断言每基金合计为零（fund-posting.ts:122-155；fund-balancing.integration.test.ts:99-104,252-264）", "基金间配对：setFundPair 配置基金间 due-from/due-to 账户，interfundLegs 生成带基金维度的平衡腿；未配置配对时以 interfund_pair_missing 拒绝（funds.ts:236-259；fund-posting.ts:236-285；fund-balancing.integration.test.ts:106-196）", "限制解除：fund_releases 状态含 draft/pending_approval/posted/void；过账校验限制类别对、可用余额、期间与留本董事会拨款，成功后写 posted_entry_id（releases.ts:33,207-320,783-855）", "功能费用：固定 program/management_general/fundraising 三类映射；费用缺少有效映射时拒绝出表（functional.ts:16-17,384-414）", "基金级/非营利报表：loadNonprofitStatements 支持 fundId 过滤，输出按限制类净资产、活动、功能费用与现金流调节，并提供基金覆盖 tie-out（statements.ts:70-159,500-549,743-781）", "可选功能边界：nonprofit/fundAccounting/functionalExpenses 等由 Company Settings → Features 开关；关闭后拒绝相关记账并隐藏内置报表（README:190,208；feature-fence.integration.test.ts:42-53,390-434）", "README 明确 alpha、未完成独立会计或安全认证，能力为代码现状而非可直接投产承诺（README:136,190）"], "github_repository_id": 1324163874, "homepage": "https://openbooks-site.vercel.app", "id": "github:1324163874", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "已保留官方源码与集成测试，而非仅依据 README 能力词：funds.ts 定义 operating/restricted/endowment/plant/board_designated 五类基金，createFund 要求 fund 段 is_balancing，并记录限制类别与预算控制；fund-posting.ts 使用分录行 extra_dims.fund 入账，对无基金的非零残差以 fund_missing 拒绝，并按基金汇总、通过已配置的 due-from/due-to 配对生成基金间平衡腿；fund-balancing.integration.test.ts 断言每基金合计为零并覆盖无配对拒绝与默认基金回填；releases.ts 实现限制解除的类别对、可用余额、期间与留本拨款校验及过账；functional.ts 固定 program/management_general/fundraising 三类；statements.ts 提供可按 fundId 过滤的财务状况、活动、功能费用和现金流报表。产品身份为通用 business suite 中的可选 feature-fenced 非营利模块，同一 AGPL 仓库、无独立 SKU/付费版，不主张独立非营利产品；README 同时标注 alpha 且未完成独立会计/安全认证。基金会计核心工作流已有保留证据，独立产品身份与认证边界仍按上述限定记录。", "slug": "nonprofit-fund-accounting", "source_urls": ["https://api.github.com/repos/braedonsaunders/openbooks", "https://api.github.com/repos/braedonsaunders/openbooks/license", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/braedonsaunders/openbooks/main/README.md", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/braedonsaunders/openbooks/main/docs/operations/industry-demo-companies.md", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/braedonsaunders/openbooks/main/engine/src/nonprofit/funds.ts", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/braedonsaunders/openbooks/main/engine/src/nonprofit/fund-posting.ts", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/braedonsaunders/openbooks/main/engine/src/nonprofit/fund-balancing.integration.test.ts", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/braedonsaunders/openbooks/main/engine/src/nonprofit/releases.ts", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/braedonsaunders/openbooks/main/engine/src/nonprofit/functional.ts", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/braedonsaunders/openbooks/main/engine/src/nonprofit/statements.ts", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/braedonsaunders/openbooks/main/engine/src/nonprofit/feature-fence.integration.test.ts"]}], "license": "AGPL-3.0", "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/braedonsaunders/openbooks/license", "name": "OpenBooks", "repository_url": "https://github.com/braedonsaunders/openbooks", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:57:50.698168+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "7be1a8db97b308f700723a7f15e7e1869d69843a12792c08e6c2c5dc851ef13b", "snapshot_path": "sources/7be1a8db97b308f700723a7f15e7e1869d69843a12792c08e6c2c5dc851ef13b.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/braedonsaunders/openbooks"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:57:50.970010+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "436e9103637a55eb32559ff16c3463ce95280fab9cdd092d2c0841b5dd7a8293", "snapshot_path": "sources/436e9103637a55eb32559ff16c3463ce95280fab9cdd092d2c0841b5dd7a8293.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/braedonsaunders/openbooks/license"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:57:55.908610+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "d2d3ecdd5438515e34022766c7c2c8ac000a612e88ebe9eb1886a0a3aabc8add", "snapshot_path": "sources/d2d3ecdd5438515e34022766c7c2c8ac000a612e88ebe9eb1886a0a3aabc8add.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/braedonsaunders/openbooks/main/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:57:55.859349+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "bf8eeb972e0a155a834787d634fc4ecb9986127eaba969e21e074489f1fa4865", "snapshot_path": "sources/bf8eeb972e0a155a834787d634fc4ecb9986127eaba969e21e074489f1fa4865.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/braedonsaunders/openbooks/main/docs/operations/industry-demo-companies.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:09:16.272075+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "da799b28ba42baf6f07b8c214138f70b95495edde6354b3d36ad1cb189284614", "snapshot_path": "sources/da799b28ba42baf6f07b8c214138f70b95495edde6354b3d36ad1cb189284614.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/braedonsaunders/openbooks/main/engine/src/nonprofit/funds.ts"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:09:16.633812+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "c42f56ffb2efee34ee53581925e75b6ac531f40a9eb14687ce76bcebba87ed79", "snapshot_path": "sources/c42f56ffb2efee34ee53581925e75b6ac531f40a9eb14687ce76bcebba87ed79.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/braedonsaunders/openbooks/main/engine/src/nonprofit/fund-posting.ts"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:09:16.285159+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "9ea3cf1000102818cfe22fb35d4cfd7c22b2ca339a04c9ccdd0cfdb92858026e", "snapshot_path": "sources/9ea3cf1000102818cfe22fb35d4cfd7c22b2ca339a04c9ccdd0cfdb92858026e.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/braedonsaunders/openbooks/main/engine/src/nonprofit/fund-balancing.integration.test.ts"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:09:16.566336+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "d4f970e0891a6a1686da935d14caa693408697f3bd724dac0161da348a3b1081", "snapshot_path": "sources/d4f970e0891a6a1686da935d14caa693408697f3bd724dac0161da348a3b1081.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/braedonsaunders/openbooks/main/engine/src/nonprofit/releases.ts"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:09:16.373119+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "b8677a2f2fdd4ce741f7fc1922ceb4eaeef1e8029501d6089929837caedc8054", "snapshot_path": "sources/b8677a2f2fdd4ce741f7fc1922ceb4eaeef1e8029501d6089929837caedc8054.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/braedonsaunders/openbooks/main/engine/src/nonprofit/functional.ts"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:09:16.567867+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "b25fb4d9b6ffd38caa043c017a0cb39f3d14418e26d1344df7e842a2c833459a", "snapshot_path": "sources/b25fb4d9b6ffd38caa043c017a0cb39f3d14418e26d1344df7e842a2c833459a.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/braedonsaunders/openbooks/main/engine/src/nonprofit/statements.ts"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:09:16.843006+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "16fb3dd2874939f216d733e5dc14223585d6b1d701a50aa17e556326c0e931f8", "snapshot_path": "sources/16fb3dd2874939f216d733e5dc14223585d6b1d701a50aa17e556326c0e931f8.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/braedonsaunders/openbooks/main/engine/src/nonprofit/feature-fence.integration.test.ts"}], "summary": "通用、自托管的开源 business suite；非营利基金会计是同一 AGPL 仓库内通过 Company Settings → Features 开启的可选功能组，不是独立 SKU 或单独付费版。保留的官方源码与集成测试显示：基金按 operating/restricted/endowment/plant/board_designated 分类并作为平衡维度，分录按 fund 维度入账，跨基金分录用已配置的 due-from/due-to 生成平衡腿，限制解除会校验类别对与可用余额后过账，功能费用固定为 program/management_general/fundraising，并输出可按基金过滤的非营利报表。README 标为 alpha、未完成独立会计/安全认证，能力清单与测试不代表可直接投产；许可证 README 标 AGPL-3.0-or-later，GitHub license API 返回 AGPL-3.0。homepage 取自仓库元数据。", "technology_stack": ["TypeScript", "Next.js", "PostgreSQL 16", "Redis 7", "Docker Compose"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:1365010357','CivicOps','{"deployment": ["自托管（Docker Compose）"], "features": ["受赠方赠款记录：资助方、赠款编号、金额、申请/提交/授予日期、起止期限、报告截止、限制性用途", "受赠方赠款生命周期：Prospect、Application in progress、Submitted、Awarded、Active、Closed，及拒绝/撤回分支", "按赠款登记支出与超支保护，仅 Active 赠款可支出，结项后不可编辑", "资助报告：模板、证据快照、章节生成/编辑/批准、必需章节校验、定稿与导出", "按赠款、支出类别与组织组合的财务和报告截止汇总", "组织隔离、JWT 认证与 GRANT_MANAGER 等角色权限", "自托管：Docker Compose、PostgreSQL、Angular Web 界面"], "github_repository_id": 1365010357, "homepage": "https://github.com/sekacorn/CivicOps", "id": "github:1365010357", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "接收方赠款记录：Grant 实体以 organization 归属记录 grantorName（已识别外部资助方）、awardAmount、grantNumber、申请/提交/授予日期、startDate/endDate、reportingDeadline、restricted 与 restrictionDescription，并把状态限定为 PROSPECT→APPLICATION_IN_PROGRESS→SUBMITTED→AWARDED→ACTIVE→CLOSED（含 REJECTED/WITHDRAWN 分支），Closed 后不可编辑，符合“赠款作为资助关系固定记录”的核心。义务管理：README 与 GrantReportService 展示按赠款创建报告、模板章节、冻结证据快照、章节批准、必需章节校验与 finalize 定稿，报告截止字段与 grant-reports 汇总把资助方期限转成可管理的工作。资金纪律：GrantExpenseService 仅允许 ACTIVE 赠款登记支出，锁定赠款行并拒绝使累计支出超过 awardAmount 的记录，类别/日期过滤与财务汇总按单笔赠款核算。应用形态：README 提供 Docker Compose 自托管、Angular 前端 grants 路由、组织隔离与 GRANT_MANAGER 角色，grants 与 grantreporting 为完整的接收方业务子模块而非仅 SDK 或客户端。", "slug": "nonprofit-grant-management", "source_urls": ["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sekacorn/CivicOps/master/README.md", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sekacorn/CivicOps/master/src/main/java/org/civicops/grants/grant/Grant.java", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sekacorn/CivicOps/master/src/main/java/org/civicops/grants/expense/GrantExpenseService.java", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sekacorn/CivicOps/master/src/main/java/org/civicops/grantreporting/report/GrantReportService.java"]}], "license": "Apache-2.0", "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/sekacorn/CivicOps/license", "name": "CivicOps", "repository_url": "https://github.com/sekacorn/CivicOps", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:55:09.915687+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "bb65a2c58454ebbb807eb24e3a88cd2319197b74a0a6312c95aef575f27ed6f6", "snapshot_path": "sources/bb65a2c58454ebbb807eb24e3a88cd2319197b74a0a6312c95aef575f27ed6f6.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/sekacorn/CivicOps"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:55:11.750546+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "1fc2ffffae0aecdc44d694ec252ba0c42398895baae9906a20358a392a0bbc80", "snapshot_path": "sources/1fc2ffffae0aecdc44d694ec252ba0c42398895baae9906a20358a392a0bbc80.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sekacorn/CivicOps/master/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:54:50.782458+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "10cd0dd58726858f0908ea87db1c0eb22dea4bb433a5bda0c1484a5139dbfe55", "snapshot_path": "sources/10cd0dd58726858f0908ea87db1c0eb22dea4bb433a5bda0c1484a5139dbfe55.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/sekacorn/CivicOps/license"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:55:10.433000+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "b8cf43adc7c33b3221c4884fb58b470df6af5ddc71b2330fe4234a3d8c969948", "snapshot_path": "sources/b8cf43adc7c33b3221c4884fb58b470df6af5ddc71b2330fe4234a3d8c969948.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/sekacorn/CivicOps/git/trees/master?recursive=1"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:55:32.049969+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "6684426e43e5bafccda47b64946e4b4bc1d6d4dcde1ba4b27090b28b07fe050a", "snapshot_path": "sources/6684426e43e5bafccda47b64946e4b4bc1d6d4dcde1ba4b27090b28b07fe050a.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sekacorn/CivicOps/master/src/main/java/org/civicops/grants/grant/Grant.java"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:55:33.460268+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "eae67cf087b4932564d98583a7a1c3da5f67da5de233b65bd19dc18f8400c83f", "snapshot_path": "sources/eae67cf087b4932564d98583a7a1c3da5f67da5de233b65bd19dc18f8400c83f.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sekacorn/CivicOps/master/src/main/java/org/civicops/grants/expense/GrantExpenseService.java"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T15:56:07.836703+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "f441eb9b8c74040b030d8959df9e8d195039aadd60828443287a04e1b9ae8bd0", "snapshot_path": "sources/f441eb9b8c74040b030d8959df9e8d195039aadd60828443287a04e1b9ae8bd0.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sekacorn/CivicOps/master/src/main/java/org/civicops/grantreporting/report/GrantReportService.java"}], "summary": "开源自托管的非营利组织运营平台，其 grants 与 grantreporting 模块构成受赠方（接收组织）的完整赠款管理业务子模块：以组织内赠款记录绑定资助方名称、金额、编号、申请/提交/授予日期、起止期限、报告截止与限制性用途说明，按 Prospect→Application in progress→Submitted→Awarded→Active→Closed 受控生命周期管理；仅 Active 赠款可登记支出，并以行锁和超支校验按赠款预算约束支出；另含资助报告模板、证据快照、章节评审与定稿导出，以及按赠款/类别/组合的财务与报告汇总。整套应用提供 Docker Compose 自托管、组织隔离与 GRANT_MANAGER 等角色权限。当前版本为 0.1.0 release candidate。", "technology_stack": ["Java 21", "Spring Boot", "PostgreSQL", "Angular", "Docker"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:212690136','Program Management Module (PMM)','{"deployment": ["Salesforce managed package，安装到 Salesforce org；需要 Salesforce 平台", "安装 PMM 时自动引入闭源 SFDO Base 包；PMM 包本身为 BSD-3-Clause", "不是独立自托管的服务器应用；本次未部署、未运行"], "features": ["Program 主记录：名称、开始/结束日期、Planned/Active/Completed/Canceled 状态", "Program 下的 Service 目录，每项服务带计量单位", "Service Schedule：一次性或按日/周/月重复的计划服务，并生成 Service Session", "Service Participant 与 Program Engagement：参与者报名、项目参与周期和阶段", "Service Delivery：按场次/服务记录出勤状态、数量、服务提供者与交付日期", "在 Service Session 上使用 Track Attendance 批量生成服务交付记录", "按 Program 汇总的 Services Delivered (Year to Date) 等内置报表"], "github_repository_id": 212690136, "homepage": "https://salesforce.com/nonprofit/managed-packages", "id": "github:212690136", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方产品页与 PMM 文档/元数据表明：Program 是持久主记录（含起止日期与 Planned/Active/Completed/Canceled 状态），Service 挂在 Program 下；Service Schedule 表示一次性或周期性计划服务并生成 Service Session，参与者通过 Service Participant/Program Engagement 关联；Service Delivery 记录每个场次/服务的出勤状态与数量，并可按 Program 汇总为 Services Delivered (Year to Date) 报告。因此“项目记录—计划交付—按计划归因的交付记录—项目绩效汇总”四要件成立。边界：PMM 是 Salesforce 平台上的完整业务模块，需 Salesforce org 并自动安装闭源 SFDO Base，不是独立自托管应用；BSD-3-Clause 仅覆盖 PMM 包。", "slug": "nonprofit-program-management", "source_urls": ["https://www.salesforce.com/nonprofit/managed-packages", "https://trailhead.salesforce.com/content/learn/modules/program-management-with-nonprofit-cloud/meet-program-management-module", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SalesforceFoundation/PMM/main/README.md", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SalesforceFoundation/PMM/main/force-app/main/default/objects/Program__c/fields/Status__c.field-meta.xml", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SalesforceFoundation/PMM/main/force-app/main/default/objects/Program__c/fields/StartDate__c.field-meta.xml", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SalesforceFoundation/PMM/main/force-app/main/default/objects/Program__c/fields/EndDate__c.field-meta.xml", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SalesforceFoundation/PMM/main/force-app/main/default/reports/ProgramManagementReports/Services_Delivered_Year_to_Date_MY.report-meta.xml", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SalesforceFoundation/PMM/main/force-app/main/default/objects/ServiceDelivery__c/fields/ServiceSession__c.field-meta.xml", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SalesforceFoundation/PMM/main/force-app/main/default/objects/ServiceDelivery__c/fields/AttendanceStatus__c.field-meta.xml"]}], "license": "BSD-3-Clause", "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/SalesforceFoundation/PMM/license", "name": "Program Management Module (PMM)", "repository_url": "https://github.com/SalesforceFoundation/PMM", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:03:51.002162+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "9d11093d99d1401611dd6e137fd38f2b3afcc8e678fb49fedd673e3d50e87046", "snapshot_path": "sources/9d11093d99d1401611dd6e137fd38f2b3afcc8e678fb49fedd673e3d50e87046.txt", "url": "https://www.salesforce.com/nonprofit/managed-packages"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:02:48.137395+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "dcf003a308e3b147d424bee59c32b757d770cb602f3318688b76b7f58f54465a", "snapshot_path": "sources/dcf003a308e3b147d424bee59c32b757d770cb602f3318688b76b7f58f54465a.txt", "url": "https://trailhead.salesforce.com/content/learn/modules/program-management-with-nonprofit-cloud/meet-program-management-module"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:02:27.616660+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "10ddd7ec543907fb566036bf1d1953186cbc4a63c473c1bca3afef11e13a6aff", "snapshot_path": "sources/10ddd7ec543907fb566036bf1d1953186cbc4a63c473c1bca3afef11e13a6aff.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/SalesforceFoundation/PMM"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:02:27.365952+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "3dae818261b5379a23365da59e7828623fb064894b7b37bb606c60e9b659b748", "snapshot_path": "sources/3dae818261b5379a23365da59e7828623fb064894b7b37bb606c60e9b659b748.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SalesforceFoundation/PMM/main/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:02:27.419135+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "08133ffc26cd549904f453bf194c1b6838faa164a8ea81c3eda2fb5924b58a9f", "snapshot_path": "sources/08133ffc26cd549904f453bf194c1b6838faa164a8ea81c3eda2fb5924b58a9f.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/SalesforceFoundation/PMM/license"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:03:24.714734+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "3ee877caee9aec095a13db0414a1f4535c8e44193fd0e77b479f31d322ef83f7", "snapshot_path": "sources/3ee877caee9aec095a13db0414a1f4535c8e44193fd0e77b479f31d322ef83f7.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SalesforceFoundation/PMM/main/force-app/main/default/objects/Program__c/fields/Status__c.field-meta.xml"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:06:45.043013+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "02dcac69aa4175e74e7455921132feb26a370aeda25faf4d0c49d5dbb2378ce4", "snapshot_path": "sources/02dcac69aa4175e74e7455921132feb26a370aeda25faf4d0c49d5dbb2378ce4.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SalesforceFoundation/PMM/main/force-app/main/default/objects/Program__c/fields/StartDate__c.field-meta.xml"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:06:45.009978+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "c0b5e4e1e7add4e9940981de5320ec03bdc4e1b8ccb78aa80713c424d8fc5d32", "snapshot_path": "sources/c0b5e4e1e7add4e9940981de5320ec03bdc4e1b8ccb78aa80713c424d8fc5d32.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SalesforceFoundation/PMM/main/force-app/main/default/objects/Program__c/fields/EndDate__c.field-meta.xml"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:02:47.241681+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "ad18df8c3eb292639c64c6bebc27f2c602904929c12d6e652c0cab726da9fda5", "snapshot_path": "sources/ad18df8c3eb292639c64c6bebc27f2c602904929c12d6e652c0cab726da9fda5.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SalesforceFoundation/PMM/main/force-app/main/default/objects/ServiceSchedule__c/fields/Frequency__c.field-meta.xml"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:02:47.233894+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "88db70c0ad972260fb94f5a0a00cd63dfe966e50f031bb31111372919c07b9ce", "snapshot_path": "sources/88db70c0ad972260fb94f5a0a00cd63dfe966e50f031bb31111372919c07b9ce.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SalesforceFoundation/PMM/main/force-app/main/default/reports/ProgramManagementReports/Services_Delivered_Year_to_Date_MY.report-meta.xml"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:07:26.674644+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "1891bb0c35baf3816b5a55da8643412e4d3d4bc8d54f77b5d03e5d077440dc23", "snapshot_path": "sources/1891bb0c35baf3816b5a55da8643412e4d3d4bc8d54f77b5d03e5d077440dc23.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SalesforceFoundation/PMM/main/force-app/main/default/objects/ServiceDelivery__c/fields/ServiceSession__c.field-meta.xml"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:07:26.652609+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "16aaf8aac6d0dc02b3a89276e2d9ee524415ca2cb0dc10e701290eca49a08d06", "snapshot_path": "sources/16aaf8aac6d0dc02b3a89276e2d9ee524415ca2cb0dc10e701290eca49a08d06.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SalesforceFoundation/PMM/main/force-app/main/default/objects/ServiceDelivery__c/fields/AttendanceStatus__c.field-meta.xml"}], "summary": "Salesforce Foundation 的 Program Management Module（PMM）是面向非营利组织的开源、免费 Salesforce 托管包：以 Program 为项目主记录，管理 Program 下的 Service、一次性/周期性 Service Schedule 与 Service Session、参与者/项目参与（Service Participant/Program Engagement），并按场次记录 Service Delivery 的出勤与数量，提供按 Program 汇总的服务交付报表。PMM 以 BSD-3-Clause 发布，但作为 Salesforce 平台上的完整业务模块运行，安装时自动带入闭源 SFDO Base，需 Salesforce org，不能独立自托管；开源许可仅覆盖 PMM 包。", "technology_stack": ["Apex", "Lightning Web Components", "Salesforce metadata / managed package"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:socialsuite','Socialsuite','{"homepage": "https://www.socialsuitehq.com/", "id": "commercial:socialsuite", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方 /impact 页面明确以 theory of change 为起点、跟踪 nonprofit/NGO 的 outcomes，并用可视化输出和影响报告进行对外沟通；首页明确将定性 outcomes 转为可比较数据，覆盖框架—证据—沟通三要件。", "slug": "social-impact-measurement", "source_urls": ["https://www.socialsuitehq.com/impact", "https://www.socialsuitehq.com/"]}], "name": "Socialsuite", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:07:15.237059+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "ad645958e7adb88537ea6a8b0377c9d61fbd74cd3bc86b33a02d66b21f956287", "snapshot_path": "sources/ad645958e7adb88537ea6a8b0377c9d61fbd74cd3bc86b33a02d66b21f956287.txt", "url": "https://www.socialsuitehq.com/impact"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:07:15.259538+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "143b84ec15b3f750ac24ea213cd6d7cad89c317e2e866e3874672f4d2eb46fd1", "snapshot_path": "sources/143b84ec15b3f750ac24ea213cd6d7cad89c317e2e866e3874672f4d2eb46fd1.txt", "url": "https://www.socialsuitehq.com/"}], "summary": "面向非营利组织、基金会与社会企业的社会影响/结果测量平台：以组织自身的 theory of change 为起点跟踪 outcomes，并以可视化输出和影响报告对外沟通；官网称可将定性 outcomes 转为可比较数据。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:sopact','Sopact','{"homepage": "https://www.sopact.com/", "id": "commercial:sopact", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方 portfolio 页面明确从已有证据生成 theory of change 和指标、与受资助方共同约定并按节奏收集、以可回溯到指标与提交记录的方式生成组合/捐赠者报告；首页说明 forms/files/feedback 与 response summaries，覆盖三要件。", "slug": "social-impact-measurement", "source_urls": ["https://www.sopact.com/solutions/portfolio-management", "https://www.sopact.com/"]}], "name": "Sopact", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:07:15.226596+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "c67cf7f99d11144e3b6de9c363a529caf95ac738e6b68417ceb62dd7c89e412b", "snapshot_path": "sources/c67cf7f99d11144e3b6de9c363a529caf95ac738e6b68417ceb62dd7c89e412b.txt", "url": "https://www.sopact.com/solutions/portfolio-management"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:07:15.328591+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "84de6081fbe69a36ceb9c8d472c5d8cd6de4489039326897734ae921fa4ad93d", "snapshot_path": "sources/84de6081fbe69a36ceb9c8d472c5d8cd6de4489039326897734ae921fa4ad93d.txt", "url": "https://www.sopact.com/"}], "summary": "面向资助者、基金会与项目组合的 impact & ESG 管理平台：从尽职调查材料形成 theory of change 与候选指标，与受资助方约定指标和收集节奏，按季度收集结果并保留其来源，生成可回溯的组合与捐赠者报告。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:465885927','IETF Datatracker','{"deployment": ["Docker Compose 环境（PostgreSQL + MinIO 对象存储）", "README 说明支持原生安装（较复杂）", "Django collectstatic 静态资源部署"], "features": ["Internet-Draft/标准项目记录、状态与发布队列", "工作组、领域、Chairs 与 Area Director 组织", "草案多版本历史（示例 -00 至 -21）与版本比较", "WG Last Call、评审任务与草案状态门控", "IESG 投票（Yes/No Objection/Discuss/Abstain）及逐条评论", "Discuss 评论处置、立场变更与清除记录"], "github_repository_id": 465885927, "homepage": "https://datatracker.ietf.org", "id": "github:465885927", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方仓库与站点证明其为完整开源 Web 应用：草案页保留 -00 至 -21 版本历史，WG 页提供委员会/Chairs/章程，RFC 6174 定义 WG Last Call 与 WG Consensus 状态，ballot 页展示 IESG 对具体草案的 Yes/Discuss/No Objection 投票、评论及 (was Discuss) 处置。平台内意见处置以 IESG 投票评论与立场变更为据；WG 逐条技术意见主要在邮件列表/issue tracker，未夸大为平台内逐条登记。", "slug": "standards-development-platform", "source_urls": ["https://api.github.com/repos/ietf-tools/datatracker", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ietf-tools/datatracker/main/README.md", "https://api.github.com/repos/ietf-tools/datatracker/license", "https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc6174", "https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-ietf-quic-multipath/", "https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-ietf-quic-multipath/ballot", "https://datatracker.ietf.org/wg/quic/about/"]}], "license": "BSD-3-Clause", "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ietf-tools/datatracker/license", "name": "IETF Datatracker", "repository_url": "https://github.com/ietf-tools/datatracker", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:12:41.892513+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "5ed8e2ef76a95aff814513db105987b82737d1f6c8f556e23e2831d012fc6cbf", "snapshot_path": "sources/5ed8e2ef76a95aff814513db105987b82737d1f6c8f556e23e2831d012fc6cbf.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ietf-tools/datatracker"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:12:47.451216+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "2c75b9e3e135aac477f336f36474999a35149a9aa541f27754078519dcd9dcf9", "snapshot_path": "sources/2c75b9e3e135aac477f336f36474999a35149a9aa541f27754078519dcd9dcf9.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ietf-tools/datatracker/main/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:12:47.522645+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "fc189c2fbf6bf4bfff20726c72a7a6b69d78bdcdf8d293fbc371ca53c79bdb1b", "snapshot_path": "sources/fc189c2fbf6bf4bfff20726c72a7a6b69d78bdcdf8d293fbc371ca53c79bdb1b.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ietf-tools/datatracker/license"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:12:57.659747+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "8f632301d6ef87433f1f72692b3317042168a1b02d080fb39e1d8d16d0bad4a7", "snapshot_path": "sources/8f632301d6ef87433f1f72692b3317042168a1b02d080fb39e1d8d16d0bad4a7.txt", "url": "https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc6174"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:13:14.097125+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "58e14a36d10312ed0a5f106f9eb8266a634a90c088eefa5615dbf3af37695b69", "snapshot_path": "sources/58e14a36d10312ed0a5f106f9eb8266a634a90c088eefa5615dbf3af37695b69.txt", "url": "https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-ietf-quic-multipath/"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:13:15.162824+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "0215580027f2d39d93ca545ca6024eb37ec1cc5c566c0e2198c28d1bc54b28a5", "snapshot_path": "sources/0215580027f2d39d93ca545ca6024eb37ec1cc5c566c0e2198c28d1bc54b28a5.txt", "url": "https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-ietf-quic-multipath/ballot"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:13:13.757063+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "06af4a8824954ad43eea990693dca9d5fbba60afa7c91462e4ae4c9c80a85322", "snapshot_path": "sources/06af4a8824954ad43eea990693dca9d5fbba60afa7c91462e4ae4c9c80a85322.txt", "url": "https://datatracker.ietf.org/wg/quic/about/"}], "summary": "IETF 的开源标准制定工作流平台（BSD-3-Clause）：以 Internet-Draft 为在制记录，组织工作组/领域与负责人，保留草案版本历史，承载 WG Last Call、评审状态与 IESG 的 Yes/No Objection/Discuss 投票、评论和立场变更，并跟踪 RFC 发布流程；Django + PostgreSQL Web 应用，可自托管。", "technology_stack": ["Python", "Django", "PostgreSQL", "Vue 3", "Docker"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:verastly-compass','Verastly Compass','{"homepage": "https://www.verastly.com/compass", "id": "commercial:verastly-compass", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方 Compass 产品页与 chambers 页描述带美元价值、按会员等级限定资格的权益目录、自动记录的兑换、每会员 ROI，以及展示权益 ROI 的免密码会员门户。官方帮助中心三篇文档（设置会员权益、门户领取、使用报告）进一步记录权益字段（名称、描述、估值、自动来源、适用等级）、成员仅看到所属等级包含的权益、代码/员工审批/即时记录等领取方式、自动来源的具体类型（活动报名、目录、委员会出席等）、限额及兑换统计。两类来源分别归述，共同覆盖权益记录、基于会员等级的资格，以及验证—兑换闭环和计划记录，符合会员权益管理的核心结构。", "slug": "member-benefits-management", "source_urls": ["https://www.verastly.com/compass", "https://www.verastly.com/chambers", "https://www.verastly.com/help/benefits-setting-up-member-benefits", "https://www.verastly.com/help/benefits-portal-claims", "https://www.verastly.com/help/benefits-usage-reports"]}], "name": "Verastly Compass", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:20:48.607040+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "b42450589b4f4f8f5f0ef4fdafdbe04c19aafde62132b1458b0e3ef7f886b967", "snapshot_path": "sources/b42450589b4f4f8f5f0ef4fdafdbe04c19aafde62132b1458b0e3ef7f886b967.txt", "url": "https://www.verastly.com/compass"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:20:48.884415+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "488054fa2913cf15fede977190df7a255ecb64f160208bc1953464d842f4dcd1", "snapshot_path": "sources/488054fa2913cf15fede977190df7a255ecb64f160208bc1953464d842f4dcd1.txt", "url": "https://www.verastly.com/chambers"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:27:43.492599+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "ef33f336afd466395d0bf6041e554c5c1431b09af252c0458921ed7d3ce886e2", "snapshot_path": "sources/ef33f336afd466395d0bf6041e554c5c1431b09af252c0458921ed7d3ce886e2.txt", "url": "https://www.verastly.com/help/benefits-setting-up-member-benefits"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:27:45.566029+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "f304e78e9f05dc7bdf8c049856c671800f5a7db8ea23d6a819efb95d5767cb94", "snapshot_path": "sources/f304e78e9f05dc7bdf8c049856c671800f5a7db8ea23d6a819efb95d5767cb94.txt", "url": "https://www.verastly.com/help/benefits-portal-claims"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:27:47.455235+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "2aeca64df5ab0527ea5cab180f90f7e6651f8315800d48db03b0a3b990d88535", "snapshot_path": "sources/2aeca64df5ab0527ea5cab180f90f7e6651f8315800d48db03b0a3b990d88535.txt", "url": "https://www.verastly.com/help/benefits-usage-reports"}], "summary": "Commercial membership add-on for chambers and associations: a member benefit catalog with dollar values and membership-tier eligibility, auto-logged usage from events, directory and committees, per-member benefits ROI, and a passwordless member portal. Part of the Verastly CRM alongside membership tiers and directory management.", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:notebird','Notebird','{"homepage": "https://www.notebird.app/", "id": "commercial:notebird", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方页面把首次到访、住院、祷告请求等需求绑定到具体个人，可在该人的关怀更新上继续记录联系结果；后续行动以任务指派给具名同工并设到期日，完成时勾选并写入更新，活动流与报告区分未完成/已完成并保留个人历史；更新可标记私密或限制到管理员，小组还可按团队限定可见人员。", "slug": "pastoral-care-management", "source_urls": ["https://www.notebird.app/", "https://www.notebird.app/church-follow-up-software", "https://www.notebird.app/features/tasks", "https://www.notebird.app/features/updates", "https://www.notebird.app/features/groups"]}], "name": "Notebird", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:19:21.561349+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "bcc5e1a618879fc304b98fa6ca96e3514709694f07c18a7df0a346899716d0cb", "snapshot_path": "sources/bcc5e1a618879fc304b98fa6ca96e3514709694f07c18a7df0a346899716d0cb.txt", "url": "https://www.notebird.app/"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:19:21.529204+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "81bffc2cc7d99fda70fbc04ef785b6f4d63db038b3f015c53442ca0c1afe6cef", "snapshot_path": "sources/81bffc2cc7d99fda70fbc04ef785b6f4d63db038b3f015c53442ca0c1afe6cef.txt", "url": "https://www.notebird.app/church-follow-up-software"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:19:21.496958+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "de2c2f3eb11d841eac9801342c4e5304f009c4b878ca1987c869744adedad627", "snapshot_path": "sources/de2c2f3eb11d841eac9801342c4e5304f009c4b878ca1987c869744adedad627.txt", "url": "https://www.notebird.app/features/tasks"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:19:21.686390+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "37f512cb89fba8053b044f41913bb085316e81b529100208cfa1e58b5f3ebdf5", "snapshot_path": "sources/37f512cb89fba8053b044f41913bb085316e81b529100208cfa1e58b5f3ebdf5.txt", "url": "https://www.notebird.app/features/updates"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:19:21.678447+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "615fd37494727e604b254173b9d52713c4d81679ae34b60a9e9cf887e8487710", "snapshot_path": "sources/615fd37494727e604b254173b9d52713c4d81679ae34b60a9e9cf887e8487710.txt", "url": "https://www.notebird.app/features/groups"}], "summary": "面向教会牧养团队的专用关怀管理应用：在人员记录上保存探访、祈祷、医院探访等关怀更新，并可限定可见范围；把后续行动作为任务指派给具名同工并设定到期日，通过活动流与报告跟踪未完成和已完成事项，保留个人的持续关怀历史。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:rocketrez','RocketRez','{"homepage": "https://www.rocketrez.com/", "id": "commercial:rocketrez", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方水族馆页正文明确说明整合门票、会员、餐饮零售、团体销售与分析，支持入场会员实时核验、教育/团体在线预订支付、馆内餐饮零售和捐赠交易，并统计客流与消费；覆盖该叶以会员为中心、教育/团体和现场消费一体的访客运营核心。", "slug": "zoo-aquarium-visitor-operations", "source_urls": ["https://www.rocketrez.com/aquariums"]}], "name": "RocketRez", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:28:45.968323+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "7bb207d05c0c03065201187ec4d966e0a0fa359c8ec39c72a77896218ea316e2", "snapshot_path": "sources/7bb207d05c0c03065201187ec4d966e0a0fa359c8ec39c72a77896218ea316e2.txt", "url": "https://www.rocketrez.com/aquariums"}], "summary": "面向水族馆、动物园等景点的云端运营平台，整合门票、会员、餐饮零售 POS、团体与教育项目预订、捐赠及客流/消费分析，支持入场会员实时核验。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:ticketure','Ticketure','{"homepage": "https://ticketure.com/", "id": "commercial:ticketure", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方首页正文明确面向动物园和水族馆，提供云端票务、POS、会员管理、捐赠、定时入场与容量管理、学校/团体参观及场馆内销售；票务页进一步说明 QR/钱包票在入口扫描核验、团体订单关联多票和现场加购，与该叶入场、会员/教育/团体及现场消费核心一致。", "slug": "zoo-aquarium-visitor-operations", "source_urls": ["https://ticketure.com/", "https://ticketure.com/solutions/ticketing"]}], "name": "Ticketure", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:29:14.082136+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "00b5ce370fb9387875d4938af7798b5ac6f820f16c0653519e844ae380bd0a88", "snapshot_path": "sources/00b5ce370fb9387875d4938af7798b5ac6f820f16c0653519e844ae380bd0a88.txt", "url": "https://ticketure.com/"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:30:41.360919+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "4c337b510a43e861f173d17345ab5055b6f2958e29743bc154644de90e59f102", "snapshot_path": "sources/4c337b510a43e861f173d17345ab5055b6f2958e29743bc154644de90e59f102.txt", "url": "https://ticketure.com/solutions/ticketing"}], "summary": "面向博物馆、动物园、水族馆等文化景点的云端票务、POS 与会员管理平台，覆盖线上/现场售票、定时入场与容量管理、会员、捐赠、学校/团体参观及场馆内销售。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:destinationlab','destinationlab','{"homepage": "https://www.destinationlab.io/en/dmc-software", "id": "commercial:destinationlab", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方 DMC 页面明确覆盖供应商合同/费率与服务库、按日行程的自动成本与加价、确认预订后的供应商确认与执行，以及多币种供应商付款和客户开票，属于 DMC 运营方的完整业务工作流。", "slug": "destination-management-company-platform", "source_urls": ["https://www.destinationlab.io/en/dmc-software"]}], "name": "destinationlab", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:36:25.574290+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "a932184c24eef9ae8516e863a3ed0a6b08d792c589dcfc9c8eb989d615bd38d4", "snapshot_path": "sources/a932184c24eef9ae8516e863a3ed0a6b08d792c589dcfc9c8eb989d615bd38d4.txt", "url": "https://www.destinationlab.io/en/dmc-software"}], "summary": "面向 DMC、地接社的运营平台，集中管理供应商合同与费率、按日行程与成本/加价计算、报价提案、确认预订及供应商确认，并在同一系统处理多币种供应商付款与客户开票。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:voyant','Voyant','{"homepage": "https://voyant.travel/", "id": "commercial:voyant", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方首页与平台文档明确面向 DMC，覆盖供应商实时库存、带价行程与报价、预订及供应商确认、客户收款/退款、供应商发票匹配和财务核对，符合供应商库存、报价、确认预订和双向资金记录的核心链路。", "slug": "destination-management-company-platform", "source_urls": ["https://voyant.travel/", "https://voyant.travel/docs/platform/overview"]}], "name": "Voyant", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:36:14.339623+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "0510294a94b3157db715382291d14acbc1a0fc0dcdf6ea52b91eefd145d67c98", "snapshot_path": "sources/0510294a94b3157db715382291d14acbc1a0fc0dcdf6ea52b91eefd145d67c98.txt", "url": "https://voyant.travel/"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:36:14.082390+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "5b48afe4b832fa9e6efc09c266bb968f3b7e40a9b0d1faab692f40cbcb9ea22a", "snapshot_path": "sources/5b48afe4b832fa9e6efc09c266bb968f3b7e40a9b0d1faab692f40cbcb9ea22a.txt", "url": "https://voyant.travel/docs/platform/overview"}], "summary": "面向 OTA、旅游运营商和 DMC 的旅行商务与后台平台，覆盖供应商库存接入、按日行程与报价、预订与供应商确认、客户收款及供应商发票/成本核对的财务流程。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:tern','Tern','{"homepage": "https://tern.travel/", "id": "commercial:tern", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方 /agencies 正文以旅行社/顾问为客户记录与行程工作单元（CRM、trips、itinerary 级供应商明细、客户付款授权），并把 booking 自动流向佣金、报表与 payout；/back-office 正文进一步覆盖客户/供应商/顾问开票、供应商对账单佣金核对、服务费收取与顾问分成结算，构成客户侧收款与供应商侧佣金结算的双向资金记录。", "slug": "travel-agency-management-system", "source_urls": ["https://tern.travel/agencies", "https://tern.travel/back-office"]}], "name": "Tern", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:41:40.968473+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "8a900fc5abefe94001bdff6ef36307f6fbd01b4bb524a2ddd33def1e55434a8d", "snapshot_path": "sources/8a900fc5abefe94001bdff6ef36307f6fbd01b4bb524a2ddd33def1e55434a8d.txt", "url": "https://tern.travel/agencies"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:42:00.200088+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "8a241cb8ce43c726f1214c5e351a651950733a542175deb150fcc0fd96abf536", "snapshot_path": "sources/8a241cb8ce43c726f1214c5e351a651950733a542175deb150fcc0fd96abf536.txt", "url": "https://tern.travel/back-office"}], "summary": "面向旅行社与旅行顾问的前台/后台一体化平台：客户与联系人 CRM、按行程聚合第三方供应商服务的行程与预订文件、客户/供应商/顾问开票，以及供应商佣金对账与顾问分成结算。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:duetto-gamechanger','Duetto GameChanger','{"homepage": "https://www.duettocloud.com/en-us/", "id": "commercial:duetto-gamechanger", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方产品页说明其按房型、客群、入住日期和渠道设定实时价格，将系统建议价推送至各渠道，并以 AutoPilot 持续更新、可随时人工调整；具备需求驱动的价格决策、执行交接和持续循环，匹配 RMS 定义性核心。", "slug": "hotel-revenue-management-system", "source_urls": ["https://www.duettocloud.com/en-us/platform/gamechanger"]}], "name": "Duetto GameChanger", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:47:10.625282+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "8b32c445647114d375def1f0667d1c16ed485a77e32085c418d2b8f37c7085f8", "snapshot_path": "sources/8b32c445647114d375def1f0667d1c16ed485a77e32085c418d2b8f37c7085f8.txt", "url": "https://www.duettocloud.com/en-us/platform/gamechanger"}], "summary": "Duetto GameChanger 是面向酒店、赌场和度假村的收益管理系统：按房型、客群、入住日期和销售渠道实时设定房价，并将价格推送至各渠道；支持 AutoPilot 自动定价、人工干预、入住限制和前瞻需求定价。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:ideas-revenue-management-system','IDeaS Revenue Management System','{"homepage": "https://ideas.com/", "id": "commercial:ideas-revenue-management-system", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方产品页明确其以需求预测和需求画像为依据，按房型生成最优价格与库存控制，并提供自动化、系统建议及酒店技术集成；这覆盖了由系统而非 PMS 决定价格的 RMS 核心，而非仅展示报表的 PMS。", "slug": "hotel-revenue-management-system", "source_urls": ["https://ideas.com/revenue-management-for-hospitality/"]}], "name": "IDeaS Revenue Management System", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:47:10.718454+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "341ce3afc06c28d7faa272434afea59d7774a86a23a85b296c16f2e3e9235213", "snapshot_path": "sources/341ce3afc06c28d7faa272434afea59d7774a86a23a85b296c16f2e3e9235213.txt", "url": "https://ideas.com/revenue-management-for-hospitality/"}], "summary": "IDeaS RMS 是面向酒店的收益管理系统：官方说明其以 AI 预测需求，按房型结合需求画像、竞对影响与经营策略给出最优价格和库存控制建议，并提供自动化与系统推荐，服务范围从独立酒店到全球连锁。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:1327933966','HallHub','{"deployment": ["自托管 MERN 应用（Node.js/Express + React + MongoDB）"], "features": ["厅堂库存：名称、容量、日租价、设施、图片/视频、启用状态", "酒店/宴会厅多物业归属及管理员审核", "顾客按厅、日期、时段和人数提交预订", "按厅与日期检查活动预订冲突，公共页展示不可用日期", "预订状态生命周期：pending / accepted / confirmed / cancelled / rejected", "业主接受、拒绝、确认、取消及安排看场", "确认时记录押金、协议金额与备注", "已付押金后可下载预订发票", "业主预订登记与平台运营/收入/绩效报表"], "github_repository_id": 1327933966, "homepage": "https://github.com/NaimaMuse/Venue-Booking-Management-System", "id": "github:1327933966", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "README 说明这是面向酒店和宴会厅的完整 MERN 场馆预订平台：顾客浏览已审核酒店/厅堂并提交预订，业主创建/修改/删除厅堂并接受、拒绝、确认或取消预订，确认后可下载押金发票，平台管理员审核酒店并查看运营/收入/绩效报表。backend/models/Hall.js 将厅堂建模为 hotelId、hallName、capacity、pricePerDay、amenities、isAvailable 的持久可预订单位；backend/models/Booking.js 将预订绑定 customerId、hallId、hotelId、eventDate、eventTime、guestCount，并定义 pending/accepted/confirmed/cancelled/rejected 状态及 depositAmount、bookingAmount、agreementNotes。backend/controllers/bookingController.js 的 findConflict 以 hallId + 同一日历日 + ACTIVE_STATUSES（pending/accepted/confirmed）查询冲突，createBooking 冲突时返回 409，acceptBooking 再次检查冲突；getUnavailableDates 按厅输出不可用日期，构成顾客侧共享可用性面。frontend/src/pages/owner/OwnerBookings.jsx 展示该酒店全部预订请求及状态操作，是业主侧共享预订登记（event book）；frontend/src/pages/public website/VenueDetails.jsx 展示厅堂详情、不可用日期并阻止冲突日期提交。因此满足空间库存、空间×时间预订记录、共享预订运作面、冲突预防与状态生命周期等定义性核心；押金、协议、发票和报表为运营输出。", "slug": "venue-management-system", "source_urls": ["https://api.github.com/repos/NaimaMuse/Venue-Booking-Management-System", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NaimaMuse/Venue-Booking-Management-System/main/README.md", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NaimaMuse/Venue-Booking-Management-System/main/backend/models/Hall.js", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NaimaMuse/Venue-Booking-Management-System/main/backend/models/Booking.js", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NaimaMuse/Venue-Booking-Management-System/main/backend/controllers/bookingController.js", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NaimaMuse/Venue-Booking-Management-System/main/frontend/src/pages/owner/OwnerBookings.jsx", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NaimaMuse/Venue-Booking-Management-System/main/frontend/src/pages/public%20website/VenueDetails.jsx"]}], "license": "MIT", "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NaimaMuse/Venue-Booking-Management-System/license", "name": "HallHub", "repository_url": "https://github.com/NaimaMuse/Venue-Booking-Management-System", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:48:03.715828+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "6ca1f7f8c6fb6652619f462856b550ef423fc90a54e03c092cb6b7ef3fa2fcc5", "snapshot_path": "sources/6ca1f7f8c6fb6652619f462856b550ef423fc90a54e03c092cb6b7ef3fa2fcc5.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NaimaMuse/Venue-Booking-Management-System"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:48:03.596682+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "66d55be223d859a8eac1aaf3f0db85551267b7a59579467f846c9f6e81677a63", "snapshot_path": "sources/66d55be223d859a8eac1aaf3f0db85551267b7a59579467f846c9f6e81677a63.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NaimaMuse/Venue-Booking-Management-System/main/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:48:03.731544+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "de16104a8c6f52af4718da467edf92a8706bf23e6cbcfd05823de71591c651ee", "snapshot_path": "sources/de16104a8c6f52af4718da467edf92a8706bf23e6cbcfd05823de71591c651ee.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NaimaMuse/Venue-Booking-Management-System/license"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:48:03.594096+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "71806f87e31dad604549fd8c4c5693c2e44c35eca328a84f3aee0216a9d4d66b", "snapshot_path": "sources/71806f87e31dad604549fd8c4c5693c2e44c35eca328a84f3aee0216a9d4d66b.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NaimaMuse/Venue-Booking-Management-System/main/backend/models/Booking.js"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:48:09.857474+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "29a28386007d56b1b5437ab5577ed003bbb5cd1e491f4aafc2c07714ac3f9380", "snapshot_path": "sources/29a28386007d56b1b5437ab5577ed003bbb5cd1e491f4aafc2c07714ac3f9380.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NaimaMuse/Venue-Booking-Management-System/main/backend/controllers/bookingController.js"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:48:09.875961+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "50d705ff06e7039c7dc7fc46c863ff4c146901acb28726af40b85b0c1246879a", "snapshot_path": "sources/50d705ff06e7039c7dc7fc46c863ff4c146901acb28726af40b85b0c1246879a.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NaimaMuse/Venue-Booking-Management-System/main/backend/models/Hall.js"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:48:09.887481+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "1f3c3f754c105eccb21f76b7d66f3568609737e16f9dc87fdba46321348b0ea5", "snapshot_path": "sources/1f3c3f754c105eccb21f76b7d66f3568609737e16f9dc87fdba46321348b0ea5.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NaimaMuse/Venue-Booking-Management-System/main/frontend/src/pages/owner/OwnerBookings.jsx"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:48:09.849785+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "5ecac3e22ada550866f666a2051f7e72fe553a7062da87036b9fe92e5add724d", "snapshot_path": "sources/5ecac3e22ada550866f666a2051f7e72fe553a7062da87036b9fe92e5add724d.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NaimaMuse/Venue-Booking-Management-System/main/frontend/src/pages/public%20website/VenueDetails.jsx"}], "summary": "面向酒店与宴会厅的 MERN 场馆预订管理平台：业主维护厅堂库存（容量、日租价、可用性），顾客按日期提交预订；业主接受、拒绝、确认或取消预订，系统按厅/日期检查活动预订冲突并提供不可用日期，确认时记录押金、协议金额并生成发票，另含业主与平台报表。", "technology_stack": ["JavaScript", "Node.js", "Express", "React", "MongoDB", "Mongoose", "Vite"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:1006743050','BeepBite','{"deployment": ["Self-hosted Go API and React frontend against an operator-owned PostgreSQL database", "Single release binary for Linux and macOS on amd64 and arm64", "No hosted service, vendor account, or platform fee"], "features": ["Staff POS workspace with table bar, searchable menu grid grouped by category, modifiers, courses, and a running cart", "Open tabs and walk-in tickets held across a service period", "Split Check by Seat: allocate items to seats, produce per-seat totals, and tender each separately", "Assign or move a table from the POS header", "Tenders recorded as cash, card machine, bank transfer, or voucher", "Void, comp, discount, and price override with reason codes and manager PIN approval", "Kitchen display with per-station routing and expo view", "Menu and recipe management with modifiers, courses, and a live 86 list", "Cash drawer sessions, reconciliation, and sales reporting views"], "github_repository_id": 1006743050, "homepage": "https://vulos.org/projects/beepbite", "id": "github:1006743050", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "Official README and user guide document a staff-operated POS workspace that satisfies the defining core: staff start a dine-in table session or walk-in ticket and add items from a searchable menu grid grouped by category, with modifiers and courses configured in Menu & Recipes; the order accumulates as an open tab; Split Check by Seat allocates every item to seats and breaks the sent check into per-seat totals each with its own Tender action, and the table clears only once every seat is paid; the header supports assigning or moving a table; Charge opens payment with cash, card machine, bank transfer, or voucher tenders; and voids, comps, discounts, and price overrides carry reason codes, with a manager PIN step when the reason is flagged for sign-off, and are audit-logged. The /q quick-POS self-order mode is explicitly documented as having no held-open tabs, no splits, and no voids/comps, so it is not used as evidence for this leaf.", "slug": "restaurant-pos", "source_urls": ["https://api.github.com/repos/vul-os/beepbite", "https://api.github.com/repos/vul-os/beepbite/readme", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/vul-os/beepbite/main/docs/user-guide.md"]}], "license": "Apache-2.0", "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/vul-os/beepbite/license", "name": "BeepBite", "repository_url": "https://github.com/vul-os/beepbite", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:54:46.449333+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "31ae5a0f89beace5291bf78b4b61ff23dd23d349f2e86262190f247183cbd82f", "snapshot_path": "sources/31ae5a0f89beace5291bf78b4b61ff23dd23d349f2e86262190f247183cbd82f.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/vul-os/beepbite"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:54:46.440172+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "97c8bafaaa8cb0259254978b48483f78b40297d0c48c161c01129c522a0f0439", "snapshot_path": "sources/97c8bafaaa8cb0259254978b48483f78b40297d0c48c161c01129c522a0f0439.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/vul-os/beepbite/license"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:54:51.472197+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "1b2ed1274a401caeaa81cc8187996990ebd54fa16f54641334a11714588f1f9f", "snapshot_path": "sources/1b2ed1274a401caeaa81cc8187996990ebd54fa16f54641334a11714588f1f9f.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/vul-os/beepbite/readme"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:54:51.402608+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "71479633c87fa60fcd267d67972231798409ce8c1988739d4eb93ab1408a474a", "snapshot_path": "sources/71479633c87fa60fcd267d67972231798409ce8c1988739d4eb93ab1408a474a.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/vul-os/beepbite/main/docs/user-guide.md"}], "summary": "Self-hosted open-source restaurant POS web application with a staff POS workspace: configured menu grid and modifiers, open tabs and seat-level check splitting, table transfer, tender recording, kitchen display, and manager-approved voids and comps. The complete code base is offered under Apache-2.0 (README also states MIT OR Apache-2.0) with no hosted or paid tiers.", "technology_stack": ["Go", "React", "PostgreSQL", "Server-sent events", "ESC/POS network printing"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:pixsprint','Pixsprint','{"homepage": "https://pixsprint.app/", "id": "commercial:pixsprint", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方首页正文说明其把创作者作品、受众数据与合作报价汇入一个可分享的媒体资料包链接，并可查看浏览与点击；产品页进一步列出五个工作环节：汇集作品资产、添加手填或 Instagram 受众数据、编排媒体资料包、选择公开或密码保护分享、查看品牌兴趣。官方示例链接打开的是真实托管的创作者 kit 页面，含受众与互动指标、服务套餐、联系入口和分享按钮，证明工具主导的页面组装与可分发成品成立。", "slug": "creator-media-kit-builder", "source_urls": ["https://pixsprint.app/", "https://pixsprint.app/product", "https://studio.pixsprint.app/rafalbagrowski/gallery/freedom-redefined-the-open-road"]}], "name": "Pixsprint", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:55:48.124240+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "e61c1e54ef26de92169980678ccb18584c7341e908e60b2ec09ef265f3c122bb", "snapshot_path": "sources/e61c1e54ef26de92169980678ccb18584c7341e908e60b2ec09ef265f3c122bb.txt", "url": "https://pixsprint.app/"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:55:47.931107+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "7384be527074a0059929d7249036de2800b2d33591652fa17e9509b1e0a509d7", "snapshot_path": "sources/7384be527074a0059929d7249036de2800b2d33591652fa17e9509b1e0a509d7.txt", "url": "https://pixsprint.app/product"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:57:27.064518+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "24eb44b9e7f525d80bdea3a815a64c31b418996695ab9b0e8c5bfb1830109bcf", "snapshot_path": "sources/24eb44b9e7f525d80bdea3a815a64c31b418996695ab9b0e8c5bfb1830109bcf.txt", "url": "https://studio.pixsprint.app/rafalbagrowski/gallery/freedom-redefined-the-open-road"}], "summary": "面向创作者与摄影师的媒体资料包构建器：汇集作品与受众数据，编排作品、套餐与联系方式，生成可公开或密码保护分享的托管媒体资料包页面，并提供浏览与点击分析。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:iptor-ip1','Iptor IP1','{"homepage": "https://iptor.com/cloud/publishing", "id": "commercial:iptor-ip1", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方页面明确 IP1 面向出版商与图书分销商，提供 Title Management、Order Processing and Billing、Warehouse & Inventory Management、Returns Management 与 ISBN 管理，覆盖书目标题目录、订单处理、库存履约和退货等发行核心。", "slug": "book-distribution-management", "source_urls": ["https://iptor.com/cloud/publishing"]}], "name": "Iptor IP1", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T16:59:40.218286+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "70e2f4213dd0de983e84a2fd84a3257e5f89d4d222cf2a7a7244d55f878ea0f6", "snapshot_path": "sources/70e2f4213dd0de983e84a2fd84a3257e5f89d4d222cf2a7a7244d55f878ea0f6.txt", "url": "https://iptor.com/cloud/publishing"}], "summary": "面向出版商和图书分销商的出版业 ERP，覆盖书目标题管理、订单处理与开票、仓储库存、发货及退货管理等发行核心环节。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:1178344846','Moira','{"deployment": ["Single HTML file opened in a browser and distributable from a shared folder with a media subfolder", "Cloud sync through a Firebase/Firestore project; reporters collaborate in a real-time digital newsroom from any internet-connected machine, with a non-persistent local mode when unconfigured", "Optional radio or OBS playout from the browser"], "features": ["Persistent story records in Firestore with slug, format, reporter, presenter, duration, script and media file", "Real-time multi-user collaboration through Firestore, with per-browser anonymous sessions", "Producer-managed running order with drag-and-drop and up/down reordering", "Per-story on-air clock times accumulated from the bulletin TX start and story durations", "Live TX mode with On Air / Preview Next cards and backtime against the scheduled end", "Producer, Reporter and Presenter roles; per-newsroom story formats and rundown locking", "Floated stories kept in the rundown but excluded from the timed running order", "Presenter/autocue view and optional radio or OBS playout", "Trash and restore for deleted stories"], "github_repository_id": 1178344846, "homepage": "https://github.com/digitaldickinson/moira", "id": "github:1178344846", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "Official repository metadata and MIT license identify digitaldickinson/moira (GitHub id 1178344846). The README, setup guide, changelog and application source show a broadcast newsroom workflow: persistent story records with reporter and presenter assignments, a producer-managed running order that can be reordered, and per-story clock times plus backtime computed from the bulletin TX start and story durations. That covers the leaf''s work item, people-bound assignment and timed ordered broadcast rundown. Moira stops at rundown/playout and does not manage the public record, matching the leaf boundary. The match is scoped to the broadcast-bulletin realization.", "slug": "newsroom-management-system", "source_urls": ["https://api.github.com/repos/digitaldickinson/moira", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/digitaldickinson/moira/main/README.md", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/digitaldickinson/moira/main/CHANGELOG.md", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/digitaldickinson/moira/main/instructions/firestore.md", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/digitaldickinson/moira/main/moira.html"]}], "license": "MIT", "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/digitaldickinson/moira/license", "name": "Moira", "repository_url": "https://github.com/digitaldickinson/moira", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T17:00:46.224714+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "c19267d32d64767eb55c4944979ba7b20743e74d7ac1ffcde9446986ac4cb3ac", "snapshot_path": "sources/c19267d32d64767eb55c4944979ba7b20743e74d7ac1ffcde9446986ac4cb3ac.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/digitaldickinson/moira"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T17:02:23.859424+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "7f12b80d485ba0bebc054dc285d4367a547ea2b20aa77553450a0c0d8f58e84e", "snapshot_path": "sources/7f12b80d485ba0bebc054dc285d4367a547ea2b20aa77553450a0c0d8f58e84e.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/digitaldickinson/moira/license"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T17:00:49.182087+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "8f82715d113aed2928ee984b5c8ec8eefa7d54dc9d2bbee5534a93624f811234", "snapshot_path": "sources/8f82715d113aed2928ee984b5c8ec8eefa7d54dc9d2bbee5534a93624f811234.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/digitaldickinson/moira/main/LICENSE"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T17:00:47.721777+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "62b68862ed3b4c2a5f061f8a913f079419312a92bbf38bcb296bf1fe22e13f19", "snapshot_path": "sources/62b68862ed3b4c2a5f061f8a913f079419312a92bbf38bcb296bf1fe22e13f19.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/digitaldickinson/moira/main/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T17:02:25.106561+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "6b2220a0e0149c6d8ead2784dbf9dbdb1a6e756f527024a0df1ea3484e805ba1", "snapshot_path": "sources/6b2220a0e0149c6d8ead2784dbf9dbdb1a6e756f527024a0df1ea3484e805ba1.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/digitaldickinson/moira/main/CHANGELOG.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T17:05:37.894898+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "30fb28d1d8cb9dd8851d4c7695d9accb7f5798cfdd3b9579b47937810292cfab", "snapshot_path": "sources/30fb28d1d8cb9dd8851d4c7695d9accb7f5798cfdd3b9579b47937810292cfab.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/digitaldickinson/moira/main/instructions/firestore.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T17:02:27.080197+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "5460a8499d5995ed86a4cf4040a5a24d982dba4b01f5f1e6c4480ccd3621946e", "snapshot_path": "sources/5460a8499d5995ed86a4cf4040a5a24d982dba4b01f5f1e6c4480ccd3621946e.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/digitaldickinson/moira/main/moira.html"}], "summary": "Moira is a lightweight open-source newsroom computer system for broadcast bulletins, delivered as a single-page web app with a Firestore database. It keeps persistent story records with reporter/presenter assignment, format, duration and script; gives producers a running order they can drag or move up/down; and computes each story''s on-air clock time and the bulletin''s backtime from the TX start and story durations. It also provides live On Air/Preview Next views, a presenter/autocue view and optional radio or OBS playout.", "technology_stack": ["HTML/JavaScript single-page application", "Firebase Firestore", "Browser File System/media access", "Optional OBS and radio playout"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:1273553713','MIRL Provenance','{"deployment": ["静态文件自托管：直接打开 index.html，或用任意静态主机提供目录（README 示例为 python3 -m http.server）", "local-first：工作数据自动保存到浏览器，可另存/打开项目 JSON，并可在支持的 Chromium 浏览器中持续写入磁盘文件", "GitHub Pages 可运行；首次访问后由 service worker 缓存以支持离线使用"], "features": ["艺术品对象档案：记录标题（支持多文种与从右到左文本）、创作者或文化、对象类型、材料、原属地与原属社区、尺寸及可重复标识", "按日期记录的保管链：每个环节绑定持有人与转移方式，并标注为确证、可能或不确定；链中空白保留为空白而非补造", "目击记录：拍卖批次、经销商库存、博物馆入藏、展览与出版物均标注日期与来源，并标记为支持或质疑所述来源", "证据文件保存名称、缩略图与 sha-256 指纹，并按公开、受限、禁运分级；资料提供者身份仅以别名发布", "溯源缺口分析：以覆盖条展示保管链，并对 1933–1945 敏感期、分散事件、过短链条或未标日期环节发出警示", "归还主张及其法律依据（NAGPRA、UNESCO 1970、UNIDROIT 1995、海牙 1954 等），以及 CARE 笔记和 TK/BC 标签", "内部与公开呈现分离：公开克隆导出时隐藏受限/禁运证据与未发布地点；可导出赔偿档案、主张函、公开 HTML、Getty/ICOM Object ID JSON、CIDOC-CRM/JSON-LD、CSV"], "github_repository_id": 1273553713, "homepage": "https://mirl-ucsb.github.io/mirl-provenance/", "id": "github:1273553713", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "以已识别艺术品为对象档案，按日期记录保管/持有链事件并绑定持有人与时间；事件附来源与证据指纹，明确保留空白和不确定性，并提供内部/公开不同呈现，符合该叶的对象锚定事件链与证据-缺口核心。", "slug": "provenance-research-platform", "source_urls": ["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mirl-ucsb/mirl-provenance/main/README.md", "https://mirl-ucsb.github.io/mirl-provenance/"]}], "license": "MIT", "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mirl-ucsb/mirl-provenance/license", "name": "MIRL Provenance", "repository_url": "https://github.com/mirl-ucsb/mirl-provenance", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T17:03:50.454262+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "2e237ca47890ce8d11349091bd8a7c0c42bfc44734feda0b202e2317628c661c", "snapshot_path": "sources/2e237ca47890ce8d11349091bd8a7c0c42bfc44734feda0b202e2317628c661c.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mirl-ucsb/mirl-provenance"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T17:03:50.436892+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "e9c48639a74ec78a308257dfaf34847ddb13328fbf6ad2d8af97c2c54047ff83", "snapshot_path": "sources/e9c48639a74ec78a308257dfaf34847ddb13328fbf6ad2d8af97c2c54047ff83.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mirl-ucsb/mirl-provenance/license"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T17:03:50.241974+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "67f560890f7b495e6e6cf457e5228a93f091e7ce37426bdacca658450add9dd7", "snapshot_path": "sources/67f560890f7b495e6e6cf457e5228a93f091e7ce37426bdacca658450add9dd7.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mirl-ucsb/mirl-provenance/main/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T17:03:50.374393+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "292a05c34e4bc483efb9446355226830e06263942bea3c242bddd1ccf8c4a280", "snapshot_path": "sources/292a05c34e4bc483efb9446355226830e06263942bea3c242bddd1ccf8c4a280.txt", "url": "https://mirl-ucsb.github.io/mirl-provenance/"}], "summary": "加州大学圣塔芭芭拉分校 Material / Image Research Lab 的开源对象级溯源研究 Web 应用（MIT，活跃开发中）：以单件艺术品档案为中心，维护按日期的保管链（每节标注确证/可能/不确定并保留空白）、带来源的目击记录、sha-256 证据指纹、缺口分析与归还主张，并提供内部/公开分离的导出。以静态文件自托管，工作数据默认保存在浏览器本地。", "technology_stack": ["JavaScript", "HTML/CSS", "Service Worker", "CIDOC-CRM / JSON-LD", "OpenSeadragon"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:callboard-nz','Callboard','{"homepage": "https://callboard.nz/", "id": "commercial:callboard-nz", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方首页正文标题为 Theatre Production Management Software，Company feed 为整个 production 提供公告 feed，可按角色组 mention 并推送通知；Callsheets 依据场景与出场人员自动计算每个人的 call time 并只发送其所需信息；Rehearsal notes 自动汇编成可分发报告；Company & branding 提供 members、roles 与权限；脚本、日程、callsheets 集中于同一制作，覆盖四项核心。", "slug": "theater-production-management", "source_urls": ["https://callboard.nz/"]}], "name": "Callboard", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T17:06:22.033354+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "4e253648e81c66d4908b6ab1a53c13bb7e8dbaf2cad55bd5de57625227ad8dc6", "snapshot_path": "sources/4e253648e81c66d4908b6ab1a53c13bb7e8dbaf2cad55bd5de57625227ad8dc6.txt", "url": "https://callboard.nz/"}], "summary": "面向社区与专业剧团的剧院制作管理 Web 应用：以制作/剧团为单位集中管理脚本、排练与演出日程、个人呼叫单、通知和排练报告。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:cuecall','CueCall','{"homepage": "https://www.cuecall.app/", "id": "commercial:cuecall", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方首页正文标题为 Theatre Production Management，Show Management 说明可从 auditions 到 closing night 组织整个 production 并管理 scenes；Cast & Crew 记录 contact info、roles、availability、assignments；Scheduling & Signups 协调 rehearsals、performances、production meetings 并跟踪 conflicts/availability；Notes & Rehearsal Reports 一键发给制作团队，Theatre Companies 还提供跨演出人员名册；覆盖四项核心。", "slug": "theater-production-management", "source_urls": ["https://www.cuecall.app/"]}], "name": "CueCall", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T17:06:21.605004+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "e453353c2a956bd3d6e43b9f868ba2e568bb8d90cadfea46211f18338b3aa281", "snapshot_path": "sources/e453353c2a956bd3d6e43b9f868ba2e568bb8d90cadfea46211f18338b3aa281.txt", "url": "https://www.cuecall.app/"}], "summary": "面向舞台监督、导演与制作团队的剧院制作管理 Web 应用：围绕制作与场景管理选角、演员职员、排练/演出排期、报告和团队协作。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:virtualcallboard','VirtualCallboard','{"homepage": "https://www.virtualcallboard.com/", "id": "commercial:virtualcallboard", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方首页正文称其为 digital callboard and stage management software，可“manage all aspects of your production from one central location”，并明确支持实时发布 rehearsal schedules/notes/updates、向团队发 announcements、管理 production documents、掌握 cast and crew availability/conflicts、提交报告并跟踪评论，以及 email/TXT/push 通知；直接覆盖 production 容器、company、制作呼叫日程与面向全团的 callboard/沟通四项核心。", "slug": "theater-production-management", "source_urls": ["https://www.virtualcallboard.com/"]}], "name": "VirtualCallboard", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T17:05:35.890225+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "f9a7b4ae35d3f07baf3824d352ed3fb7358719f5bb14a0aa9015848c9d650af9", "snapshot_path": "sources/f9a7b4ae35d3f07baf3824d352ed3fb7358719f5bb14a0aa9015848c9d650af9.txt", "url": "https://www.virtualcallboard.com/"}], "summary": "面向剧院与学校的云端数字 callboard 与舞台监督制作管理应用：集中管理制作、演员与职员、排练/演出日程、通知与报告。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:sportmember','SportMember','{"homepage": "https://www.sportmember.com/", "id": "commercial:sportmember", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方会员页说明以单一会员数据库保存成员、球队、角色、家长关联与会员费，新成员通过报名链接/表单进入对应球队，教练仅管理本队；球队页说明球队成员名单与教练/球员/家长角色；费用页给出 Autumn season、mid-season 入会及按月/季/年计费、欠费可见并可暂停未付费成员参与；日历页说明赛季计划、活动报名/取消与报名截止。会员群体、球队/名册、赛季/报名周期、会员资金循环四类定义性核心均有官方正文证据。", "slug": "sports-club-management", "source_urls": ["https://www.sportmember.com/en/membership-management-software", "https://www.sportmember.com/en/cashless-payment-system-match-fee", "https://www.sportmember.com/en/team-app", "https://www.sportmember.com/en/online-calendar-for-sports-clubs"]}], "name": "SportMember", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T17:11:47.715129+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "ab5e17140ead4aea7f6633304db5bb1340240cf0763ae114205bb9b0f16b0c70", "snapshot_path": "sources/ab5e17140ead4aea7f6633304db5bb1340240cf0763ae114205bb9b0f16b0c70.txt", "url": "https://www.sportmember.com/"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T17:11:55.810090+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "c7d6a1e30d7cae34cfcf21d99a3d26433a56a4f987d9cb615da45104389bd3d2", "snapshot_path": "sources/c7d6a1e30d7cae34cfcf21d99a3d26433a56a4f987d9cb615da45104389bd3d2.txt", "url": "https://www.sportmember.com/en/membership-management-software"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T17:12:32.833684+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "a0bc134da90ddc16700c9971ae550688440d04292815f9378f5c90c863b72873", "snapshot_path": "sources/a0bc134da90ddc16700c9971ae550688440d04292815f9378f5c90c863b72873.txt", "url": "https://www.sportmember.com/en/cashless-payment-system-match-fee"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T17:12:35.316433+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "b309b77625020c571c250d2a0f3f08d50242ef42a01eff5c84d763e766a39053", "snapshot_path": "sources/b309b77625020c571c250d2a0f3f08d50242ef42a01eff5c84d763e766a39053.txt", "url": "https://www.sportmember.com/en/team-app"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T17:13:02.111577+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "66f67c5a43aa16fdaa154cf48b91331b94dc013415c38c9a0d383503fbed12af", "snapshot_path": "sources/66f67c5a43aa16fdaa154cf48b91331b94dc013415c38c9a0d383503fbed12af.txt", "url": "https://www.sportmember.com/en/online-calendar-for-sports-clubs"}], "summary": "商业云端体育俱乐部管理平台，面向体育俱乐部与协会，提供会员数据库、球队/部门与角色、赛季与报名、会费与比赛费用收取及欠费跟踪等运营功能。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:598537999','Gym Management System (Laravel)','{"deployment": ["自托管 PHP/Laravel Web 应用", "MySQL 数据库", "需配置 Web 服务器并运行 set:expired 定时任务"], "features": ["会员档案与会员编码", "会员计划目录：名称、天数、金额、所属服务", "会员×计划订阅：起止日期、续费标记、ongoing/expired/renewed/cancelled 状态", "发票与收款：总额、待收金额、未付/部分付/已付/超额支付状态", "订阅续费与取消操作", "定时命令将会员到期订阅置为 expired"], "github_repository_id": 598537999, "homepage": "https://github.com/zorenleolumosbog/gym-management-system-in-laravel", "id": "github:598537999", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "会员档案、计划目录、会员×计划订阅的起止与状态、发票/收款及欠款，以及续费、取消和到期置为 expired 的流程，构成在册会员、持有会籍与受控会费—状态周期的核心；应用为可自托管 Web 后台，不以排课或前台收银为主。", "slug": "fitness-membership-management", "source_urls": ["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zorenleolumosbog/gym-management-system-in-laravel/main/app/Member.php", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zorenleolumosbog/gym-management-system-in-laravel/main/app/Plan.php", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zorenleolumosbog/gym-management-system-in-laravel/main/app/Subscription.php", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zorenleolumosbog/gym-management-system-in-laravel/main/app/Invoice.php", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zorenleolumosbog/gym-management-system-in-laravel/main/app/Http/Controllers/SubscriptionsController.php", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zorenleolumosbog/gym-management-system-in-laravel/main/app/Console/Commands/SetExpired.php", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zorenleolumosbog/gym-management-system-in-laravel/main/app/Console/Kernel.php", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zorenleolumosbog/gym-management-system-in-laravel/main/app/Lubus/constants.php"]}], "license": "MIT", "license_evidence_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zorenleolumosbog/gym-management-system-in-laravel/main/LICENSE.md", "license_review": {"rationale": "仓库 LICENSE.md 保存完整 MIT 许可证正文，包含授权、版权声明与免责声明，并与 README 的 MIT 表述一致；按整仓库范围记录。", "reviewer": "opencode-go/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "scope": "repository", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zorenleolumosbog/gym-management-system-in-laravel/main/LICENSE.md", "spdx_id": "MIT"}, "name": "Gym Management System (Laravel)", "repository_url": "https://github.com/zorenleolumosbog/gym-management-system-in-laravel", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T17:12:51.193085+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "6d2e9c3406005b7e68ddf266935beb8bbb7d92ca7e128f75713f8a79918fa920", "snapshot_path": "sources/6d2e9c3406005b7e68ddf266935beb8bbb7d92ca7e128f75713f8a79918fa920.txt", "url": "https://github.com/zorenleolumosbog/gym-management-system-in-laravel"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T17:12:52.568332+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "5f719177609c3614ad4269d9a8ef0a91adeed0d139a69ebd26f356b8dc5dd78f", "snapshot_path": "sources/5f719177609c3614ad4269d9a8ef0a91adeed0d139a69ebd26f356b8dc5dd78f.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zorenleolumosbog/gym-management-system-in-laravel/main/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T17:12:53.899181+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "8f0642b3def4c71ed845084da47fc7e4e2dcc8a651ca3dcd685c9a6aa285c92f", "snapshot_path": "sources/8f0642b3def4c71ed845084da47fc7e4e2dcc8a651ca3dcd685c9a6aa285c92f.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zorenleolumosbog/gym-management-system-in-laravel/main/LICENSE.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T17:12:57.737598+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "e3caeeb7f93916ead88712b9dce228c48326932155d611b73fa4845eb312eaa0", "snapshot_path": "sources/e3caeeb7f93916ead88712b9dce228c48326932155d611b73fa4845eb312eaa0.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zorenleolumosbog/gym-management-system-in-laravel/main/app/Member.php"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T17:12:56.487932+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "28896368f9548b57a63033b39b22a075f5881522cdd88310cf11a6453ac5f7a6", "snapshot_path": "sources/28896368f9548b57a63033b39b22a075f5881522cdd88310cf11a6453ac5f7a6.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zorenleolumosbog/gym-management-system-in-laravel/main/app/Plan.php"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T17:12:55.179857+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "e14f1b4bc0a67d64f61e25b8f33c5299f46a73c0729894ccaf63afc345f33370", "snapshot_path": "sources/e14f1b4bc0a67d64f61e25b8f33c5299f46a73c0729894ccaf63afc345f33370.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zorenleolumosbog/gym-management-system-in-laravel/main/app/Subscription.php"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T17:12:59.043711+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "bd824519eaf41cd535debb845a8f8fc045e1ec304d8f6a0a951daad13c260e76", "snapshot_path": "sources/bd824519eaf41cd535debb845a8f8fc045e1ec304d8f6a0a951daad13c260e76.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zorenleolumosbog/gym-management-system-in-laravel/main/app/Invoice.php"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T17:13:00.454002+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "d9072fb526cc167a28818190e3d0d3c97cf6fbdb06e23be1d598af94f1238577", "snapshot_path": "sources/d9072fb526cc167a28818190e3d0d3c97cf6fbdb06e23be1d598af94f1238577.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zorenleolumosbog/gym-management-system-in-laravel/main/app/Http/Controllers/SubscriptionsController.php"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T17:13:01.729472+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "5c8d3c5d6992b89332c69356d0771369b430c757719ffeae79202eb7ab07e71c", "snapshot_path": "sources/5c8d3c5d6992b89332c69356d0771369b430c757719ffeae79202eb7ab07e71c.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zorenleolumosbog/gym-management-system-in-laravel/main/app/Console/Commands/SetExpired.php"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T17:14:49.531934+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "53c51bff5c8b69fd2992d36b7953a3796aadec8c8a86e07ce718fd7069d65e45", "snapshot_path": "sources/53c51bff5c8b69fd2992d36b7953a3796aadec8c8a86e07ce718fd7069d65e45.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zorenleolumosbog/gym-management-system-in-laravel/main/app/Console/Kernel.php"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T17:13:03.109375+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "f1b5935f238973c9727da7ab5a99560e920063eecc361d8f363e422e4ab55c6e", "snapshot_path": "sources/f1b5935f238973c9727da7ab5a99560e920063eecc361d8f363e422e4ab55c6e.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zorenleolumosbog/gym-management-system-in-laravel/main/app/Lubus/constants.php"}], "summary": "MIT 许可、可自托管的 Laravel Web 健身会籍管理应用，面向健身房运营方后台。会员档案与计划目录之外，以会员×计划的订阅记录保存起止日期和 ongoing/expired/renewed/cancelled 状态，并由发票、收款和欠款状态管理会费；提供续费、取消订阅和到期自动置为 expired 的命令。采用预付期限计划，不依赖自动定期扣款。", "technology_stack": ["PHP", "Laravel 5.1", "MySQL", "Blade"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:1198042797','Aegir','{"deployment": ["Next.js Web 应用，由 Next.js 进程提供页面", "Convex 后端部署，通过 NEXT_PUBLIC_CONVEX_URL 连接", "开发时需分别运行 Next.js 与 Convex 进程", "可部署到自有或云托管环境，未验证生产部署"], "features": ["创建和管理比赛（meet）及其队伍、赛事项目", "报名记录将学生绑定到一个或多个 meetEvent", "自动或手动编排 heats 与泳道", "录入计时、名次和积分，生成比赛 standings", "公开比赛页与 PDF 报名表/秩序册", "比赛归档、用户角色与公开访问 token"], "github_repository_id": 1198042797, "homepage": "https://github.com/TonyRoyze/aegir", "id": "github:1198042797", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "README 明确该项目是游泳比赛管理，维护 meet 的队伍/项目、报名、成绩、standings 和比赛文档；convex/schema.ts 进一步定义 meets、meetEvents、registrations（studentId 与 meetEventIds）、results（timing/rank/points）及 heatAssignments（heat/lane），对应运动会容器→项目→报名→逐项结果的核心闭环。", "slug": "sports-meet-management", "source_urls": ["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TonyRoyze/aegir/main/README.md", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TonyRoyze/aegir/main/convex/schema.ts", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TonyRoyze/aegir/main/docs/meet-configuration-migration.md", "https://github.com/TonyRoyze/aegir"]}], "license": "MIT", "license_evidence_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TonyRoyze/aegir/main/LICENSE", "license_review": {"rationale": "Raw LICENSE 为完整 MIT 文本，包含许可授予、版权声明与免责声明；仓库页面亦标注 MIT。", "reviewer": "opencode-go/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "scope": "repository", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TonyRoyze/aegir/main/LICENSE", "spdx_id": "MIT"}, "name": "Aegir", "repository_url": "https://github.com/TonyRoyze/aegir", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T17:14:57.187699+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "1c073cf115906f9fc934007186508d41da4b7b4238805f80b7b8b4ea5e8abb96", "snapshot_path": "sources/1c073cf115906f9fc934007186508d41da4b7b4238805f80b7b8b4ea5e8abb96.txt", "url": "https://github.com/TonyRoyze/aegir"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T17:14:56.091580+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "387bed0819bb2e008c3f0870a2cc770c3050752d594b08a93d7c1157a2f794a9", "snapshot_path": "sources/387bed0819bb2e008c3f0870a2cc770c3050752d594b08a93d7c1157a2f794a9.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TonyRoyze/aegir/main/README.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T17:14:56.073313+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "a64c480cf02947f24b46237c767a329338fa25915f8e0a49e141020f9c5098ac", "snapshot_path": "sources/a64c480cf02947f24b46237c767a329338fa25915f8e0a49e141020f9c5098ac.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TonyRoyze/aegir/main/LICENSE"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T17:14:56.093982+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "b6cc3e986b0a0c8801467f70836538b244c1d9acf979a62a2c9488212207edbc", "snapshot_path": "sources/b6cc3e986b0a0c8801467f70836538b244c1d9acf979a62a2c9488212207edbc.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TonyRoyze/aegir/main/docs/meet-configuration-migration.md"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T17:15:35.647747+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "7bfa17e31c1625076b6b2c46ea9e8889f8e13501f947c331aeda7d222111aef0", "snapshot_path": "sources/7bfa17e31c1625076b6b2c46ea9e8889f8e13501f947c331aeda7d222111aef0.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TonyRoyze/aegir/main/convex/schema.ts"}], "summary": "MIT 开源的游泳比赛管理 Web 应用：按比赛维护队伍与赛事项目，收集报名并将学生绑定到一个或多个项目，编排 heats/泳道，录入计时、名次与积分，生成 standings、公开比赛页和比赛 PDF；采用 Next.js 前端与 Convex 后端。", "technology_stack": ["Next.js 16", "React 19", "TypeScript", "Convex", "pdf-lib"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('github:12888993','Home Assistant','{"deployment": ["Home Assistant OS / Green 硬件", "Raspberry Pi / x86-64 自托管", "Container 或虚拟机安装"], "features": ["1000+ 品牌/服务集成与设备自动发现", "设备状态展示与仪表盘控制", "可编程自动化引擎", "本地控制与本地数据处理", "Assist 语音助手", "官方移动端应用"], "github_repository_id": 12888993, "homepage": "https://www.home-assistant.io/", "id": "github:12888993", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官网首页正文列出 1000+ 品牌/服务集成、自动发现设备、可定制仪表盘控制设备，以及日落开灯、回家开灯、车库门未关提醒等自动化示例；安装页说明 Home Assistant 运行在自有硬件上、断网时智能家居仍可工作；本轮补采的 Onboarding 官方文档进一步证明完整应用形态：安装后在浏览器中完成设置、创建 owner 管理员账户、进入默认仪表盘，并可按家庭位置/zone 配置自动化（日出开帘、离家启动扫地机）。三结构齐备：家庭异构设备系统、设备状态读取与控制、无需每次手动命令的自动化。", "slug": "smart-home-platform", "source_urls": ["https://www.home-assistant.io/", "https://www.home-assistant.io/installation/", "https://www.home-assistant.io/getting-started/onboarding/", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/home-assistant/core/dev/README.rst"]}], "license": "Apache-2.0", "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/home-assistant/core/license", "name": "Home Assistant", "repository_url": "https://github.com/home-assistant/core", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-27T02:38:43.499851+08:00", "kind": "repository_metadata", "sha256": "74929f140e384be242d12d6659721c1a4b5c8ce8ccf993853b7d68be05412a46", "snapshot_path": "sources/74929f140e384be242d12d6659721c1a4b5c8ce8ccf993853b7d68be05412a46.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/home-assistant/core"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-27T02:39:23.169381+08:00", "kind": "license", "sha256": "5f5c90c5643fb5d7c1181521fab1732d0c2d4db845d3ffecbfe341f292ec8e4a", "snapshot_path": "sources/5f5c90c5643fb5d7c1181521fab1732d0c2d4db845d3ffecbfe341f292ec8e4a.txt", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/home-assistant/core/license"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-27T02:39:29.740427+08:00", "kind": "readme", "sha256": "7cd3c381536b6d26371f921d730242c6162fc3fa840bf8e9418409f8b482e7cb", "snapshot_path": "sources/7cd3c381536b6d26371f921d730242c6162fc3fa840bf8e9418409f8b482e7cb.txt", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/home-assistant/core/dev/README.rst"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-27T02:39:23.322988+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "57ac444b072cb457805498545ad778734e2eb364af41720e24a8ec1e73cf118b", "snapshot_path": "sources/57ac444b072cb457805498545ad778734e2eb364af41720e24a8ec1e73cf118b.txt", "url": "https://www.home-assistant.io/"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-27T02:41:18.404062+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "5b21ac8b3fae816c651dc4a5248ca787b327dca60bad6b3fcbd28cab8c0c1fae", "snapshot_path": "sources/5b21ac8b3fae816c651dc4a5248ca787b327dca60bad6b3fcbd28cab8c0c1fae.txt", "url": "https://www.home-assistant.io/installation/"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T17:17:36.553691+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "b26049b94a09e53604fd48680d8fa3d1ab9749d7629a8e024b73f41731710d97", "snapshot_path": "sources/b26049b94a09e53604fd48680d8fa3d1ab9749d7629a8e024b73f41731710d97.txt", "url": "https://www.home-assistant.io/getting-started/onboarding/"}], "summary": "开源家庭自动化平台：将多品牌设备集成到一个自托管系统，读取并控制设备状态，通过仪表盘和自动化按时间、设备事件和在场状态执行家庭行为，并保持本地控制。", "technology_stack": ["Python", "模块化集成架构"], "track": "open_source", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
INSERT INTO "application" VALUES('commercial:elevatorplus','ElevatorPlus','{"homepage": "https://www.elevatorplus.app/", "id": "commercial:elevatorplus", "leaf_matches": [{"reason": "官方 AMC 页面说明合同挂在单部电梯记录上，可跨建筑/站点，按合同范围与频次生成预防维护访问并保留逐梯服务历史；故障页面说明报修登记、自动派工及按电梯/建筑/故障类型保留历史；检查页面说明逐梯检查周期、ASME A17.1 检查表、证书存档与合规看板。正文覆盖客户建筑→输送单元、AMC 驱动周期维护、回呼记录与合规循环，符合本类型定义性核心；合同计费周期及按合同归集备件/费用亦见 AMC 页面。", "slug": "elevator-service-management", "source_urls": ["https://www.elevatorplus.app/", "https://www.elevatorplus.app/features/amc-management", "https://www.elevatorplus.app/features/inspection-management", "https://www.elevatorplus.app/features/breakdown-management"]}], "name": "ElevatorPlus", "runtime_tested": false, "sources": [{"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T17:18:23.734367+08:00", "kind": "homepage", "sha256": "786ef2b5c30a81749e1c5f94833bda6c680010a8f1c38ccdd3af77bcc4836500", "snapshot_path": "sources/786ef2b5c30a81749e1c5f94833bda6c680010a8f1c38ccdd3af77bcc4836500.txt", "url": "https://www.elevatorplus.app/"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T17:18:23.514181+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "a6879a636fb59c003af24863d0f60fee1cc78106becdbb168282f3fdb7c1f26e", "snapshot_path": "sources/a6879a636fb59c003af24863d0f60fee1cc78106becdbb168282f3fdb7c1f26e.txt", "url": "https://www.elevatorplus.app/features/amc-management"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T17:18:35.283566+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "2acae54395fed76f1ab2bb4dc652aeb64ddde74aa9576d9d4dbdbcf3b8e8fdc7", "snapshot_path": "sources/2acae54395fed76f1ab2bb4dc652aeb64ddde74aa9576d9d4dbdbcf3b8e8fdc7.txt", "url": "https://www.elevatorplus.app/features/inspection-management"}, {"fetched_at": "2026-10-29T17:18:35.262431+08:00", "kind": "documentation", "sha256": "ef0303664401547ff598ae94f4b68b1f6f06762fa20e91a223735ae5b75f03f6", "snapshot_path": "sources/ef0303664401547ff598ae94f4b68b1f6f06762fa20e91a223735ae5b75f03f6.txt", "url": "https://www.elevatorplus.app/features/breakdown-management"}], "summary": "面向电梯与自动扶梯服务承包商的商业云端管理软件：按客户/站点下的单部电梯建立档案，AMC 合同（全面、半全面、POG 等）驱动预防维护排程与续约提醒，故障报修可经二维码或客户端登记并自动派工、保留单元级故障与维修历史，按电梯跟踪检查到期、ASME A17.1 检查表与检查证书，并按合同归集备件与费用。", "track": "commercial", "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed"}');
